ocs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"**来源（Origin）。** 改变状态的请求（`GET`、`HEAD`、`OPTIONS` 以外）和 WebSocket，如果带 `Origin`，它必须是页面自己的来源或列在 `server.allowed_origins` 中，否则返回 403 `bad_origin`；没有 `Origin` 但 `Sec-Fetch-Site` 表明是跨站请求时同样拒绝。curl、Python 等非浏览器客户端不带这些头，不受影响。`server.allowed_origins` 非空时服务器还会为这些来源开启 CORS。","locale":"zh-CN"},"177":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-175","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"**访问令牌。** 设置了 `server.access_token` 时，`/api/`、`/ws/`、`/v1/`、`/openapi.json` 和 `/docs` 下的每个请求都要带上令牌，否则返回 401 `auth_required`。唯一的例外是 `GET /api/v1/app/health`。令牌可以用以下任一方式提供：","locale":"zh-CN"},"178":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-176","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"179":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-177","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"180":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-178","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"Bearer 头","locale":"zh-CN"},"181":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-179","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"`Authorization: Bearer <令牌>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"182":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-180","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"Cookie","locale":"zh-CN"},"183":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-181","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"`mizuoto_token=<令牌>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"184":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-182","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"查询参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"185":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-183","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"`?token=<令牌>`（浏览器里的 WebSocket 无法加请求头时使用）","locale":"zh-CN"},"186":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-184","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"socket.io 连接","locale":"zh-CN"},"187":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-185","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"`auth={\"token\": \"<令牌>\"}`","locale":"zh-CN"},"188":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-186","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"网页界面遇到 401 时会弹出 **访问令牌** 对话框，要求输入一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"189":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-187","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#访问控制","content":"用 `--host 0.0.0.0` 绑定后，服务器会在日志里提醒它可以被其他机器访问，但并不强制要求令牌。接口能删除文件、下载模型、读取服务器上的音频，请设置访问令牌，或放在防火墙、VPN、带身份验证的反向代理之后。","locale":"zh-CN"},"190":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-188","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"下面这些路由会读写服务器磁盘上的任意位置，只接受**服务器本机的浏览器**（客户端地址和请求的主机名都是本机回环地址），否则返回 403 `not_local`。通过隧道或同机反向代理转发的请求不算本机。","locale":"zh-CN"},"191":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-189","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"路由","locale":"zh-CN"},"192":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-190","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"193":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-191","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"`GET /audio/browse`、`POST /audio/files/paths`","locale":"zh-CN"},"194":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-192","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"浏览、登记服务器上的音频文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"195":{"id":"/docs/advanced-api-193","page_id":"/docs/advanced-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-api#只能在本机使用的路由","content":"`POST /models/identify`、`POST /models/import