ocale":"zh-CN"},"650":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-79","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#任务在哪里运行","content":"`False`（默认，与命令行相同）","locale":"zh-CN"},"651":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-80","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#任务在哪里运行","content":"带 `wait=True` 的调用在当前线程里运行任务，返回时任务已经结束。运行中按 Ctrl+C 会取消任务（返回 `state == \"cancelled\"` 的任务）。不带 `wait` 提交的任务**不会运行**，因为没有调度器","locale":"zh-CN"},"652":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-81","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#任务在哪里运行","content":"`True`（与服务器相同）","locale":"zh-CN"},"653":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-82","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#任务在哪里运行","content":"启动调度器和空闲模型的卸载。不带 `wait` 的调用把任务放进队列并立即返回，按 GPU 等资源排队；用 `s.jobs.wait(job.id, timeout)` 等它结束","locale":"zh-CN"},"654":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-83","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#事件","content":"`events.subscribe(handler)` 注册一个回调，返回取消订阅的函数。回调在产生事件的线程里被调用，应当尽快返回。事件类型与 socket 推送的相同（见 HTTP 接口），定义在 `mizuoto.core.events.models`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"655":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-84","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#错误","content":"失败时抛出 `mizuoto.core.errors.MizuotoError` 的子类，与接口返回的错误一一对应：","locale":"zh-CN"},"656":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-85","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#错误","content":"注意任务**运行中**的失败不抛异常：`speak(..., wait=True)` 返回 `state == \"failed\"` 的任务，原因在 `job.error`（`code`、`message`、`detail`）。抛异常的是运行前就能发现的问题（模型不存在、参数不合法、未接受许可等）。错误代码见 HTTP 接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"657":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-86","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#嵌入服务器","content":"`MizuotoServer` 在你的程序里启动与 `mizuoto webui` 相同的服务器：同样的接口、网页界面和任务。宿主程序可以决定数据和设置放在哪里、哪些设置不允许修改、界面挂在哪个路径下。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6