izuoto，而不再开一个端口：","locale":"zh-CN"},"722":{"id":"/docs/advanced-embed-151","page_id":"/docs/advanced-embed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-embed#挂载到已有的-fastapi-应用","content":"宿主要在自己的事件循环上进入子应用的 `lifespan`（它负责把事件转发到 socket），并在退出时调用 `services.close()`。`start_background=True` 启动任务调度器和空闲模型的卸载，没有它，排队的任务不会运行。`create_app` 还接受 `extra_hosts`（一个集合，之后加入的名称立即生效）和 `serve_ui=False`（只提供接口）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"723":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"page","content":"引擎详解","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","进阶"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-engines","locale":"zh-CN"},"724":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-0","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines","content":"逐个介绍 Mizuoto 内置的八个语音合成引擎和语音识别引擎：模型目录、能力、音色方式、语言、许可、训练方法和各自需要安装什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"725":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-1","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-engines#一览","content":"一览","locale":"zh-CN"},"726":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-2","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-engines#各引擎需要什么","content":"各引擎需要什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"727":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-3","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-engines#许可","content":"许可","locale":"zh-CN"},"728":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-4","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"Qwen3-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"729":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-5","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"CosyVoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"730":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-6","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/advanced-engines#f5-tts","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"731":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-7","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/doc