docs/advanced-engines-146","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"2.4 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"871":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-147","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"4 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"872":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-148","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"`qwen3tts/1.7b-voice-design`","locale":"zh-CN"},"873":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-149","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"VoiceDesign（按描述设计）","locale":"zh-CN"},"874":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-150","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"4.3 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"875":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-151","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"6.5 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"876":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-152","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"877":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-153","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**能力**：Base 有 **克隆音色**、**无文本克隆**；CustomVoice 有 **预置说话人**、**指令**（0.6B 没有指令：上游会静默忽略，所以 Mizuoto 不声明）；VoiceDesign 有 **按描述设计**。所有变体都支持 **流式输出**（逐帧，在 GPU 上约 0.3 秒后输出第一段音频）、**批量**（每批最多 8 条）和 **种子**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"878":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-154","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**预置说话人**：aiden、dylan、eric、ono_anna、ryan、serena、sohee、uncle_fu、vivian。","locale":"zh-CN"},"879":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-155","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**语言**：zh、en、de、it、pt、es、ja、ko、fr、ru。","locale":"zh-CN"},"880":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-156","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**参考音频**：1–30 秒，采样率至少 16 kHz（推荐 3–20 秒）。带上文本时更贴近原音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"881":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-157","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**长文本**：上游不切分长文本，由 Mizuoto 分段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"882":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-158","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**训练**：**Teach it a speaker**（`speaker`，仅 1.7B Base）：上游的单说话人微调（`sft_12hz.py`，在 Mizuoto 中重新实现），Base 学会数据集的音色，导出为以它为预置说话人的 CustomVoice 新模型。几分钟的单人语音即可；1.7B 需要 24 GB 以上显存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"883":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-159","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#qwen3-tts","content":"**加载选项**：注意力按注意力设置选择。`fused_projections`（默认关闭）是快速模式：每层的 q/k/v 与 gate/up 投影各合并为一次矩阵乘法，在 GPU 上再快几个百分点，但音频不再与原实现逐位一致（输出参数中会标注 `fused_projections`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"884":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-160","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"阿里通义的 LLM + 流匹配语音合成。适合：低延迟的逐 token 流式播放、边写边说（流式文本输入）、把一段录音转换成另一个音色，以及方言、情绪和语速指令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"885":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-161","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"886":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-162","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"887":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-163","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-engines#cosyvoice","content":"大小","locale":"zh-CN"},"888":{"id":"/docs/advanced-engines-164","page_id":"/docs/advanced-engin