s/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"第一次启动且没有令牌时，agent 生成一个随机令牌，保存为 `remote.agent.token`，并在终端上打印：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1417":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-55","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"第二行列出在那里可用的引擎。之后再启动会沿用保存的令牌；想查看它，打开那台机器的 `settings.toml`（`mizuoto config path`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1418":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-56","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"监听非本机地址又没有 TLS 时，agent 会警告：","locale":"zh-CN"},"1419":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-57","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"agent 在前台运行，直到 Ctrl+C。它自己的空闲卸载、显存处理等遵循那台机器的设置（`compute.*`、`engines.<id>.*`）。端口被占用时启动失败，提示换一个 `--port`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1420":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-58","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#agent提供引擎的机器","content":"需要接受许可的引擎（Fish Speech、IndexTTS）：在 agent 上安装它们的包（`mizuoto-fishspeech`、`mizuoto-indextts`），并在下载模型前在 agent 上接受许可（`mizuoto engine accept-licence <id>`）；在主机上合成前，主机上也要接受。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1421":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-59","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"参数或选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"1422":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-60","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"说明","locale":"zh-CN"},"1423":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-61","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"`NAME`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1424":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-62","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"简短的名称，引擎的设备里会用到（`gpu-box/cuda:0`）；不能为空，不能含 `/` 或 `.`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1425":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-63","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"`ADDRESS`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1426":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-64","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"agent 的 `host` 或 `host:port`（端口默认 7870），IPv6 写作 `[::1]:7870`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1427":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-65","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"`--token`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1428":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-66","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"agent 的令牌。修改已有主机时不给出则保留原来的令牌","locale":"zh-CN"},"1429":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-67","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"`--tls`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1430":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-68","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"agent 使用 TLS","locale":"zh-CN"},"1431":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-69","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"`--ca-file`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1432":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-70","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"CA 证书包；agent 用自签名证书时给出它自己的证书","locale":"zh-CN"},"1433":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-71","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"`--json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1434":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-72","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"打印 JSON","locale":"zh-CN"},"1435":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-73","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"添加后立即连接一次：在线时打印 agent 的机器名、Mizuoto 版本、设备和已安装的引擎；连不上时仍会保存，并说明状态（`offline` 或 `refused`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1436":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-74","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"**设置** › **远程主机** › **添加主机**，填写 **名称**、**地址**、**令牌**，需要时打开 **TLS** 并填写 **本机上的 CA 文件**，点 **添加**。修改已有主机时 **令牌** 留空则保留已保存的令牌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1437":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-75","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"列表中每台主机显示状态（**在线**、**离线**、**被拒绝**）、**设备**、**已安装的引擎** 和 **使用它的引擎**；**重新检查** 立即重新连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"1438":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-76","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"状态","locale":"zh-CN"},"1439":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-77","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"1440":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-78","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"`online`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1441":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-79","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"握手成功","locale":"zh-CN"},"1442":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-80","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"`offline`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1443":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-81","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"连不上（地址、端口、防火墙，或 agent 没有运行），或 TLS 设置与 agent 不一致","locale":"zh-CN"},"1444":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-82","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"`refused`","locale":"zh-CN"},"1445":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-83","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/advanced-remote#添加主机","content":"能连上，但令牌不对，或两边的协议版本不同","locale":"zh-CN"},"1446":{"id":"/docs/advanced-remote-84","page_id":"/docs/advanced-remote","tags":