x","locale":"zh-CN"},"2750":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-85","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#调用点与参照计算","content":"Fish Speech 的快速 transformer（`fishspeech.fast`）、IndexTTS 的 perceiver（`indextts.perceiver`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"2751":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-86","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#调用点与参照计算","content":"在分数中加入相对位置、或需要概率矩阵的注意力不是调用点：wenet 的相对位置注意力、IndexTTS 的 Conformer、w2v-BERT、VITS，以及 s3tokenizer（q 和 k 各乘 d^-¼）、MelStyle 和 G2PW 的 BERT。没有融合内核能计算它们，所以保持手写。`Site(swappable=False)` 让一个调用点无论什么策略都使用参照计算；`approx_ok=False` 拒绝所有非精确的后端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2752":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-87","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"设置","locale":"zh-CN"},"2753":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-88","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"取值","locale":"zh-CN"},"2754":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-89","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"默认","locale":"zh-CN"},"2755":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-90","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"`compute.attention`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2756":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-91","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"`auto`、`fast`、`sdpa`、`math`、`sdpa_flash`、`sdpa_efficient`、`sdpa_cudnn`、`flash`、`xformers`、`sage`、`sage3`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2757":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-92","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"`auto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"2758":{