lopment-acceleration#策略","content":"**`auto` 什么都不绑定**：`attention()` 读一次上下文变量，发现没有策略，就调用该调用点的参照计算（每次约 1 微秒）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2768":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-103","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"否则，模型的 `AccelPolicy` 在加载时确定（`policy_for(name, strict)`：每个取值一个，模型之间共享选择结果），并作为 `LoadedModelInfo.attention` 报告。`LocalHandle` 在请求的每一步用 `RequestContext.accel` 绑定它（上下文变量定义在 `runtime/context.py`，所以绑定时不会加载 torch），因此在两步之间挂起的流不会把策略泄露给别的线程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2769":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-104","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"训练阶段在整个进程范围绑定策略（`dispatch.PROCESS_POLICY`），因为 autograd 在自己的线程上运行反向传播以及梯度检查点重算的前向。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2770":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-105","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#策略","content":"修改对之后加载的模型生效；修改 `engines.<id>.attention` 会卸载该引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"2771":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-106","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"2772":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-107","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"来源","locale":"zh-CN"},"2773":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-108","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"2774":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-109","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端链","content":"精度","locale":"zh-CN"},"2775":{"id":"/docs/development-acceleration-110","page_id":"/docs/development-acceleration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-acceleration#后端与后端