ine","content":"依据 `spec`（`model_id`、`model_dir`、`variant`、`device`、`dtype`、`options`）构建模型，返回一个 `LoadedEngine`；用 `ctx.progress(\"loading:<部分>\")` 汇报，各部分之间调用 `ctx.check_cancel()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3789":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-83","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#engine","content":"`call(op, payload, ctx)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3790":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-84","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#engine","content":"不需要已加载模型的操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"3791":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-85","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"一个已加载的模型。它不可重入：任务调度器一次只给它一个请求（`engine:<引擎>:<设备>` 资源）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3792":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-86","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3793":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-87","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"必需","locale":"zh-CN"},"3794":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-88","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"3795":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-89","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"`describe()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3796":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-90","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"3797":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-91","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"返回 `Description`：采样率、能力、说话人、语言、显存、`ignored_params`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3798":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-92","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"`synthesize(task, ctx)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3799":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-93","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"3800":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-94","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"生成器：每准备好一段就 `yield AudioChunk(samples, sample_rate, segment, final)`，每一步都调用 `ctx.check_cancel()`；把实际使用的值记进 `ctx.applied`，警告用 `ctx.warn()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3801":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-95","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"`prepare_voice(voice, cache_dir, ctx)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3802":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-96","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"把派生的音色状态（提示码、嵌入）写进 `cache_dir`，以 `VoiceCache(files, meta)` 返回；之后的请求在 `VoiceSpec.cache` 里拿到这些文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"3803":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-97","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"`convert(task, ctx)`、`edit(task, ctx)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3804":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-98","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"音色转换和语音编辑，同样是生成器；默认抛出 `Unsupported`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3805":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-99","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"`call(op, payload, ctx)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3806":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-100","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"清单 `ops` 里列出的操作（ASR 的 `transcribe`、Fish Speech 的 `codec_encode` / `codec_decode`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3807":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-101","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"`memory_required(task)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3808":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-102","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"一个请求在权重之外需要的设备内存字节数；模型管理器会为它腾地方","locale":"zh-CN"},"3809":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-103","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"`close()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3810":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-104","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"丢弃权重（管理器已经把句柄从设备上移走了）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3811":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-105","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#loadedengine","content":"引擎返回模型自身采样率下、范围在 `[-1, 1]` 的 float32 单声道音频，从不编码：拼接、归一化、重采样和编码都是核心的事。它收到的是解析好的、确实存在的绝对路径（参考音频是 `cache/refs/` 里的 16 位 WAV），从不下载。核心已经对照清单校验过请求，所以引擎只做映射，不做检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3812":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-106","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"请求和结果都是 `mizuoto/core/inference/tasks.py` 里的标准库数据类，由 `mizuoto.runtime.engine` 重新导出：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3813":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-107","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"类型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3814":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-108","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3815":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-109","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`SynthesisTask`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3816":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-110","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`text`、`language`、`voice`、`style`（`instruct`、`emotion`）、`params`（按 Mizuoto 名称的通用参数）、`options`（引擎选项）、`texts`（批处理）、`segment` / `segments`、`stream`、`text_stream`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3817":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-111","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`VoiceSpec`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3818":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-112","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`references`（`Reference`：`audio_path`、`transcript`、`language`、`sample_rate`、`duration`）、`preset`、`description`、`attributes`、`weights`、`cache`、`voice_id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3819":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-113","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`VoiceConversionTask`、`SpeechEditTask`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3820":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-114","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"源音频和音色；音频、其文本和若干 `EditSpan`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3821":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-115","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`LoadSpec`、`Description`、`AudioChunk`、`VoiceCache`、`OptionSpec`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3822":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-116","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#任务类型","content":"`load` 收到的、`describe` 返回的、音频、音色缓存、选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"3823":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-117","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型句柄","content":"每个带权重的模块都包进一个 `ModelHandle`，列在 `self.handles` 里，模型管理器才能安放它、移走它并报告它的大小：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3824":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-118","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型句柄","content":"用 `ops.default` 搭建模块（不做随机初始化），用 `mizuoto.runtime.loading`（`load_state_dict`、严格的 `load_into`）加载权重，参数保持 `nn.Module` 创建时的样子。每个随机数都从 `ctx.generator_for(device)` 或 `ctx.rng` 取，并按上游的顺序抽取（见运行时）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3825":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-119","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#模型句柄","content":"用 `mizuoto.runtime.accel.attention(q, k, v, site=SITE, …)` 计算注意力，不要直接调用 `F.scaled_dot_product_attention`（架构测试会禁止）：每个调用点声明一次 `SITE = accel.Site(\"<id>.<部分>\")`，并传入上游传给 SDPA 的参数（`causal` 就是它的 `is_causal`）。上游手写注意力的调用点把那段代码作为 `reference`；只能由参照计算的调用点设为 `swappable=False`（在分数中加入相对位置的注意力根本不是调用点，仍是手写代码）。调用点按某种结构（单侧填充、因果、窗口）构建掩码时，同时传入 `mask_info`，让更快的内核也能处理这次调用（加速）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3826":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-120","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#错误","content":"抛出 `EngineError(message, detail, code=codes.…)`，错误码取自 `mizuoto.core.codes`（`invalid_input`、`capability_not_supported`、`model_missing` 等）；把解决问题的命令放进 `detail[\"hint\"]`。`Unsupported(message)` 就是 `capability_not_supported`。核心依据错误码还原领域错误；内存不足和其他异常会自动映射。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3827":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-121","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#3-注册","content":"运行时按 id 找实现（`mizuoto/runtime/engine.py` 的 `get_engine`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3828":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-122","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#3-注册","content":"**在本发行包里**：把引擎加进 `BUILTIN`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3829":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-123","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#3-注册","content":"**在单独的发行包里**（许可证不允许随 `mizuoto` 发布，即决策 D1）：在它的 `pyproject.toml` 里把类注册到入口点组 `mizuoto.engines`，依赖 `mizuoto`，并在 `mizuoto/core/inference/service.py` 的 `DISTRIBUTIONS` 里加上引擎 id → 发行包名，这样缺少安装时能按名字报告。Fish Speech 的写法：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3830":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-124","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#3-注册","content":"入口点每个进程只读一次：装上这样的发行包后要重启 Mizuoto。它的包遵守引擎的规则并与清单一致（`check_native_package`、`check_options_mirror`，由它的 `tests/test_<id>_package.py` 调用），版本号在 `mizuoto_<id>/version.py`，适用的 Mizuoto 版本写在它的 `pyproject.toml` 里（`check_gated_distribution`），由 CI 的 `gated` 和 `oldest-mizuoto` 作业检查，由 `scripts/build_wheels.py native` 构建（见发布）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3831":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-125","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#3-注册","content":"当 torch 能导入（dummy 引擎不需要）且实现已注册时，引擎就是*可用*的；否则 `EngineStatus.missing` 写明缺什么，界面和 `mizuoto doctor` 给出解决办法。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3832":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-126","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#4-测试","content":"`tests/engines_native/test_<id>_tiny.py` 在临时目录里搭一个与引擎结构相同、权重随机的小模型（配置文件、字节级词表、测试自己写出的 safetensors），在 CPU 上走真实的代码路径：加载、音色提示及其缓存、解码、批处理、可重复的种子、取消。不下载任何权重，所以 CI 每次推送都跑（CPU 版 torch）。`test_omnivoice_tiny.py` 是一个完整的例子；训练器有 `test_<id>_train_tiny.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3833":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-127","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#4-测试","content":"`tests/engines/test_contract.py`（标记 `engine` 和 `weights`，默认排除）对可用引擎的每个已安装目录模型，走完整的链路（规划 → 任务 → 运行时 → 引擎）：`describe` 与清单一致；声明的每种音色模式都能发声、采样率正确、时长与文本相称、说的是那段文本（装了 ASR 时，词错误率低于 0.35）；种子可复现；两段能正确切分；中途取消能让引擎停下；不留下任何进程级状态。新引擎的 id 要加进套件里 `engines` 设置覆盖的列表。见测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3834":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-128","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#4-测试","content":"Mizuoto 对移植的标准是：在 CPU 上以 fp32、带种子运行时，输出与上游实现完全相同。对于 Mizuoto 0.1 已有的引擎，`scripts/parity/` 让同样的用例分别走 0.1 的链路和原生链路，逐采样比较（见测试）。移植复现了什么、哪里有偏差、对照结果如何，记在引擎参考中该引擎的页面（`site/content/docs/engines-<id>.mdx` 与 `.en.mdx`）；以后的改动不能破坏的规则记在 `AGENTS.md`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3835":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-129","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#4-测试","content":"先看随机数：上游可能在构建模型或准备参考音频时抽过随机数（HuBERT 的层丢弃、IndexTTS 的 w2v-BERT、CosyVoice 3 的声码器噪声），或者是对跨步不同的张量抽的。再看张量形状和内核：SDPA 带不带掩码、掩码的精度、是否连续、CPU 线程数。`AGENTS.md` §2b 按引擎逐一列出了这类发现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3836":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-130","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`mizuoto/engines/omnivoice/`（总共约 2900 行）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3837":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-131","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"3838":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-132","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"3839":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-133","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`engine.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3840":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-134","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`OmniVoiceEngine` 和 `LoadedOmniVoice`：加载、音色提示、迭代解码、长文本分块、解码与后处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"3841":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-135","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`model.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3842":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-136","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"基于 `mizuoto.runtime.lm.qwen` 解码器的扩散语言模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"3843":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-137","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`audio_tokenizer.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3844":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-138","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"HiggsAudio v2 分词器：`nn/codecs/dac`、`nn/ssl/hubert`、残差码本","locale":"zh-CN"},"3845":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-139","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`audio.py`、`text.py`、`duration.py`、`voice_design.py`、`lang_map.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3846":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-140","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"按 pydub 的算法去静音和淡入淡出；文本分块与标点；时长估计；由设计属性生成指令；语言名称","locale":"zh-CN"},"3847":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-141","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`train.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3848":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-142","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"`OmniVoiceTrainer`：`full` 和 `lora` 两种方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"3849":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-143","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"从中可以看到：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3850":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-144","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**加载**：`OmniVoiceModel(config, ops.default)` 由 `load_into(model, load_state_dict(folder / \"model.safetensors\"))` 填充，再转成目标精度（GPU 支持 bf16 就用 bf16，否则 fp16；CPU 上 fp32；明确设置的 `engines.omnivoice.dtype` 优先）；音频分词器同样处理；文本分词器来自 `mizuoto.text.tokenize.bpe.load_bpe(folder)`；两个句柄。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3851":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-145","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**参数映射**：Mizuoto 的通用参数名映射到上游的生成配置（`num_steps → num_step`、`temperature → class_temperature`），其余由引擎选项填充。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3852":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-146","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**三种音色模式**：有参考音频 → 音色提示；有属性 → 由 `instruct_from(attributes)` 生成的指令；都没有 → 模型自己的声音。自由文本描述会抛出 `capability_not_supported`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3853":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-147","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**音色缓存**：`prepare_voice` 把提示存成 `prompt.pt`；`synthesize` 优先用 `voice.cache[\"prompt\"]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3854":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-148","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**随机数**：Gumbel 噪声从 `ctx.generator_for(self.device)` 抽取；HuBERT 的层丢弃抽样（上游在评估模式下也会抽）从 `ctx.generator_for(\"cpu\")` 抽取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3855":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-149","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**取消与进度**：每个解码步调用 `ctx.check_cancel()`，之后 `ctx.progress(\"generating\", …)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3856":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-150","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**批处理**：设置了 `task.texts` 时，所有文本放进一批，各自以 `segment = task.segment + index` 产出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3857":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-151","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"**内存**：`memory_required` 按批中每行估算 logits 所需的工作内存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3858":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-152","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#omnivoice-实例","content":"OmniVoice 的引擎页面记录了对照结果（在 CPU 上以 fp32 运行时，克隆、设计、自身音色和微调模型都与 0.1 完全相同）以及做到完全一致所需的细节。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3859":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-153","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#清单一个新引擎要动哪些地方","content":"`mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/<id>.toml`；运行 `dev.py model-manifests <id>`；需要接受许可时，把许可全文放进 `manifests/licences/`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3860":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-154","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#清单一个新引擎要动哪些地方","content":"`mizuoto/engines/<id>/`（或 `packages/native/<id>/`）：`OPTION_SCHEMA` 与清单一致的 `Engine` 子类、它的 `LoadedEngine` 和所需的模块；可共用的部分放进 `mizuoto/nn` 或 `mizuoto/runtime`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3861":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-155","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#清单一个新引擎要动哪些地方","content":"注册：`mizuoto/runtime/engine.py` 的 `BUILTIN`，或 `mizuoto.engines` 入口点加 `DISTRIBUTIONS`。`mizuoto/core/models/detect.py` 能识别它的模型文件夹；可选的包放进 `pyproject.toml` 的附加依赖和 `EXTRAS`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3862":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-156","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#清单一个新引擎要动哪些地方","content":"测试：`tests/engines_native/test_<id>_tiny.py`（单独发行的引擎把它们放在自己包的 `tests/` 里，如 `packages/native/<pkg>/tests/`）；`tests/core/test_engines.py::test_registry_lookups` 里的引擎 id 列表，以及 `tests/engines/test_contract.py` 里的 `engines` 覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3863":{"id":"/docs/development-engine-157","page_id":"/docs/development-engine","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-engine#清单一个新引擎要动哪些地方","content":"`mizuoto model download <id>/<名字>`，然后在真实模型上跑契约套件；把移植情况和对照结果记进该引擎的页面（`engines-<id>`，中英文都要），把它加进侧边栏（`meta.json`、`meta.en.json`）和引擎参考的表格；如有新的规则，再记进 `AGENTS.md`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3864":{"id":"/docs/development-memory","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"page","content":"显存与内存","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory","locale":"zh-CN"},"3865":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-0","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory","content":"运行时怎样仿照 ComfyUI 使用显存和内存：阶段、预算与显存模式、单元与权重流式加载、主机副本、部分加载与让出显存、精确的显存不足重试、工作显存估算及其校准、模拟设备、训练预设，以及引擎要怎样配合。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3866":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-1","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"代码位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"3867":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-2","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"3868":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-3","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"预算","locale":"zh-CN"},"3869":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-4","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"单元：哪些会流式加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3870":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-5","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"权重流式加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3871":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-6","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#主机副本与内存","content":"主机副本与内存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3872":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-7","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"让出显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3873":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-8","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"显存不足","locale":"zh-CN"},"3874":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-9","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#工作显存估算","content":"工作显存估算","locale":"zh-CN"},"3875":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-10","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#报告","content":"报告","locale":"zh-CN"},"3876":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-11","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#静态-kv-缓存与-cuda-分配器","content":"静态 KV 缓存与 CUDA 分配器","locale":"zh-CN"},"3877":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-12","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#模拟设备与测试","content":"模拟设备与测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"3878":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-13","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"3879":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-14","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"编写配合显存管理的引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"3880":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-15","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory","content":"只要模型的最小工作集放得进设备，模型就能运行，而不必整个放得下。Mizuoto 的运行时仿照 ComfyUI（`load_models_gpu`、`ModelPatcher` 的部分加载、dynamic VRAM）做到这一点，但不用原生分配器：请求只放上当前这一步需要的组件；放不下时，其他组件逐个单元让出显存；仍然不够时，组件部分加载，其余权重留在内存中，每层运行时再流式加载到设备。显存不足由“失败”变成“更慢”。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3881":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-16","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory","content":"这一切都不改变任何结果。流式加载的层与常驻的层用的是相同的张量计算，重试的那一步重放相同的随机数，测试让每个引擎在权重流式加载的情况下运行，并把音频与普通运行逐样本比较。会改变数值的机制（分块解码、静态 KV 缓存、训练的 `lowest` 预设）都需要主动开启，并在输出中注明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3882":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-17","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory","content":"面向用户的设置见性能与加速；运行时的整体介绍见运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3883":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-18","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"部分","locale":"zh-CN"},"3884":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-19","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"代码","locale":"zh-CN"},"3885":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-20","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"3886":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-21","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`VramPolicy`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3887":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-22","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/policy.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3888":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-23","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"模式、保留量、主机副本、锁页预算、复制流和显存不足时的开关；每次使用时由 `compute` 设置构造（`core/inference/service.py: policy_from`），所以修改设置后下一次加载即生效，无需重启","locale":"zh-CN"},"3889":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-24","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"单元","locale":"zh-CN"},"3890":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-25","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/units.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3891":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-26","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"模块中哪些部分可以留在设备之外，哪些是固定部分","locale":"zh-CN"},"3892":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-27","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`ModelHandle`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3893":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-28","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/handle.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3894":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-29","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"一个组件：整体或部分放置、主机副本、流式单元的钩子","local