"3905":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-40","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/lm/cache.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3906":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-41","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"供估算用的 KV 缓存峰值；静态缓存","locale":"zh-CN"},"3907":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-42","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`tiled_1d`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3908":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-43","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/nn/dsp/tiles.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3909":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-44","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"以重叠分块解码（一种回退方式）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3910":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-45","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`DeviceService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3911":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-46","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/device.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3912":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-47","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"空闲显存、`vram_limit_mb`、模拟设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"3913":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-48","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"训练工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"3914":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-49","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"`mizuoto/training/memory.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3915":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-50","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#代码位置","content":"梯度检查点、预设、主机端优化器、流式加载的冻结权重、估算","locale":"zh-CN"},"3916":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-51","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"设置了 `PHASED = True` 的引擎（Mizuoto 自带的所有真实引擎；dummy 引擎没有）把请求的每个部分包在一个阶段里，这样只放上这部分的组件，并只为这部分预留工作显存：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3917":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-52","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"**`ctx.use(handles, memory)`** 是一个上下文管理器：管理器把 `handles`（整体或部分）放到设备上，为 `memory` 字节的工作显存留出空间，并在代码块结束前不让它们让出显存。用于产出音频或消费生成器的阶段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3918":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-53","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"**`ctx.run(name, handles, fn, memory, generators=(), fallback=None)`** 对一个纯函数做同样的事，另加精确重试和回退（见下文）。凡是代码块唯一的作用就是其返回值的地方都用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3919":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-54","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"阶段没有列出的组件留在原处，别的阶段需要显存时它们先让出：IndexTTS 克隆一个已缓存的音色时，从不放上 w2v-BERT 或 CAM++。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3920":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-55","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"没有 `PHASED` 的引擎在整个调用期间得到所有句柄，以 `memory_required(task)` 作为工作显存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3921":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-56","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#阶段","content":"在 CPU 上管理器什么都不移动、不计数（加载设备与卸载设备相同），所以阶段在那里没有开销。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3922":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-57","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"`ModelManager.load(handles, memory)` 按设备决定：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3923":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-58","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"**需要** = 句柄尚未放到设备上的字节 + 工作显存（估算乘以其校准系数，见下文）+ `compute.vram_reserve_mb`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3924":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-59","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"**空闲** = 驱动报告的空闲显存，加上 torch 缓存分配器占着但未使用的部分；设置了 `compute.vram_limit_mb` 时，不超过它减去本进程已占用的量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3925":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-60","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"空闲不够时，其他空闲组件让出显存（见下文“让出显存”），然后重新测量空闲显存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3926":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-61","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"放得下就整体加载；否则在预算内部分加载，预算为空闲显存减去工作显存和保留量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3927":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-62","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"模式（`compute.vram_mode`、`engines.<id>.vram_mode`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3928":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-63","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"放得下时整体加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3929":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-64","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"否则","locale":"zh-CN"},"3930":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-65","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"`auto` / `normal`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3931":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-66","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"3932":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-67","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"部分加载，最少到最小工作集","locale":"zh-CN"},"3933":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-68","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"`high`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3934":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-69","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"3935":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-70","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"在空闲组件整体移走后仍整体加载；不做部分加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3936":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-71","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"`low`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3937":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-72","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"仅当权重不超过设备显存的一半（`low_ratio`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3938":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-73","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"在这一半之内部分加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3939":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-74","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"`none`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3940":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-75","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"从不","locale":"zh-CN"},"3941":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-76","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"每个单元都流式加载：设备上只有固定部分和正在复制的副本","locale":"zh-CN"},"3942":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-77","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"`shared`（MPS 上自动使用）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3943":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-78","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"是","locale":"zh-CN"},"3944":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-79","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"整体加载：统一内存移出也省不出空间，所以不做部分加载，也不保留主机副本","locale":"zh-CN"},"3945":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-80","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"**估算从不拒绝加载**（ComfyUI 的做法）。`high` 模式下，空闲组件腾出空间后整体尝试加载；其他模式下，低于最小工作集时仍按最小工作集尝试，并在日志中记一条警告。只有显存分配真正失败才算错误。加载前从不检查模型目录中的 `vram_mb`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3946":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-81","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#预算","content":"**一块 GPU 上的两个请求。** `compute.gpu_jobs` 大于 1 时，如果一个请求连最小工作集都放不下（`high` 模式下是整个模型放不下），而另一个请求正占着该设备上的组件，它会等那个请求释放，最多 10 分钟，期间检查取消；然后再尝试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3947":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-82","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"单元是一起移动的一组权重：一个解码器层、一个 DiT 块、一级声码器（即 ComfyUI dynamic VRAM 中的 units）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3948":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-83","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"模块可以用 `memory_units() -> list[nn.Module]` 指定自己的单元。否则，每个 `ModuleList` 或 `Sequential` 中不小于 1 MB 的子模块是一个单元（取最外层的列表；单元不会再往下拆）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3949":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-84","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"**只有 `nn.Linear`、`Conv1d/2d`、`ConvTranspose1d/2d` 的权重会流式加载**，以及声明了 `STREAMABLE = True` 的类（IndexTTS 的 GPT-2 `Conv1D`）。这些层的权重只在其 `forward` 中读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3950":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-85","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"**其余都是固定部分**：只要组件在设备上，它们就在设备上。包括嵌入（码本经常通过 `.weight` 直接读取）、归一化、缩放系数、缓冲区、与单元外模块共享的参数（共享的嵌入与输出头）、模型的第一个参数（代码通过它判断模型所在设备）、小于 64 KB 的单元、标为 `fixed` 的模块，以及固定在 CPU 上的模块（`DeviceService.pin_to_cpu`，从不移动）之下的一切。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3951":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-86","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"引擎用 `handle.mark(module, mark)` 在句柄上标记子模块：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3952":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-87","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"标记","locale":"zh-CN"},"3953":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-88","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"3954":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-89","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"使用者","locale":"zh-CN"},"3955":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-90","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"`fixed`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3956":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-91","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"从不流式加载：代码在其 `forward` 之外读取它的权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"3957":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-92","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"CosyVoice 的 HiFT F0 预测器；GPT-SoVITS 的 T2S（`memory_units() = []`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"3958":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-93","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"`hot`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3959":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-94","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"每一步运行多次：优先常驻","locale":"zh-CN"},"3960":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-95","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"Qwen3-TTS 的 code predictor、VoxCPM 的局部 DiT 与编码器、Whisper 的解码器","locale":"zh-CN"},"3961":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-96","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"`cold`","locale":"zh-CN"},"3962":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-97","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"每个请求运行一次：优先流式加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"3963":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-98","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"放不下全部单元时，在 `hot` 单元之后，句柄的 `kind` 决定哪些单元常驻：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3964":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-99","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"`sequence`（自回归语言模型，每个 token 每层运行一次）：按运行顺序，于是固定的前若干层常驻，每个 token 流式加载的都是同样那些层；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3965":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-100","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"`oneshot`（编码器、解码器、对整段输入做的 flow 步）：从最大的开始，这样正在复制的副本较小。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3966":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-101","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#单元哪些会流式加载","content":"句柄的**最小工作集**是它的固定部分，加上 Streamer 同时持有的、它最大的那几个单元的副本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3967":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-102","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"流式单元的权重留在内存中。单元上以及每个持有其权重的模块上都有 forward 前后钩子，调用时把 `param.data` 换成设备上的副本，调用后换回。叶子模块上的钩子让任何进入该层的路径都能工作（`layer.forward_step(…)`、`vae.decode`），`ops` 和层的代码都不需要改。整个放在设备上的组件根本没有钩子，所以常驻路径没有任何开销。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3968":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-103","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"设备的 `Streamer`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3969":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-104","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"**保留少量副本**：正在运行的单元和正在传输的单元（`compute.async_offload + 1` 个）；副本被丢弃前再次运行的单元（CFG 的两半、beam）直接复用；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3970":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-105","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"**学习单元的运行顺序**（记录每个单元上次之后运行的单元），并在 CUDA 和 ROCm 上**预取**：当前单元计算时，在副流上复制接下来的单元。计算流在使用副本前等待复制的事件，每个副本都记录在计算流上，缓存分配器不会提前复用它的显存。不按学到的顺序进入的单元当场复制：正确性从不依赖顺序；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3971":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-106","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"**不为 `sequence` 组件预取**（自回归模型）：它们的单元只保留一个副本，放置时也只为它们留出一个单元的空间，而不是 `async_offload + 1` 个。一个 token 的计算掩盖不了一层的复制时间，所以在那里预取只会占用常驻权重的空间：在 RTX 3090 上部分加载时，Qwen3-TTS 的 talker 有两个副流时 24.6 秒、没有时 16.2 秒，VoxCPM 2 为 29.0 秒和 13.6 秒，CosyVoice 2 为 10.1 秒和 7.4 秒；而每个输入只运行一次的模型（F5-TTS、OmniVoice）有副流更快；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3972":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-107","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"**锁页**：在 `compute.max_pinned_mb` 之内把流式权重的主机副本放进锁页内存（复制变为异步，约快一倍）；默认为 ComfyUI 的预算：Windows 上为内存的 40 %，其他系统为 `max(0.4 × 内存, min(0.9 × 内存, 内存 − 4 GB))`。超出部分仍为可分页内存，同步复制。XPU 和 MPS 上同步复制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3973":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-108","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"**原地锁页**（`mizuoto/runtime/pinning.py`，即 ComfyUI 的 `pin_memory`）。在 NVIDIA GPU 上，主机副本就地锁页（`cudaHostRegister`，14 GB/s，不复制任何数据），而不是复制到锁页内存中（`Tensor.pin_memory()`，1.5 GB/s：talker 的第一个流式请求为此多花 0.65–1.0 s）。同一预算也涵盖整个加载的组件保留的主机副本（`keep_host`）：它们在加载时锁页，之后每次重新加载都以链路速度异步复制。只注册至少 1 MB 的完整存储（更小的与其他分配共用内存页，而注册不能重叠）；更小的流式张量仍由流式加载器复制到锁页内存中，因为副流上的可分页复制会让主机停下来等待。注册与其存储绑定：存储销毁时（在其内存释放之前）运行一个终结器，等待设备完成后取消注册（否则之后分配在同一地址的内存会被当成锁页内存）。其他设备（包括 ROCm）上，流式权重仍像以前一样复制到锁页内存，保留的主机副本仍为可分页内存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3974":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-109","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#权重流式加载","content":"副本在推理模式之外、以权重自身的精度创建，所以流式加载的层与常驻的层用同一种张量计算（推理张量在 CPU 上会走另一个内核）。每次取副本都检查取消。位于流式单元之上的 `Compiled` 模块改为即时执行（编译出的图会持有权重），CUDA Graph 只对整个放在设备上的模型捕获，或者对流式单元留在锁页内存中的 `sequence` 句柄捕获（`ModelHandle.graphable`；Qwen3-TTS 的 talker 用到它）。捕获时，每个流式权重的复制是一个从其固定主机张量到图自身内存的 memcpy 节点，在捕获中进行（不用捕获前那次 eager 运行的副本：那块缓冲区释放后图仍会读它），并且按叶子模块复制，所以一层被注意力分在几个图里时，每个权重每步也只复制一次。流式加载器把重放中的复制计入（`ModelHandle.replayed`），所以 `meta.memory.streamed_mb` 仍然准确。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3975":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-110","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#主机副本与内存","content":"有主机副本时（`compute.host_copies`：`auto` 在空闲内存高于 `compute.ram_reserve_mb` 时保留；`on`；`off`），放到设备上的参数保留其主机张量，把它移出设备不需要任何传输：设备显存成了内存之上的一层缓存。部分加载的组件总是保留主机副本（流式单元就放在那里）。缓冲区总是复制回来（模块可能原地更新它）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3976":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-111","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#主机副本与内存","content":"卸载时直接释放所有内容，不复制回来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3977":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-112","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#主机副本与内存","content":"以半精度运行的模型在加载时从不持有 float32 副本：引擎先转换模型的 dtype，再把检查点复制进去（此时参数尚未写入，转换不花任何代价），结果与先以 float32 加载再转换完全相同。Qwen3-TTS 1.7B 加载时的内存由 7.4 GB 降到 4.2 GB（常驻由 11.1 GB 降到 5.5 GB，关闭主机副本，2026-10-19）；F5-TTS、VoxCPM、Fish Speech 和 OmniVoice 也这样加载。safetensors 检查点通过内存映射读取，读取时它们的页面计入常驻内存，但属于系统可以回收的页缓存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3978":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-113","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#主机副本与内存","content":"放置之后会改变的权重通过句柄修改（`handle.replace(module)`：音色自己的 GPT-SoVITS 权重），所以主机副本不会过时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3979":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-114","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#主机副本与内存","content":"`compute.ram_reserve_mb`（留空：2 GB 与内存十分之一中较大者）：空闲内存低于它时，运行时服务先丢弃整体加载的组件的主机副本，再按最久未用卸载空闲模型，从不卸载固定的或忙碌的模型（`RuntimeService.relieve_ram`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3980":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-115","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"空闲显存不够时，同一设备上的空闲组件按以下顺序让出差额：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3981":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-116","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"部分加载的组件（本来就慢；ComfyUI 的第一排序键）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3982":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-117","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"然后不在 `engines.<id>.pinned_models` 中的模型先于固定的模型；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3983":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-118","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"然后最久未用的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3984":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-119","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"任何请求正在使用的组件都不会让出；正在运行的模型中当前阶段用不到的组件则会。每个让出者按放置顺序的逆序逐个单元让出（`partially_unload`），直到满足差额；在 `high` 和 `shared` 模式下整体移走。`empty_cache` 只在让出之后执行，从不每个请求都执行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3985":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-120","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"部分加载一个阶段的组件时：较小的组件先整体加载，每个都给其余组件至少留下最小工作集，最大的组件得到剩下的部分，其余单元流式加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3986":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-121","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#让出显存","content":"在管理器之上，`RuntimeService` 最多保留 `compute.max_resident_models` 个已加载模型，空闲超过 `compute.unload_after_minutes` 的模型被卸载（仅服务器），在 GPU 上微调前把该 GPU 上所有空闲模型移走（`release_device`），并在任务因显存不足失败后卸载所有 GPU 上未在使用的模型（`ComputeService.release_after_oom`，即 ComfyUI 的 `unload_all_models`）。见运行时。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3987":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-122","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"**精确重试**（`compute.oom_retry`，默认开）。经 `ctx.run` 运行的阶段显存不足时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3988":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-123","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"先离开这次尝试的异常帧（它持有失败尝试的张量）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3989":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-124","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"`manager.after_oom`：该设备上其他所有空闲组件移出设备，Streamer 缓存的副本丢弃，该阶段的每个组件被限制为它原先在设备上的一半（`ModelHandle.cap_bytes`，保留到它被移出设备为止，这样后面的请求不会再次显存不足）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3990":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-125","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"请求的生成器、它的 `rng` 以及引擎指定的生成器（`generators=`）恢复到第一次尝试前的状态；","locale":"zh-CN"},"3991":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-126","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"重新运行该阶段：相同的随机数，相同的结果，只是更慢。最多重试两次；输出记录 `applied.oom_retries` 并带一条警告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3992":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-127","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"`ctx.use` 下的阶段（产出音频或消费生成器的阶段）不会重试，所以它的估算必须覆盖它可能达到的上限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"3993":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-128","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"**回退**（`compute.oom_fallback`，默认关）。重试之后，如果引擎提供了更省显存的方式（`ctx.run(…, fallback=(what, fn))`），就用它。其输出略有不同，因此记录在 `applied.fallbacks` 中并带一条警告：","locale":"zh-CN"},"3994":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-129","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"3995":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-130","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"回退方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"3996":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-131","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"ASR","locale":"zh-CN"},"3997":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-132","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"一次一个 30 秒窗口","locale":"zh-CN"},"3998":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-133","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"GPT-SoVITS","locale":"zh-CN"},"3999":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-134","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"一次一句","locale":"zh-CN"},"4000":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-135","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"4001":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-136","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"Vocos 分块解码","locale":"zh-CN"},"4002":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-137","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"IndexTTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"4003":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-138","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"BigVGAN 分块解码","locale":"zh-CN"},"4004":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-139","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"VoxCPM","locale":"zh-CN"},"4005":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-140","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"VAE 分块解码","locale":"zh-CN"},"4006":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-141","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#显存不足","content":"`tiled_1d` 每次解码 256 帧，重叠 32 帧并交叉淡化（ComfyUI 的音频 VAE 分块方式）。Qwen3-TTS 的编解码器本来就分段解码；CosyVoice 的 HiFT 带有相位状态，分块会破坏它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4007":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-142","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#工作显存估算","content":"阶段的估算决定其权重能否整体放下，所以按请求本身估算（文本 token 数、批次行数、参考音频长度），而不是按 `max_new_tokens` 允许的最坏情况。为请求永远用不到的显存预留空间，会白白把权重挤出去：最坏情况 8192 帧再翻倍，对一个只用约 20 MB 的 Qwen3-TTS 句子要预留 2.4 GB。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4008":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-143","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#工作显存估算","content":"语言模型的缓存按文本估算：Qwen3-TTS 每个文本 token 16 帧，IndexTTS 24 个码，GPT-SoVITS 每个音素 16 个，CosyVoice 按上游的每个 token 20 个，均不超过 `max_new_tokens`；Fish Speech 的批次按其真实上限；精度和 KV 宽度按模型实际计算时的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4009":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-144","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#工作显存估算","content":"`runtime.lm.cache.peak_bytes(position_bytes, layers, positions, kind, rows)` 给出增长中的缓存的峰值：`dynamic` 为所有层，加上一步拼接时一层的新拷贝（每层的旧张量在下一层之前释放），而不是整个缓存的两倍；`static` 为翻倍后的缓冲区，加上增长时的一个旧缓冲区。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4010":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-145","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#工作显存估算","content":"在 `ctx.run` 下，偶尔超出估算的生成会以更多权重流式加载的方式精确地重新运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4011":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-146","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#工作显存估算","content":"**校准。** 在 CUDA 或 XPU 上每个阶段之后，管理器测量其工作显存：高于已放置权重的峰值，减去 Streamer 副本的最大占用，再减去该阶段之后保留下来的内存（CUDA Graph 的内存池、随模型保留的缓冲区）。超出估算时，它按阶段记住这个比值（乘以 1.1，最多 16），以引擎和组件名为键（`qwen3tts:talker`），下次相应地多预留。比值保存在 `<cache>/memory/calibration.json`（格式版本 2；其他版本的文件会被忽略）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4012":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-147","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#报告","content":"每个输出的 `meta.memory`：`streamed_mb`（请求期间从内存复制的量）、`loaded_mb`、`size_mb`，部分加载的组件还有 `partial`：每个组件的 `reason`（预算不够、`vram_mode low` 或 `none`、显存不足后被限制，或为别的组件让出了显存），以及当时权衡的 `mode`、`free_mb`、`working_mb`、`reserve_mb`，还有 `loaded_mb`、`size_mb` 和 `gave_up_for`。发生时日志中也有同样的信息。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4013":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-148","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#报告","content":"`GET /api/v1/runtime` 与 `mizuoto runtime`：每个模型的 `loaded_bytes`、`streamed_bytes`、`host_bytes`；网页界面的已加载模型面板用进度条显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4014":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-149","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#报告","content":"`mizuoto doctor` 有一项 `memory` 检查结果，列出当前生效的策略（模式、保留量、上限、内存保留量、主机副本、锁页预算、复制流、重试与回退）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4015":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-150","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#静态-kv-缓存与-cuda-分配器","content":"`compute.kv_cache = static` 让 Qwen 系列的缓存（Qwen3-TTS、CosyVoice 2/3）写入预分配的缓冲区，满了就翻倍（`BufferCache`）：没有每步拼接，没有临时拷贝，碎片更少。注意力读取的是带缓冲区步长的视图，某些内核会以另一种顺序求和。在 CPU 上结果相同；在 GPU 上验证结果相同之前一直需要主动开启。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4016":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-151","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#静态-kv-缓存与-cuda-分配器","content":"`compute.cuda_allocator`（`native`；`async`：cudaMallocAsync；`expandable`：可扩展段；`auto` 即 `native`）由主机在第一次使用 CUDA 之前写入 `PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF`，从不由引擎代码设置，并通过环境传给训练阶段（`allocator_env`），无论主机是否已加载模型。环境中已设置的值优先；修改在下次启动时生效。在 `async` 下不捕获 CUDA Graph（`graphs.usable`）：这种按流排序的分配器释放捕获预热时的临时张量的方式，曾使重放因非法内存访问而出错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4017":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-152","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#模拟设备与测试","content":"`DeviceService(simulate={\"cpu\": bytes}, strict=True)`（设置项 `compute.simulate_vram_mb`，供测试和一致性验证工具使用）让 CPU 扮演一块该大小的 GPU。管理器通过复制来放置权重、流式加载单元，并按模拟的大小计算已放置的量。严格模式下，不在设备上的每个权重都以 meta 张量存放，于是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4018":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-153","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#模拟设备与测试","content":"在阶段之外使用的组件会报错（它没有被放置）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"4019":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-154","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#模拟设备与测试","content":"在 `forward` 之外读取的单元权重会报错（它不在那里）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4020":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-155","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#模拟设备与测试","content":"`tests/engines_native/streaming.py` 这样运行每个小型引擎：所有单元都流式加载（`none` 模式）、取最小工作集与整个大小之间一半的空间、整体加载，并把每次的输出与普通 CPU 运行比较：完全相同。一致性验证工具在真实模型上也这样做（`--setting compute.simulate_vram_mb=…`）。见测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4021":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-156","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"训练阶段在自己的进程中运行并独占设备：GPU 阶段开始前，主机把该 GPU 上所有空闲模型移走，训练任务占用 `gpu:<dev>` 的全部名额（`JobSpec.exclusive`）。在阶段内部，`training.memory` 选择 `mizuoto/training/memory.py` 中工具的一组预设；方法自己的超参数优先：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4022":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-157","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"预设","locale":"zh-CN"},"4023":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-158","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"增加","locale":"zh-CN"},"4024":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-159","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"4025":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-160","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"`standard`（默认）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4026":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-161","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"无：完全按各引擎的训练配方","locale":"zh-CN"},"4027":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-162","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"与上游相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"4028":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-163","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"`low`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4029":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-164","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"对每个块做梯度检查点（`gradient_checkpointing`：`blocks`、`every:k`；VoxCPM、Qwen3-TTS、OmniVoice、F5-TTS、CosyVoice），重算时恢复全局生成器*以及训练器自己的生成器*；F5-TTS 的 EMA 副本放在内存中；VoxCPM 的 LoRA 冻结权重以 autocast 精度存放","locale":"zh-CN"},"4030":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-165","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"相同（在 CPU 上逐个训练器测试）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4031":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-166","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"`lowest`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4032":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-167","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"另外把 AdamW 的状态放在内存中并在 CPU 上更新（`host_optimizer`；Qwen3-TTS、OmniVoice、不用梯度缩放的 F5-TTS）；VoxCPM 的 LoRA 基座权重在每次矩阵乘法时从内存流式加载（`streamed_linear`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4033":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-168","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"在 GPU 上优化器求和的最后几位可能不同","locale":"zh-CN"},"4034":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-169","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"主机端优化器把 float32 副本和梯度各放在一个缓冲区中，每一步的梯度和参数经过每种设备 dtype 一个的锁页缓冲区传输，只等待一次；它每一步的大部分时间是 AdamW 本身在 CPU 上的运算（Qwen3-TTS 1.7B：每步 5.5 秒中约 4.5 秒），只有融合的优化器才能缩短，但结果会不同。`lowest` 阶段运行时不使用 torch 的大页（`compute.cpu_allocator`）：使用大页时，每一步的分配都卡在内核的内存整理上，运行时间是 2.2 倍。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4035":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-170","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#训练","content":"始终如此：GPU 阶段报告 `memory/peak_mb`；`MethodInfo.memory_mb` 估算每个预设下的峰值（`core/training/estimate.py`）：每种方法都在 RTX 3090 上以配方的默认批量测量过，覆盖每个已安装的基础模型和每个预设；估算值取大小最接近的已测模型的峰值，按大小缩放，再加一成和 CUDA 上下文的 512 MB；Fish Speech、GPT-SoVITS 和 VoxCPM 的峰值随批量变化，按运行的 `batch_size` 与测量时的批量调整。GPU 上运行时若估算超过空闲显存，会在日志中警告，给出放得下的预设；没有预设放得下时，给出放得下的最大批量。训练器本身见训练器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4036":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-171","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"**把每个带权重的模块包进 `ModelHandle`**，列在 `self.handles` 中。自回归语言模型用 `kind=\"sequence\"`；每一步运行多次的部分标为 `hot`，代码在 `forward` 之外读取其权重的模块标为 `fixed`。默认拆分（`ModuleList`/`Sequential` 的子模块）不适合模型时，用 `memory_units()` 指定单元。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4037":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-172","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"**不要自己移动模块。** 在主机上构建（或在 `spec.device` 上；句柄会接手），由管理器放置。以 float64 计算的模块在没有 float64 的设备上用 `float64_device` 和 `pin_to_cpu`。用 `handle.replace` 换权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4038":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-173","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"**设置 `PHASED = True`，把每个部分放进一个阶段**：纯代码块用 `ctx.run`，产出或消费生成器的代码块用 `ctx.use`。引擎在上下文之外自己持有的生成器用 `generators=` 传入，重试时会一并重放。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4039":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-174","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"**按请求估算每个阶段的工作显存**：KV 缓存用 `peak_bytes`，按模型实际计算的精度；注意力分数、CFG 批次、按长度计算的解码器激活。`ctx.use` 下要给出该阶段可能达到的上限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4040":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-175","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"**在有更省显存且足够接近的方式时提供回退**（分块、一次一项），附一句说明它做什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4041":{"id":"/docs/development-memory-176","page_id":"/docs/development-memory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-memory#编写配合显存管理的引擎","content":"**在 `streaming.py` 下运行小型模型**：所有单元流式加载、一半、不流式，严格模式。在那里失败时，会指出在阶段之外使用的组件或在单元之外读取的权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4042":{"id":"/docs/development-performance","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"page","content":"性能记录","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance","locale":"zh-CN"},"4043":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-0","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance","content":"在结果不变的规则下怎样测量 Mizuoto 的速度（perf.py、train_perf.py），每次测量的条件，以及每一轮工作改了什么：CPU 上的几轮、注意力分发器、各引擎的 CUDA Graph 和 torch.compile。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4044":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-1","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"怎样测量","locale":"zh-CN"},"4045":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-2","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#测量条件","content":"测量条件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4046":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-3","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"CPU 上时间花在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"4047":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-4","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第一轮cpu-设置与精确的清理","content":"CPU 第一轮：CPU 设置与精确的清理","locale":"zh-CN"},"4048":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-5","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-第二轮训练","content":"CPU 第二轮：训练","locale":"zh-CN"},"4049":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-6","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#注意力分发器","content":"注意力分发器","locale":"zh-CN"},"4050":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-7","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"