"},"4060":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-17","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"GPU 优化（G2）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4061":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-18","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"对比 0.1，以及 GPU 上的契约测试（G3）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4062":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-19","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"与 0.1 对比首段音频和内存（G8）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4063":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-20","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"显存估算的校准","locale":"zh-CN"},"4064":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-21","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"GPU 上的注意力后端","locale":"zh-CN"},"4065":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-22","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#部分加载的模型","content":"部分加载的模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4066":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-23","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#显存模式与真实的显存不足","content":"显存模式与真实的显存不足","locale":"zh-CN"},"4067":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-24","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#在-cpu-上的-torchcompile","content":"在 CPU 上的 `torch.compile`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4068":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-25","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-performance#因改变结果而没有采用的做法","content":"因改变结果而没有采用的做法","locale":"zh-CN"},"4069":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-26","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance","content":"推理和训练代码的提速工作遵循一条规则：**结果不变**。这里记录的每项优化，在 CPU 上（引擎与上游的一致性就是在 CPU 上确立的）都与之前的代码给出逐样本相同的音频，以及逐位相同的损失和保存的权重。在 GPU 上，“相同”指在同一块 GPU、同一驱动、同一 torch 和同一设置下与之前的代码完全相同。改变运算的提速是需要主动开启的功能，见加速；面向用户的设置见性能与加速。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4070":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-27","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"4071":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-28","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"4072":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-29","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"`scripts/parity/perf.py run <cases.jsonl>… --name NAME [--only ID] [--repeat N] [--device D] [--setting k=v] [--reference NAME] [--profile] [--torch-profile [--keep-trace]] [--deterministic]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4073":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-30","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"在一个进程中让一致性用例经过整个系统，每个运行 `--repeat` 次（3 次）：第一次加载模型并准备音色，其余为预热后的运行。记录墙钟时间、加载、首块音频、引擎总时间、实时率，以及每个阶段（`ctx.use` / `ctx.run`，不含嵌套阶段，另有阶段之外的时间）内的时间。逐样本比较各次运行之间的音频，以及与 `--reference` 的音频：该名称的一次早先运行，否则为用例的一致性基准文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"4074":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-31","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"`perf.py compare --a NAME --b NAME [--report out.md]`、`perf.py show NAME`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4075":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-32","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"两轮的预热运行对照，加速比，流式用例的首段音频时间，以及变化最大的阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"4076":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-33","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"`scripts/parity/train_perf.py run <engine> --fixture F --name NAME [--device D] [--setting k=v] [--reference NAME] [--profile]`、`compare`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4077":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-34","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"按一致性基准的配方经过整个系统做一次微调，每个阶段都像实际使用时一样是子进程：每个阶段的时间、每步时间、每个指标，以及导出写出的每个权重文件的 SHA-256，并与早先的运行比较","locale":"zh-CN"},"4078":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-35","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"`--profile` 在 cProfile 下多跑一次不计入的运行（`train_perf.py` 则在进程内运行各阶段）；`--torch-profile` 按自身耗时列出算子。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4079":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-36","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"**在 GPU 上**（`--device cuda:N`，它成为每个引擎的设备，也是训练的设备）：工具在每个阶段边界等待设备，使阶段时间是它的实际工作而不只是内核的发出；并按阶段记录峰值分配、阶段权重放好之后在已分配量之上的工作内存，以及引擎申请的工作内存（另记下最接近其自身估算的那一次调用：一个阶段最大的用量和最大的估算可能来自不同的调用），另有请求的峰值已分配与已保留内存。此时 `--torch-profile` 还记录设备活动并按阶段汇总（`<case>.gpu.json`）：墙钟时间与设备忙碌时间、内核数、发出次数、CUDA Graph 重放次数、主机等待设备的次数（`cudaStreamSynchronize`、`cudaEventSynchronize`、同步的 `cudaMemcpy`；工具自身每个阶段的两次 `cudaDeviceSynchronize` 单独计数），以及主机与设备之间的拷贝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4080":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-37","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"`--deterministic` 在 `torch.use_deterministic_algorithms(True, warn_only=True)` 与 `CUBLAS_WORKSPACE_CONFIG=:4096:8` 下运行，二者由工具设置（原生代码从不改动进程级状态）；没有确定性实现的运算列在记录里，而不是让用例失败。`train_perf.py --setting training.memory=low` 用来测量某个显存预设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4081":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-38","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"记录写到 `MIZUOTO_PERF_DIR`（默认 `~/code_workspace/experiment/perf`），每个用例每轮一个 JSON 文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4082":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-39","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"预热时间取最快的预热运行：机器上的其他工作只会让运行变慢。重要的比较都交错进行，两份代码在各自的进程里先后运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4083":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-40","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"冻结要测量的代码（在该提交上建一个工作树），运行基线：对用例集运行 `perf.py run`，对每个训练器运行 `train_perf.py run`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4084":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-41","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"用 `--profile`、`--torch-profile` 找出时间花在哪里；涉及内核层面的改动，先写一个微基准，并在引擎实际用到的形状上用 `torch.equal` 检查该运算的输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4085":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-42","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"以基线为 `--reference` 运行改动后的代码：每个用例的音频都必须完全相同，每次微调的指标和权重哈希都必须完全相同。然后对代码有改动的引擎运行一致性验证，并运行测试套件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4086":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-43","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"用 `perf.py compare` 生成表格，并把这一轮记在这里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4087":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-44","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#怎样测量","content":"推理用例集共 13 个：Qwen3-TTS `base-clone-en` 与 `cv-en-aiden`，F5-TTS `clone-en`，OmniVoice `clone-en`，CosyVoice `v2-clone-en` 与 `v3-clone-en`，GPT-SoVITS `v2-clone-zh` 与 `v4-clone-zh`，Fish Speech `clone-en`，IndexTTS `v2-clone-en` 与 `v15-clone-en`，VoxCPM `v2-clone-en` 与 `v15-clone-en`。训练用例集是每个训练器在一个 11 段音频的数据集上做一次微调。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4088":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-45","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#测量条件","content":"**CPU**：AMD Ryzen 9 5900X（12 核；torch 用 12 个线程），125 GB 内存，torch 2.8.0（MKL 2024.2、oneDNN 3.7.1），Python 3.11；fp32，VoxCPM 除外（bf16，其上游默认值）。机器上的其他工作约占 9 % 的线程；计算线程被抢占的运行会停顿，所以单次运行的波动可达 ±10 %。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4089":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-46","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#测量条件","content":"**GPU**：两块 RTX 3090（24 GB），**与另一项工作共用**，它在每块卡上占约 21 GB 显存并让两块卡都保持 100 % 繁忙。下面所有 GPU 数字都因共用而偏大；比较都在同一块 GPU、同一 torch 上交错进行。放不进剩余显存的模型只测量其解码循环：真实尺寸、随机权重、只取少数几层，用到这种方式的地方都会注明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4090":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-47","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#测量条件","content":"**GPU，2026-10-18 起**（GPU 基线）：同样两块 RTX 3090，**空闲**（没有其他工作），驱动 595.99.02，torch 2.8.0+cu128（CUDA 12.8、cuDNN 9.10.2），PCIe 4.0 x16。推理在一块卡上运行，微调同时在另一块卡上运行，二者共用 CPU。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4091":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-48","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"CPU 优化之前的预热请求：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4092":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-49","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"引擎、用例","locale":"zh-CN"},"4093":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-50","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"音频（秒）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4094":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-51","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"预热（秒）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4095":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-52","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-上时间花在哪里","content":"各阶段（秒）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4096":{"id":"/docs/developm