performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"→ 0.2.5（`4e6fe35`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4582":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-539","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"全部相同；且在 `cuda:1` 上与 G0 的 `cuda:0` 相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"4583":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-540","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"已修复，使 GPU 上的音频重新与之前的代码相同：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4584":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-541","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**VoxCPM 的注意力跨度。** 在 CUDA 上一步走 SDPA 的 math 路径，其矩阵向量乘和 softmax 按键的长度划分求和：在下一个 256（或 512 … 4096）的倍数处截断，在 bf16、fp16 和 fp32 下大多数位置都与整个 8192 位置的缓存不同。跨度现在只在 CPU 上使用（`minicpm.attend_span`）；在 GPU 上一步对整个缓存计算，与上游一样。重新与第一轮之前的代码相同，代价是：预热请求 1.24 → 2.13 秒（VoxCPM 2）、0.68 → 0.96 秒（1.5）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4585":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-542","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**Fish Speech 的原地 Snake。** 在 GPU 上编解码器在 bf16 autocast 下运行，autocast 以 float32 计算 `pow` 和 `reciprocal`；因此上游的 Snake 以 float32 结束，而保持缓冲区数据类型的原地写法停留在 bf16（最多相差 0.1）。原地写法现在只在没有 autocast 时使用；重新与第一轮相同，速度不变。单元测试覆盖了 autocast。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4586":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-543","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**CosyVoice 在 `cuda:1` 上**因非法内存访问而出错：其解码步骤的 CUDA Graph 在当前设备为 `cuda:0` 时捕获和重放，而重放在当前设备的流上运行。现在像其他引擎一样在 `torch.cuda.device(graphs.device)` 下捕获和重放（加速）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4587":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-544","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"旋转位置表、IndexTTS 的原地 GELU 和 Fish Speech 的 Snake 在 CUDA 上以 fp32、fp16 和 bf16 给出与参考相同的结果位（有 GPU 时精确性测试现在也在 CUDA 上运行）；CosyVoice 的 U-Net 掩码是只构造一次的同一个张量。Fish Speech 在 GPU 上训练时仍在 CPU 生成器上重放上游的初始化，因为上游在 CPU 上构建模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4588":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-545","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**显存方案的机制在 CUDA 上**（G0 用例集，每次都与 G0 的音频比较）：每个模型在 `compute.vram_limit_mb` 下只加载约一半，其余流式传输，预取分别用 2、1、0 个副流；向每个阶段注入显存不足错误，每个阶段以一半权重流式传输、生成器恢复原状后重新运行；`compute.kv_cache = static`。全部 56 次运行都相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4589":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-546","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"用例（整体加载：预热秒数）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4590":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-547","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"部分加载，2 个副流","locale":"zh-CN"},"4591":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-548","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"1 个","locale":"zh-CN"},"4592":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-549","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"0 个","locale":"zh-CN"},"4593":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-550","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"Qwen3-TTS base-clone-en（1.28）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4594":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-551","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"24.6 秒，流式传输 171 GB","locale":"zh-CN"},"4595":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-552","page_id":"/docs/development-performa