mance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"（新进程中的第一个请求，包括加载）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4651":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-608","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**最小显存**：每个模型都能在 4 GB 的卡上运行，包括 Fish Speech S2 Pro（方案的目标是 8 GB）。在两块 GPU 都忙时，0.2.5 的代码有一次在 6 GB 下运行 Fish Speech 时显存不足；之后又运行两次都没有再出现。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4652":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-609","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**有主机副本时卸载**用时 0.05–0.12 秒，没有传输。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4653":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-610","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**重新加载**达到 5.7–8.3 GB/s，即锁页带宽的 43–62 %，未达到方案的 80 %：主机副本是可分页内存（`pinned_bytes` 为 0），逐个张量拷贝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4654":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-611","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**GPU 运行时的设置。** `compute.cpu_allocator` 和 `compute.cpu_threads` 对预热时间和加载时间的影响都在波动范围之内（交错两轮，四个引擎）。CUDA 分配器中，`expandable` 给出相同的音频和权重，保留的显存略少；`async` 使每个使用 CUDA Graph 的引擎崩溃（捕获后非法内存访问）：现在在它之下不捕获 CUDA Graph（`graphs.usable`），可以运行且结果相同，但没有了 CUDA Graph 的速度（Fish Speech 3.1 → 7.3 秒，Qwen3-TTS 1.3 → 2.0 秒）。训练阶段现在无论主机是否已加载模型，都会在环境中得到分配器设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4655":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-612","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**长文本的工作内存**（约 30 秒语音，整体加载；之后已校准：显存估算）：每个语言模型都远在估计值之内（2–64 %），但解码器超出估计，且文本越长超出越多：VoxCPM 1.5 的 VAE 用 810 MB，估计 290 MB；VoxCPM 2 的用 440 MB，估计 302 MB；Fish Speech 的编解码器用 806 MB，估计 486 MB；IndexTTS 1.5 的 BigVGAN 用 596 MB，估计 369 MB；IndexTTS 2 的用 421 MB，估计 358 MB。阶段实测超出后，校准会调高估计值，第一次则由显存不足重试兜底；这些估计值需要调高。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4656":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-613","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"**训练显存预设**在 GPU 上，估计值（`MethodInfo.memory_mb`）对比实测峰值，单位 MB：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4657":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-614","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"微调","locale":"zh-CN"},"4658":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-615","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"`standard`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4659":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-616","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"`low`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4660":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-617","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"`lowest`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4661":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-618","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"`lowest` 与 `standard` 是否相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"4662":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-619","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"F5-TTS full","locale":"zh-CN"},"4663":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-620","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"7,576 / 8,821","locale":"zh-CN"},"4664":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-621","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"5,863 / 7,395","locale":"zh-CN"},"4665":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-622","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","t