ment-performance-641","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"2,616 / 2,747","locale":"zh-CN"},"4685":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-642","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"1,216 / 2,747","locale":"zh-CN"},"4686":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-643","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"是（流式传输的基座也相同）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4687":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-644","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"GPT-SoVITS v2Pro speaker","locale":"zh-CN"},"4688":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-645","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"921 / 3,881","locale":"zh-CN"},"4689":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-646","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"921 / 3,881","locale":"zh-CN"},"4690":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-647","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"921 / 3,881","locale":"zh-CN"},"4691":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-648","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"在 GPU 上不能重复","locale":"zh-CN"},"4692":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-649","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA","locale":"zh-CN"},"4693":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-650","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"14,105 / 9,978","locale":"zh-CN"},"4694":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-651","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"14,105 / 9,978","locale":"zh-CN"},"4695":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-652","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"14,105 / 9,978","locale":"zh-CN"},"4696":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-653","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"其导出不能重复","locale":"zh-CN"},"4697":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-654","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#cpu-各轮的-gpu-检查g1","content":"（之后已校准：显存估算。）大多数估计值低于峰值，有的低很多（GPT-SoVITS 低 4 倍），所以运行前的警告在该提醒时没有提醒：需要校准。`lowest` 使 Qwen3-TTS 的峰值减半，但其主机端优化器使运行慢 15 倍（第一步之前 152 秒，每步 6.2 秒，原为 0.2 秒）；其中大部分来自透明大页，现在这类阶段不再使用（见下文 G2）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4698":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-655","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"在空闲 GPU 上测量（2026-10-18），对比 G1 之后代码（`aeeba79`，冻结）的精确路径，G0 用例集每个用例运行三次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4699":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-656","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**已完成，结果不变。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4700":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-657","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**只在有用的地方预取**（显存）：`sequence` 组件（自回归模型；GPT-SoVITS 的 T2S 现在也是）既不预取，也不为传输中的副本留空间。部分加载（G1 的上限）时，在空闲 GPU 上交错运行：Qwen3-TTS base-clone-en 24.6 → 16.2 秒，VoxCPM v2-clone-en 29.0 → 13.6 秒，CosyVoice v2-clone-en 10.1 → 7.4 秒，都与没有副流时相同；F5-TTS 和 OmniVoice 保留预取。音频与整体加载时相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4701":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-658","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**`compute.compile` 下 CosyVoice 的 flow U-Net** 每个请求都重新编译（每一层的注意力掩码以掩码对象的身份为键缓存，而 torch.compile 会对此设置守卫）：预热请求要 12.8 秒而不是 1.0 秒。现在以 U-Net 的层级为键；编译后 0.97 秒；即时执行的音频与之前相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4702":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-659","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**IndexTTS 的束缓存放在一个缓冲区中**（在这一轮之后完成，对比 `fc4b6b3`，交错运行两轮）：所有层的键和值位于一个缓冲区，所以每一步的束重排是每束一次复制（没有束移动时只复制一次），每层在原处写入新的键和值，而不是每个张量各做一次 `index_select` 和一次 `torch.cat`，每次都复制整个张量。两个留有增长空间的缓冲区轮流使用。GPU 和 CPU 上结果都相同。预热：v15-clone-en 0.58 → 0.54 秒，v2-clone-en 2.02 → 1.93 秒，v25-clone-zh 1.73 → 1.67 秒；约 30 秒语音 ×1.11–1.12（1.5 4.79 → 4.29 秒，2 17.57 → 15.81 秒）；CPU 上 ×1.02–1.05。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4703":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-660","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**OmniVoice 的合并引导**（主动开启，请求选项 `packed_guidance`，在这一轮之后完成，对比 `a552038`）：每一项的有条件序列和无条件序列放在同一行，使用块对角掩码，而不是两行都补齐到有条件序列的长度。精确路径不变（结果相同，速度相同）。合并后，在 3090 上交错运行两轮：clone-en 0.77 → 0.61 秒，finetuned-en 0.76 → 0.60 秒（×1.26–1.27），clone-en-long 3.37 → 3.01 秒（×1.12），design-en 和 auto-zh 不变（0.54 秒：没有参考音频，补齐很少）；音频是另一次生成（舍入不同使决定翻转）。CPU 上 clone-en 24.0 → 18.3 秒（×1.31），design-en ×1.02，两者都与精确路径相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4704":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-661","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**`lowest` 下的训练**（在这一轮之后完成，对比 `a1350b3`，在 3090 上微调 Qwen3-TTS 1.7B）：这个阶段的大部分时间花在内核里，为 AdamW 每一步临时张量占用的透明大页整理内存（采样的调用栈：每一步的 `addcdiv_`），而页缓存占满了内存。`lowest` 阶段不再使用大页（`compute.cpu_allocator` 对其他阶段保留大页，没有大页时它们的微调慢 5–15 %），主机端优化器的副本各放在一个缓冲区中，按 dtype 经过锁页缓冲区传输：201 秒 → 82.8 秒（第一步 59.5 → 13.3 秒，每步 12.8 → 5.5 秒），GPU 峰值 9.1 → 7.3 GB，权重和损失相同；`lowest` 下的 F5-TTS 和 OmniVoice 不变且相同。每一步其余的时间是 CPU 上 AdamW 的运算。每个训练器标准微调的剖析没有显示数据加载的开销；它们在主机上的时间花在写检查点（F5-TTS 9 秒的阶段中占 4 秒）和模块初始化的随机抽取上，训练器按上游的做法重放这些抽取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4705":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-662","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**`compute.compile`**（主动开启，inductor 默认模式），预热请求和首次请求的代价，对比即时执行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4706":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-663","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"4707":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-664","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"预热","locale":"zh-CN"},"4708":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-665","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"编译代价","locale":"zh-CN"},"4709":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-666","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"4710":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-667","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"zh-CN"},"4711":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-668","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"×1.34","locale":"zh-CN"},"4712":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-669","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"+63 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4713":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-670","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performan