/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"损失","locale":"zh-CN"},"4734":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-691","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"`sdpa_reduced_precision`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4735":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-692","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"VoxCPM ×1.20–1.28（其整个缓存上的注意力）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4736":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-693","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"无；其他引擎都完全相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"4737":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-694","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"`fp16_accumulation`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4738":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-695","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"F5-TTS ×1.11，IndexTTS 1.5 ×1.21","locale":"zh-CN"},"4739":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-696","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"GPT-SoVITS ×0.6","locale":"zh-CN"},"4740":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-697","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"`tf32`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4741":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-698","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"Qwen3-TTS base ×1.13","locale":"zh-CN"},"4742":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-699","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"GPT-SoVITS ×0.67–0.75（音频相同）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4743":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-700","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"`cudnn_benchmark`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4744":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-701","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"测不出","locale":"zh-CN"},"4745":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-702","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"改变声码器的结果位","locale":"zh-CN"},"4746":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-703","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"四个一起","locale":"zh-CN"},"4747":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-704","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"VoxCPM、F5-TTS、IndexTTS 1.5、Fish Speech、CosyVoice 3、GPT-SoVITS v4 ×1.1–1.3","locale":"zh-CN"},"4748":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-705","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**同时处理多个请求**（同时提交 8 段不同文本，不带种子）：微批处理（`tts.micro_batch`）使 Qwen3-TTS 快 2.6 倍（6.34 → 2.42 秒，中位延迟 3.97 → 2.39 秒）；对 OmniVoice 只快 10 %，中位延迟翻倍；对 GPT-SoVITS 快 27 %，而不批处理、两个任务同时运行更好（5.32 → 4.00 秒：文本前端与另一个任务的合成重叠）。单独设置 `compute.gpu_jobs = 2` 对单个引擎没有收益：一个引擎在一个设备上一次只运行一次调用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4749":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-706","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**尝试过但没有保留。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"4750":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-707","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**训练中融合的 AdamW**：每步优化快 1.5 倍（0.7 B 个 float32 参数：69 → 47 毫秒），但全量微调的每步时间几乎不变（CosyVoice 2 `llm` 0.121 → 0.112 秒，VoxCPM `full` 0.311 → 0.296 秒，Qwen3-TTS `speaker` 没有变化），且结果会改变：不提供。在 CUDA 上每个训练器默认已经使用 torch 的多张量（`foreach`）Adam，与上游一样。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4751":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-708","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**把 OmniVoice 每步的前向捕获为 CUDA Graph**：结果相同，快 2 %。不开 profiler 时它的语言模型使 GPU 约 90 % 忙碌，可节省的内核发出时间很少。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4752":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-709","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**直接加载到设备**：页缓存已热时一次加载用时 1.6–4.8 秒，其中 0.5–1.7 秒是在主机上复制张量，进程中的第一个模型还要付出约 2 秒的导入时间（torch、inflect）；直接加载到设备会失去使卸载零开销的主机副本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4753":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-710","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**无分类器引导合成一批**：F5-TTS、CosyVoice、IndexTTS 的 s2mel、OmniVoice 和 VoxCPM 本来就是这样（与上游一样）；GPT-SoVITS v3–v5 的 CFM 调用两次估计器，合成一批会改变结果位。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4754":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-711","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-优化g2","content":"**训练的 `low` 预设**（梯度检查点）对比方案的每步 +35 %：F5-TTS +6 %，VoxCPM +51 %，Qwen3-TTS +80 %，OmniVoice +104 %（G0 的运行）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4755":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-712","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"**原生实现对比 0.1**（引擎工作进程版本，运行上游的代码；标签 `v1-engine-workers`），在空闲的 `cuda:0` 上测量（2026-10-18），双方都用各自的 GPU 默认设置：G0 用例集去掉 Fish Speech（0.1 的克隆在 GPU 上失败，Fish Speech）和 VoxCPM（0.1 没有），每一方一个进程，每个用例运行三次。预热取第 2–3 次中最快的一次；首次请求包含加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4756":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-713","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"用例","locale":"zh-CN"},"4757":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-714","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"预热，0.1 → 原生","locale":"zh-CN"},"4758":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-715","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"提升","locale":"zh-CN"},"4759":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-716","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"首次请求，0.1 → 原生","locale":"zh-CN"},"4760":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-717","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"Qwen3-TTS cv-en-aiden","locale":"zh-CN"},"4761":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-718","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"4.04 → 0.78 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4762":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-719","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"×5.2","locale":"zh-CN"},"4763":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-720","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"13.1 → 4.5 秒","locale":"zh-CN"},"4764":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-721","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"Qwen3-TTS base-clone-en","locale":"zh-CN"},"4765":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-722","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#对比-01以及-gpu-上的契约测试g3","content":"6.23 → 1.26 秒","locale":"zh-CN"}