有 VoxCPM 自己数据文件夹中的 18 个），`cuda:1` 限制为 4 GB 时 **144 个通过**（`MIZUOTO_TEST_SETTINGS='{\"compute\": {\"vram_limit_mb\": 4096}}'`，小于大模型（Fish Speech S2 Pro、IndexTTS 2、Qwen3-TTS 1.7B）所需，所以它们在整个栈中流式加载、部分加载；2 小时 6 分钟）。限制显存时最慢的测试是一个很长的 Qwen3-TTS 请求（旁白微调模型的种子测试：单独运行 2,778 秒，整体加载时 322 秒）：流式加载的自回归模型每生成一个 token 都要复制一次它的流式层。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4802":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-759","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"2026-10-19，一张 RTX 3090（`cuda:0`），机器空闲，G0 用例以流式运行（实验工作区的 `perf/g8/`：`run.sh`、`single.sh`、`monitor.py`，每 0.2 秒采样显卡已用显存和进程树的内存；0.1 的引擎 worker 与其主进程一起计入）。温请求和首段音频时间取第 2–3 次运行中最好的一次；`stack.py` 记录 `first_chunk_seconds`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4803":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-760","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"用例","locale":"zh-CN"},"4804":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-761","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"温请求，0.1 → 原生","locale":"zh-CN"},"4805":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-762","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"首段音频，0.1 → 原生","locale":"zh-CN"},"4806":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-763","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"Qwen3-TTS base-clone-en","locale":"zh-CN"},"4807":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-764","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"6.38 → 1.52 s","locale":"zh-CN"},"4808":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-765","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"6.38 → 