elopment-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"首段音频从不晚于 0.1；0.1 返回整段音频的地方（Qwen3-TTS）早了 12–18 倍。每次运行一个模型（每个栈一个用例）时的峰值内存，0.1 → 原生 → 原生且 `compute.host_copies = off`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4837":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-794","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"4838":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-795","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"显存 MB","locale":"zh-CN"},"4839":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-796","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"内存 MB（匿名）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4840":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-797","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"Qwen3-TTS 1.7B CustomVoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"4841":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-798","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"4,493 → 4,495 → 4,487","locale":"zh-CN"},"4842":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-799","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"1,558 → 5,235 → 4,244","locale":"zh-CN"},"4843":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-800","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"CosyVoice 2","locale":"zh-CN"},"4844":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-801","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"3,375 → 3,651 → 3,647","locale":"zh-CN"},"4845":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-802","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"4,885 → 4,231 → 3,445","locale":"zh-CN"},"4846":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-803","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"GPT-SoVITS v2","locale":"zh-CN"},"4847":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-804","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"1,973 → 1,509 → 1,507","locale":"zh-CN"},"4848":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-805","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"2,959 → 3,779 → 3,467","locale":"zh-CN"},"4849":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-806","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"IndexTTS 2","locale":"zh-CN"},"4850":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-807","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"9,337 → 6,907 → 6,889","locale":"zh-CN"},"4851":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-808","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"7,459 → 8,537 → 8,318","locale":"zh-CN"},"4852":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-809","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#与-01-对比首段音频和内存g8","content":"显存与 0.1 相差不超过 10 % 或更少（CosyVoice 2 多 8 %，GPT-SoVITS 和 IndexTTS 少四分之一）。内存在 0.1 直接加载到 GPU 的地方（transformers 的 `device_map`，Qwen3-TTS）更高：Mizuoto 先在内存中构建每个模型，再由模型管理器放置，并默认把它保留为主机副本，这样卸载时无需传输（内存）；关闭主机副本时，峰值就是这一步的暂存。0.1 的可选加速器（vLLM、TensorRT）在这里的任何环境中都没有安装，没有对比。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4853":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-810","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"在 RTX 3090 上测量（2026-10-18），测试工具现在记录每个阶段中最紧的那一次调用（工作内存对比它自己的估算；一个阶段最大的工作内存和最大的估算可能来自不同的调用，例如参考音频的编码和解码）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4854":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-811","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"**解码器**，每个输出位置的字节数（在短文本和约 30 秒的文本上测量，再加五分之一）：VoxCPM 的 VAE 解码每个位置 1,277（1.5）和 643（2），原估算 256；参考音频编码每个采样 1,395 和 3,100，原估算 256；Fish Speech 的编解码器每个采样 1,922（自 G1 起非原地的 Snake 用得更多），原估算 384；IndexTTS 的 BigVGAN 1,057（2）以及 771 加 256 MB（1.5），原估算 256。提高之后，每一次解码器调用，无论冷启动还是预热、短文本、长文本还是 8 条一批（OmniVoice、GPT-SoVITS），都不超过估算的 82 %（IndexTTS 1.5 的 BigVGAN；Fish 的编解码器 73 %，VoxCPM 的 VAE 74 %）；所有阶段中最接近估算的是长文本上 IndexTTS 2 的 GPT，90 %，未改动且在估算之内。Qwen3-TTS 1.7B 在 8 GB 上限下完整加载；在 4 GB 下它的 talker 部分加载，`meta.memory.partial` 和日志说明是哪个组件、为什么、预算多少。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4855":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-812","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"**训练**，每种方法以配方的默认批量运行（G1 用的是测试夹具较小的批量），各预设下的峰值（MB）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4856":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-813","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"微调","locale":"zh-CN"},"4857":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-814","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"`standard`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4858":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-815","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"`low`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4859":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-816","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"`lowest`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4860":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-817","page_id":"/