rformance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"8,661 / 10,222 / 14,498","locale":"zh-CN"},"4890":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-847","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"3,116 / 3,301 / 9,094","locale":"zh-CN"},"4891":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-848","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"2,970 / 3,301 / 9,094","locale":"zh-CN"},"4892":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-849","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#显存估算的校准","content":"原来的经验公式几乎都低于这些峰值（GPT-SoVITS 低 5 倍，VoxCPM 的 `lowest` LoRA 低至 3.4 倍），对 Fish Speech 的 LoRA 估算为 14.1 GB，而它在默认批量下会超出 24 GB 显卡。现在的估算是这些峰值按基础模型大小缩放，再加一成和 512 MB，峰值随批量变化的地方也随批量调整；没有预设放得下时，警告会给出放得下的批量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4893":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-850","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"在 RTX 3090 上测量（2026-10-18），torch 2.8.0+cu128、flash-attn 2.8.3（torch 2.8 唯一的 wheel）、xFormers 0.0.32.post2（单独一个环境：它与 flash-attn 2.8.3 不能同时导入）和 SageAttention 1.0.6（Triton；2.x 需要 `nvcc`，SageAttention 3 需要 Blackwell GPU）。从 G0 用例集的请求中记录了每个调用点的调用（17 个调用点，36 种调用），每个能接受某次调用的后端都在它上面运行，并与 `auto` 的结果比较。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4894":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-851","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"**内核。** FlashAttention 和 xFormers 与 `auto` 的差别处处都在 bf16/fp16 的舍入以内（余弦 1.000000）；SageAttention 会量化：在 BERT 上余弦 0.98，在 VoxCPM 的双向 DiT 注意力上 0.78（最大误差 12）。在这些尺寸下，这些包每次调用都比 SDPA 慢（单查询步骤 0.13–0.5 倍，提示 0.15–0.9 倍），只有 FlashAttention 能跳过填充键的地方例外：VoxCPM 在预分配缓存上的步骤，4.4 倍（head dim 128）和 2.3 倍（64）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"4895":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-852","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"**请求**，预热时间对比 `auto`，音频对比 `auto` 的音频（G0 用例集，一块 GPU，空闲，每个用例三次；\"另一次生成\"：同一请求的另一种结果，如同换了一个种子）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"4896":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-853","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"用例","locale":"zh-CN"},"4897":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-854","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"`sdpa`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4898":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-855","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"`flash`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4899":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-856","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"`xformers`","locale":"zh-CN"},"4900":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-857","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"`sage`（设置 `approx_ok` 之前）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4901":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-858","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"`fast`（现在）","locale":"zh-CN"},"4902":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-859","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"Qwen3-TTS base / 自定义音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"4903":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-860","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-performance#gpu-上的注意力后端","content":"1.00 相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"4904":{"id":"/docs/development-performance-861","page_id":"/docs/development-performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-p