cs/development-release-74","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"设备","locale":"zh-CN"},"5175":{"id":"/docs/development-release-75","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"平台","locale":"zh-CN"},"5176":{"id":"/docs/development-release-76","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"NVIDIA（CUDA）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5177":{"id":"/docs/development-release-77","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"Linux、Windows","locale":"zh-CN"},"5178":{"id":"/docs/development-release-78","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"AMD（ROCm，torch 里也叫 `cuda`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5179":{"id":"/docs/development-release-79","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"Linux","locale":"zh-CN"},"5180":{"id":"/docs/development-release-80","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"Intel（XPU）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5181":{"id":"/docs/development-release-81","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"Linux、Windows","locale":"zh-CN"},"5182":{"id":"/docs/development-release-82","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"Apple 芯片（MPS）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5183":{"id":"/docs/development-release-83","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"macOS arm64","locale":"zh-CN"},"5184":{"id":"/docs/development-release-84","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"5185":{"id":"/docs/development-release-85","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"全部","locale":"zh-CN"},"5186":{"id":"/docs/development-release-86","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"CI 在 Linux x86_64、Windows x86_64 和 macOS arm64 上，用 CPU 版 torch 测试 Python 3.10–3.13 的每个组合，并分别用 torch 2.8.0 和最新版测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5187":{"id":"/docs/development-release-87","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#torch-与平台","content":"代码为这些设备准备了相应的路径（设备探测、没有 float64 的设备上把 float64 模块放在 CPU、MPS 上不编译、只在 CUDA 上用 CUDA 图和半精度），并在模拟的设备上测试过，但还没有在 AMD、Intel 或 Apple 的硬件上验证。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5188":{"id":"/docs/development-release-88","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"每个发行包有自己的版本号，放在一个只含版本号的文件里；推送到 `main` 时改动了它，就发布这个发行包（见下文）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5189":{"id":"/docs/development-release-89","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5190":{"id":"/docs/development-release-90","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"谁的版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"5191":{"id":"/docs/development-release-91","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"标签","locale":"zh-CN"},"5192":{"id":"/docs/development-release-92","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"`mizuoto/version.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5193":{"id":"/docs/development-release-93","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"`mizuoto`（Web UI 的 `package.json` 手动跟随）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5194":{"id":"/docs/development-release-94","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"`v<版本>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5195":{"id":"/docs/development-release-95","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"`packages/native/fishspeech/mizuoto_fishspeech/version.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5196":{"id":"/docs/development-release-96","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"`mizuoto-fishspeech`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5197":{"id":"/docs/development-release-97","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"`mizuoto-fishspeech-v<版本>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5198":{"id":"/docs/development-release-98","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"`packages/native/indextts/mizuoto_indextts/version.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5199":{"id":"/docs/development-release-99","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"`mizuoto-indextts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5200":{"id":"/docs/development-release-100","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"`mizuoto-indextts-v<版本>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5201":{"id":"/docs/development-release-101","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"需要接受许可的包在自己的 `pyproject.toml` 里写明它适用的 Mizuoto 版本：`mizuoto>=0.2.0,<0.3`。它的代码跑在 Mizuoto 的运行时上，它的清单（选项、模型目录、许可）随 `mizuoto` 发布，所以：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5202":{"id":"/docs/development-release-102","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"**下限**是包含该包所用一切的最旧 Mizuoto 版本。CI 用 PyPI 上的这个版本测试该包（`oldest-mizuoto` 作业）；包开始用到更新的东西时提高下限，并先发布 Mizuoto。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5203":{"id":"/docs/development-release-103","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"**上限**在 Mizuoto 还是 0.x 时取下一个次版本。`check_gated_distribution`（在 `tests/core/test_engines.py`，由各包的 `test_<id>_package.py` 调用）在 Mizuoto 的版本超出范围时失败，所以 Mizuoto 发布越过上限时，也要提高范围并发布这两个包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5204":{"id":"/docs/development-release-104","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"**改动一个需要接受许可的引擎的选项**，也会改动 `mizuoto` 里它的清单：先发布带新清单的 Mizuoto，再发布把下限提高到该版本的包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5205":{"id":"/docs/development-release-105","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"已安装的需要接受许可的引擎与当前 Mizuoto 不匹配时（范围不包含当前版本，或它的 `OPTION_SCHEMA` 与清单不一致），`mizuoto doctor` 报告为错误，并给出 `pip install --upgrade mizuoto mizuoto-<id>`；`mizuoto version` 列出每个发行包的版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5206":{"id":"/docs/development-release-106","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#版本","content":"音色缓存按 Mizuoto 的版本区分，需要接受许可的引擎还按它自己发行包的版本区分，所以升级其中任何一个后会重建一次。某个版本不再认识的设置键会被忽略（见整体架构）。主机和它的远程 agent 必须使用同一个协议版本（`AGENT_PROTOCOL`，当前为 2）：版本不同时双方在 `hello` 时互相拒绝，并提示升级。更多见数据目录与兼容性。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5207":{"id":"/docs/development-release-107","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#wheelscriptsbuild_wheelspy","content":"**host**：在 `mizuoto/webui` 中 `bun install --frozen-lockfile` 和 `bun run build`（`--skip-web` 沿用现有的 `dist/`，Docker 的 `wheels` 阶段就是这样），检查 `dist/index.html` 存在，然后用 `uv build` 构建 `mizuoto` 的 sdist，再由它构建 wheel；构建所用的是 `mizuoto/`、`pyproject.toml` 和 `README.md` 的干净副本（没有 `__pycache__`，没有残留的 `build/`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5208":{"id":"/docs/development-release-108","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#wheelscriptsbuild_wheelspy","content":"**native**：`packages/native/` 下的每个包（或指定的那些），复制时去掉 `__pycache__`、`*.egg-info`、`build` 和 `dist`，用 `uv build --wheel` 构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5209":{"id":"/docs/development-release-109","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#wheelscriptsbuild_wheelspy","content":"默认输出到 `dist/`。脚本只用标准库加 uv 和 bun。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5210":{"id":"/docs/development-release-110","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#wheelscriptsbuild_wheelspy","content":"随 wheel 发布的包数据列在 `pyproject.toml` 的 `[tool.setuptools.package-data]` 里：构建好的界面、引擎清单、模型文件清单和许可全文、F5-TTS 的词表、GPT-SoVITS 文本前端的数据、Whisper 的词表。IndexTTS 的文本规范化 FST 随 `mizuoto-indextts` 发布。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5211":{"id":"/docs/development-release-111","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#冒烟测试scriptssmoke_wheelspy","content":"它像用户那样试用构建出的发行包。在源码目录之外的临时文件夹里，uv 新建一个环境（`--python`，默认 3.11），先从 `--torch-index` 装 torch（默认 CPU 构建；`--torch` 指定版本，默认 `torch>=2.8`），再一次性安装 `--dist` 里的 wheel，以及它缺少的发行包（来自 `--index`；`--others index`，默认），这次安装不得替换已装的 torch。由于每个发行包各自发布，一次发布要和用户手里其他已发布的包一起试：`mizuoto` 的 wheel 配上两个需要接受许可的引擎已发布的包，需要接受许可的引擎的 wheel 配上其范围允许的最新已发布 Mizuoto。已发布的那两个包不允许的 Mizuoto 版本会在这里失败。装上的版本必须就是这些 wheel 的版本。uv 不读取本机配置（`--no-config`，不带 `UV_*`/`PIP_*` 变量）。然后在临时数据目录里：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5212":{"id":"/docs/development-release-112","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#冒烟测试scriptssmoke_wheelspy","content":"`mizuoto version`、`mizuoto env vars` 和 `mizuoto doctor`：每个引擎都必须可用；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5213":{"id":"/docs/development-release-113","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#冒烟测试scriptssmoke_wheelspy","content":"导入每个引擎的实现和训练器（`get_engine`），导入 `mizuoto` 和需要接受许可的包的每个模块，确认由源码构建的发行包里与代码放在一起的每个数据文件都装上了（引擎运行时会读的那些还要真正读一遍）；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5214":{"id":"/docs/development-release-114","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#冒烟测试scriptssmoke_wheelspy","content":"用 dummy 引擎执行一次 `mizuoto speak`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5215":{"id":"/docs/development-release-115","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#冒烟测试scriptssmoke_wheelspy","content":"服务器：`/api/v1/app/health`、界面，以及经 API 用 dummy 引擎合成一次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5216":{"id":"/docs/development-release-116","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#ci-与发布工作流","content":"`.github/workflows/ci.yml` 按每次推送和拉取请求改动的内容检查：Mizuoto、某个需要接受许可的包、Web UI、文档站（见测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5217":{"id":"/docs/development-release-117","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#ci-与发布工作流","content":"`.github/workflows/release.yml` 在推送到 `main` 且改动了某个版本文件（`mizuoto/version.py`、`packages/native/*/mizuoto_*/version.py`）时、推送 `v*` 或 `mizuoto-*-v*` 标签时（GitHub 对标签不应用路径过滤）以及手动触发时运行（输入 `packages`：`all`、`mizuoto`、`mizuoto-fishspeech` 或 `mizuoto-indextts`）。同一引用同时只运行一次发布，且不会被取消。依赖和 CI 一样用 uv 安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5218":{"id":"/docs/development-release-118","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#ci-与发布工作流","content":"`plan`：`python scripts/ci.py release` 决定这次发布什么。推送发布它改动了版本文件的每个发行包（文件列表来自 compare API）；标签发布它指明的那个，且必须等于其版本（Mizuoto 0.2.0 对应 `v0.2.0`，mizuoto-indextts 0.2.1 对应 `mizuoto-indextts-v0.2.1`）；手动触发发布输入指定的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5219":{"id":"/docs/development-release-119","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#ci-与发布工作流","content":"`checks`：把 `ci.yml` 本身作为可复用工作流调用，检查这次推送改动的内容（版本文件检查它所属的发行包；标签或手动触发检查全部）。CI 自己对同一次推送到 `main` 的运行会跳过它的作业，所以不会重复运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5220":{"id":"/docs/development-release-120","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#ci-与发布工作流","content":"`build`（Ubuntu、Python 3.11、uv；构建 Mizuoto 的 Web UI 时还有 bun）：只构建要发布的，`build_wheels.py host` 和/或 `build_wheels.py native <id>…`；`twine check dist/*`；`dist/` 作为 `dist` 产物上传。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5221":{"id":"/docs/development-release-121","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#ci-与发布工作流","content":"`smoke`（Ubuntu，Python 3.10 和 3.13）：下载产物，运行 `smoke_wheels.py --dist dist --python <版本> --others index`，让这次发布与 PyPI 上已发布的其他发行包一起试用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5222":{"id":"/docs/development-release-122","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#ci-与发布工作流","content":"`publish`：在 `pypi` 环境中（可以要求审批），用 `TWINE_PASSWORD` 密钥（PyPI API 令牌，用户名 `__token__`）先 `twine upload --skip-existing` Mizuoto，再上传需要接受许可的 wheel，所以需要新 Mizuoto 的包不会先于它出现。PyPI 上已有的版本会被跳过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5223":{"id":"/docs/development-release-123","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#ci-与发布工作流","content":"`github-release`（仅标签）：以标签命名的 GitHub 发布，附上该发行包的文件，说明从同一发行包的上一个标签起自动生成；需要接受许可的引擎的发布不标记为 latest。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5224":{"id":"/docs/development-release-124","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#ci-与发布工作流","content":"所以发布一个发行包的通常流程是：改它的版本文件，推送到 `main`（发布工作流把它发布出去），再推送它的标签（`v<版本>` 或 `mizuoto-<id>-v<版本>`）生成 GitHub 发布（它上传时会发现这些文件已在 PyPI 上）。一次推送改了几个版本文件，就一起发布，Mizuoto 先发。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5225":{"id":"/docs/development-release-125","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"仓库根目录的 `Dockerfile` 构建一个镜像：服务器、它的 Web UI 和所有引擎，带 GPT-SoVITS 的日语和韩语前端（`GATED=1` 时还有 IndexTTS-2.5 的日语）。模型放在 `/data` 卷里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5226":{"id":"/docs/development-release-126","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"构建参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"5227":{"id":"/docs/development-release-127","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"5228":{"id":"/docs/development-release-128","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"5229":{"id":"/docs/development-release-129","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"`PYTHON`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5230":{"id":"/docs/development-release-130","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"`3.11`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5231":{"id":"/docs/development-release-131","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"wheels 阶段和镜像的基础镜像 `python:<版本>-slim`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5232":{"id":"/docs/development-release-132","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"`TORCH_INDEX`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5233":{"id":"/docs/development-release-133","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"`https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu128`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5234":{"id":"/docs/development-release-134","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"torch 的来源：CUDA（`cu126` … `cu132`）、ROCm（`rocm6.4` … `rocm7.2`）或 `cpu` 索引","locale":"zh-CN"},"5235":{"id":"/docs/development-release-135","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"`TORCH`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5236":{"id":"/docs/development-release-136","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"`torch>=2.8`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5237":{"id":"/docs/development-release-137","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"装哪个 torch","locale":"zh-CN"},"5238":{"id":"/docs/development-release-138","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"`GATED`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5239":{"id":"/docs/development-release-139","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"`0`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5240":{"id":"/docs/development-release-140","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"设为 `1` 时同时构建并安装需要接受许可的引擎（它们的许可仍需接受）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5241":{"id":"/docs/development-release-141","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"5242":{"id":"/docs/development-release-142","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"5243":{"id":"/docs/development-release-143","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"`web`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5244":{"id":"/docs/development-release-144","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"`oven/bun:1`：`bun install --frozen-lockfile`、`bun run build`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5245":{"id":"/docs/development-release-145","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"`wheels`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5246":{"id":"/docs/development-release-146","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"带编译器和 CMake 的 `python:<PYTHON>-slim`：构建 `pyopenjtalk==0.4.1` 的 wheel（它只发布源码包）、`build_wheels.py host --skip-web`，`GATED=1` 时再 `build_wheels.py native`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5247":{"id":"/docs/development-release-147","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"镜像本身","locale":"zh-CN"},"5248":{"id":"/docs/development-release-148","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"`python:<PYTHON>-slim`：先从 `TORCH_INDEX` 装 torch，再装 wheel 及 `mizuoto[gptsovits-ja,gptsovits-ko]`（以及 `mizuoto-indextts[ja]`），其余依赖来自 PyPI；`MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR=/data`，`/data` 卷，端口 7869，对 `/api/v1/app/health` 的健康检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"5249":{"id":"/docs/development-release-149","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#docker","content":"镜像里不装任何系统包：PyAV、torch 和各文本库的原生代码都在它们的 wheel 里。镜像里没有 C 编译器，所以 `compute.compile` 以即时执行方式运行（只警告一次）。镜像的用法见 Docker。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5250":{"id":"/docs/development-release-150","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#模型镜像scriptsmirror_modelspy","content":"`downloads.repository = \"mizuoto-model\"` 让 Mizuoto 先从它的镜像仓库（`downloads.mirror_repo`，默认 `licyk/mizuoto-model`，Hugging Face 与 ModelScope 同名）下载，镜像缺的文件再从各模型的官方仓库补齐，所以不完整的镜像也能用。镜像里的文件按 Mizuoto 存放的方式排列：模型在 `<engine>/<model>/<path>`，共享资源在 `_assets/<engine>/<asset>/<path>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5251":{"id":"/docs/development-release-151","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#模型镜像scriptsmirror_modelspy","content":"`build` 把已安装的目录模型和共享资源排到 `OUT` 下（尽量用硬链接），每个文件对照固定的大小和 SHA-256 检查（`--no-verify` 只查大小），并写出 `MIRROR.json`（每个文件的路径、大小、SHA-256 和官方来源）与 README。压缩包部分（`unpack`）解压后不保留，所以只从官方下载。需要接受许可的引擎默认不包含，除非 `--gated`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5252":{"id":"/docs/development-release-152","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#模型镜像scriptsmirror_modelspy","content":"`upload` 用 `hf upload-large-folder` 发布（需要 `hf auth login`），`--modelscope` 时再用 `modelscope upload`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5253":{"id":"/docs/development-release-153","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#模型镜像scriptsmirror_modelspy","content":"`check` 用 HEAD 请求列出已发布的镜像缺少哪些目录文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5254":{"id":"/docs/development-release-154","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#模型镜像scriptsmirror_modelspy","content":"发布镜像是镜像维护者的步骤，权重保留各自的许可。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5255":{"id":"/docs/development-release-155","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#文档站","content":"本站在 `site/`，基于 fumadocs（TanStack Start + Vite），用 bun 构建为静态文件（`.output/public`）。`.github/workflows/site.yml` 把它发布到 GitHub Pages：推送到 `main` 且改动了 `site/` 时（或手动触发），它运行站点的检查，以 `VITE_BASE_PATH=/Mizuoto/` 构建（Pages 在 `https://licyk.github.io/Mizuoto/` 下提供；路由和搜索索引跟随 Vite 的 base），加上 `.nojekyll`，再用 `GITEE_RSA_PRIVATE_KEY` 密钥（对本仓库有写权限的 SSH 密钥）经 SSH 把输出强制推送到 `gh-pages` 分支。仓库的 Pages 设置以该分支为来源。`site/vercel.json` 可直接用于在根路径部署到 Vercel。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5256":{"id":"/docs/development-release-156","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#文档站","content":"CI 的 `site` 作业在 `site/` 中依次运行 `bun install --frozen-lockfile`、`bun run check`、`bun run test` 和 `bun run build`，只在 `site/` 有改动时运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5257":{"id":"/docs/development-release-157","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#文档站","content":"页面在 `site/content/docs/`：`<slug>.mdx` 是简体中文（默认语言 `zh-CN`），`<slug>.en.mdx` 是英文，两者结构相同。侧边栏是 `meta.json` 与 `meta.en.json`，以 `---标题---` 分组。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5258":{"id":"/docs/development-release-158","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#文档站","content":"页首的 frontmatter 有 `title`、`description` 和 `icon`（Lucide 图标名）。可用的 MDX 组件见 `site/src/components/mdx.tsx`：`Cards`/`Card`、`Callout`、`Tabs`/`Tab`、`Steps`/`Step`、`Accordions`/`Accordion` 和 `Mermaid`（`chart` 属性，在浏览器中从 CDN 加载 Mermaid 渲染，随站点的明暗主题）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5259":{"id":"/docs/development-release-159","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#文档站","content":"`prepare-static-output.mjs` 确认 `meta.json` 中的每个页面都生成了 `docs/<slug>/index.html`，并把 `_shell.html` 复制为 `404.html`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5260":{"id":"/docs/development-release-160","page_id":"/docs/development-release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-release#文档站","content":"`src/lib/i18n-content.test.ts` 要求每个中文页面都有英文版，两个侧边栏的页面顺序一致。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5261":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","type":"page","content":"运行时","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-runtime","locale":"zh-CN"},"5262":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-0","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime","content":"引擎怎样在 Mizuoto 的进程里运行：运行时的各部分（设备、模型句柄与管理器、层、注意力、采样），请求上下文，引擎不得改动全局状态的规则，LocalEngine，内存的各个层次，取消与超时，流式，远程引擎，以及查看这一切的命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5263":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-1","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"谁在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"5264":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-2","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-runtime#运行时","content":"运行时","locale":"zh-CN"},"5265":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-3","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"设备：`device.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5266":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-4","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"模型句柄与模型管理器","locale":"zh-CN"},"5267":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-5","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/de