d":"/docs/development-runtime-44","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"`mizuoto/runtime/runtime.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5307":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-45","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"`Engine.load` 收到的东西：`devices`（`DeviceService`）、`manager`（`ModelManager`）、`options`（`RuntimeOptions`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5308":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-46","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#谁在哪里","content":"`TtsService`、`AsrService` 和音色服务从不直接接触 `LocalEngine`：它们调用 `RuntimeService.loaded(ModelRef, device, dtype, options, request)`，使用它返回的句柄。本地还是远程对它们没有区别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5309":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-47","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#运行时","content":"`InferenceService.runtime` 在第一次加载模型时为每个进程建立一个 `Runtime`，所以从不加载模型的命令不会导入其中任何部分。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5310":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-48","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`DeviceService` 相当于 ComfyUI `model_management.py` 中设备相关的那一半，只是做成了对象而不是模块全局变量。设备名用 Mizuoto 的写法：`cpu`、`cuda:N`（NVIDIA，或 ROCm 上的 AMD）、`xpu:N`、`mps`；解析 `auto` 是核心的事（`ComputeService.resolve_device`）。引擎拿到的是真正的 `torch.device`；没有任何东西去收窄 `CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5311":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-49","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`memory(device)`：（空闲，总量）字节数；在 CUDA 上，torch 占着但没用的显存也算空闲。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5312":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-50","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`empty_cache(device)`、`synchronize(device)`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5313":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-51","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`supports(device, dtype)` 和 `pick_dtype(device, requested, supported, cpu)`：组件用哪种精度运行，依据用户的 `engines.<id>.dtype` 和引擎给出的偏好顺序（CPU 上除非指定都用 fp32；GTX 16xx 显卡不用 fp16）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5314":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-52","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`is_oom(error)`：一个异常是否表示设备内存不足，不导入 torch。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5315":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-53","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`float64_device(device)`：以 float64 计算的模块在哪里运行——该设备，或在没有 float64 的设备（MPS、不支持 fp64 的 XPU）上改用 CPU。`pin_to_cpu(module)` 让这样的模块在父模块移动时留在 CPU 上；CosyVoice 3 的 F0 预测器用到这两者。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5316":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-54","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`probe_devices()`：torch 看到的加速器（CUDA、通过 HIP 的 ROCm、XPU、MPS）及其显存。核心的设备探测（`mizuoto/core/compute/probe.py`）先询问 `nvidia-smi`、`rocm-smi`/`amd-smi` 和平台，只有在已安装的构建可能找到它们没找到的 GPU 时，才在子进程中询问 torch（`python -m mizuoto.runtime.device`）；运行时加载了 torch 之后则在本进程中询问。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5317":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-55","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"引擎的 `DEVICES`（默认为所有设备类型）与其清单的 `devices` 一致；在 MPS 上 `torch.compile` 不生效，按原样运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5318":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-56","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#设备devicepy","content":"`torch_build()`：已安装的 torch 是为什么构建的、本机哪些加速器可用（`mizuoto doctor` 用它）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5319":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-57","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`ModelHandle`（`handle.py`，相当于去掉扩散部分的 ComfyUI `ModelPatcher`）包装一个带权重的 `nn.Module`：`name`（显示在已加载模型列表中，如 `omnivoice/omnivoice:model`）、`load_device`、`offload_device`（CPU）、`kind`（自回归语言模型为 `sequence`，其他为 `oneshot`）以及各项大小（`size_bytes`、`loaded_bytes`、`streamed_bytes`、`host_bytes`）。引擎只读取 `module`；`LoadedEngine` 在 `self.handles` 中列出它的句柄。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5320":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-58","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`ModelManager`（`manager.py`，相当于 ComfyUI 的 `load_models_gpu` / `free_memory`）记录每个已注册句柄的所有者（`<model id>@<device>`）和最后使用时间，并在请求的每个阶段（`ctx.use`、`ctx.run`）把句柄**整体或部分**放到设备上：空闲组件逐个单元让出显存，放不下的模型把部分权重留在内存中、在各层运行时流式加载到设备，显存不足的阶段以更多权重流式加载的方式精确地重新运行。策略（`policy.py`，`VramPolicy`）在每次加载时由 `compute` 设置得出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5321":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-59","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"5322":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-60","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"5323":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-61","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`register(owner, handles, mode, pinned)` / `unregister(owner)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5324":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-62","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"加载之后；卸载模型时（直接释放，不复制回来）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5325":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-63","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`use(handles, memory_required)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5326":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-64","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"包在每个阶段外；没有 `PHASED` 的引擎则包住整个调用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5327":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-65","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`after_oom(handles)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5328":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-66","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`ctx.run` 重试前的清理","locale":"zh-CN"},"5329":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-67","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`release_idle(device)`、`drop_host_copies()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5330":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-68","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"腾空一块 GPU（微调前、显存不足后）；内存不足时","locale":"zh-CN"},"5331":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-69","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"`resident()`、`owner_usage(owner)`、`owner_placements(owner)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5332":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-70","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"已加载模型列表、`meta.memory` 及其 `partial` 报告","locale":"zh-CN"},"5333":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-71","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"阶段、预算与显存模式、单元与流式加载、主机副本、让出显存、精确重试、工作显存估算及其校准，以及引擎要怎样配合：见显存与内存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5334":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-72","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#模型句柄与模型管理器","content":"在 CPU 上什么都不移动、不计数；除非 `DeviceService(simulate={\"cpu\": bytes})` 让它扮演一块 GPU（测试与一致性验证工具：`compute.simulate_vram_mb`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5335":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-73","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`ops.py`**：每个引擎都用 `ops` 命名空间而不是 `torch.nn` 来搭建模块。`ops.default` 里是同样的层，但**不做随机初始化**：构造一个大模型不花时间，也不抽随机数，所以加载永远不会碰到任何随机数生成器。`ops.cast` 还会在每次前向时把权重转换成输入的精度和设备，用于以一种精度存储、以另一种精度计算的组件。`init_random(module, generator)` 在测试里给 `default` 模块填上真正的权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5336":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-74","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`accel/`**：原生代码中的每一次注意力计算都写作 `accel.attention(q, k, v, *, site=SITE, mask=…, causal=…, scale=…, enable_gqa=…, dropout_p=…, mask_info=…)`，从不直接调用 SDPA（架构测试禁止在 `runtime/accel` 之外这样做）。每个 `Site` 保存它的**参照计算**，即上游在该处的精确计算；`compute.attention = auto`（默认）时运行参照计算，结果逐位相同。其他取值会绑定一个策略，按调用在 SDPA 的各内核、FlashAttention、xFormers 和 SageAttention 之间选择，带兼容性检查和回退；`features.apply` 设置主机的 `compute.fast` 开关，也是原生代码中唯一设置 `torch.backends` 标志的地方。见加速。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5337":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-75","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`loading.py`**：`load_state_dict`（safetensors，或以 `weights_only=True` 读取的 pickle）、`strip_prefix`、`replace_prefixes`、`fold_weight_norm`，以及默认严格的 `load_into`：缺少或多出的键都是错误，并写明是哪个键，除非引擎把它列为可忽略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5338":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-76","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`sampling.py`**：`hf_sample` / `hf_process`，按 transformers 的顺序执行它的 logits 处理器（重复惩罚、最少新 token、屏蔽、温度、top-k、top-p），然后是 `multinomial1`：在请求的生成器上执行 `torch.multinomial` 自己的算法，但不等待设备，所以带种子的抽样结果一致（无同步采样）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5339":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-77","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`lm/`**：`QwenDecoder`（带 transformers 数值行为和参数名的 Qwen2/Qwen3 解码器，以及 `mask_for`、`hf_sdpa`）、`DynamicCache`、需主动开启的 `BufferCache`（`compute.kv_cache = static`），以及用于工作显存估算的 `peak_bytes`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5340":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-78","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`graphs.py`**：`Graphs`、`LayerSteps`、`DecoderSteps`：把解码步骤捕获为 CUDA Graph，重放即时执行的内核（`compute.cuda_graphs`），见 CUDA Graph。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5341":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-79","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`convert/onnx.py`**：直接从 protobuf 线格式读出 ONNX 图的节点和张量，不需要 onnx 包（CosyVoice 的语音分词器和 CAM++、GPT-SoVITS 的 G2PW 用到）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5342":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-80","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`compile.py`**：`compute.compile` 打开时，`Compiled` / `compile_module(module, enabled, name)` 把一个热点模块包进 `torch.compile(dynamic=True)`；引擎调用 `compiled or module`，编译器出错时改为即时执行。见 `torch.compile`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5343":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-81","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`policy.py`、`units.py`、`stream.py`**：显存策略、模型可流式加载的单元，以及每个设备一个的 `Streamer`（显存与内存）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5344":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-82","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"**`snapshot.py`**：`snapshot()` 对引擎调用必须保持不变的进程级状态做摘要；契约套件在请求前后比较它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5345":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-83","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#层注意力加载","content":"引擎共用的构件放在运行时旁边：`mizuoto/nn`（与 torchaudio、librosa、Whisper 逐位一致的 DSP，流模型，transformer，声码器，编解码器，SSL 和说话人编码器）和 `mizuoto/text`（对 Mizuoto 运行的模型与 transformers 结果一致的 BPE 分词器、Whisper 词表、wetext 规范化器）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5346":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-84","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"对引擎的每次调用都有一个 `RequestContext`（`mizuoto/runtime/context.py`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5347":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-85","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"成员","locale":"zh-CN"},"5348":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-86","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"5349":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-87","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`check_cancel()`、`cancelled()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5350":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-88","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"协作式取消。`check_cancel()` 抛出 `Cancelled`，它是 `BaseException`，模型代码里的 `except Exception` 吞不掉它。引擎在每个 token 或每个 ODE 步调用它","locale":"zh-CN"},"5351":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-89","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`bind()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5352":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-90","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"把上下文设为当前线程的请求；层里于是可以直接调用模块级的 `check_cancel()`，不必传参","locale":"zh-CN"},"5353":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-91","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`generator_for(device)`、`generator`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5354":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-92","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"请求在某个设备上的 `torch.Generator`，每个设备一个，用请求的种子初始化（没有种子则用新的熵）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5355":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-93","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`rng`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5356":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-94","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"请求的 `random.Random`，同样方式初始化","locale":"zh-CN"},"5357":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-95","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`reseed(seed)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5358":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-96","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"让请求的随机流从头开始（像 GPT-SoVITS 上游那样每段重新播种的引擎会用）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5359":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-97","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`progress(stage, value, message)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5360":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-98","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`loading:<部分>`、`generating` 等","locale":"zh-CN"},"5361":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-99","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`applied`、`warn(message)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5362":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-100","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"引擎实际使用的参数值和它的警告：两者都随结果返回","locale":"zh-CN"},"5363":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-101","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`text_pieces()`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5364":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-102","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"客户端发来的流式文本（`SynthesisTask.text_stream`）：一个真正的生成器，可以在别的线程上消费，取消时提前结束","locale":"zh-CN"},"5365":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-103","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`tmpdir`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5366":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-104","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`<cache>/scratch/<引擎>/` 下的临时目录，调用结束时删除","locale":"zh-CN"},"5367":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-105","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`use(handles, memory)`、`run(name, handles, fn, memory, generators, fallback)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5368":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-106","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"请求的一个阶段：放上它的组件并为其工作显存留出空间；`run` 另加显存不足后的精确重试和可选的回退（显存与内存）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5369":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-107","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`accel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5370":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-108","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"模型的注意力策略，随上下文绑定（加速）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5371":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-109","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#请求上下文","content":"`log`、`device`、`seed`、`request_id`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5372":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-110","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#全局状态","content":"引擎与服务器、彼此以及测试共用一个进程，所以原生代码**不改动任何进程级状态**。`test_native_code_leaves_global_state_alone` 在 `runtime`、`nn`、`text`、各引擎和需要接受许可的包里禁止：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5373":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-111","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#全局状态","content":"给全局随机数生成器播种：`torch.manual_seed`、`torch.cuda.manual_seed(_all)`、`random.seed`、`np.random.seed`；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5374":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-112","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#全局状态","content":"`os.chdir`、`sys.path.append` / `insert`、`os.putenv`、给 `os.environ` 赋值；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5375":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-113","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#全局状态","content":"`logging.basicConfig`、`torch.set_default_dtype`、`torch.use_deterministic_algorithms`、给 `torch.backends.*` 和 `torch._inductor.config` 赋值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5376":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-114","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#全局状态","content":"随机数改从 `ctx.generator_for(device)` 和 `ctx.rng` 取。这也是对照得以成立的前提：一个用种子 *s* 初始化的全新 `torch.Generator`，与 `torch.manual_seed(s)` 之后 torch 的默认生成器产出完全相同的序列，在 CPU 和 CUDA 上都是如此（`scripts/parity/check_rng.py`）。所以一个引擎只要在请求的生成器上按上游的顺序做上游的抽样，就能逐次复现上游带种子的运行。上游在构建或准备某个东西时从全局生成器抽过随机数的地方，移植版会在私有生成器上重放这些抽样，而不去碰全局生成器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5377":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-115","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#全局状态","content":"训练阶段是唯一的例外：它们在自己的进程里运行，并在那里给进程级生成器播种（见训练器）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5378":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-116","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"`RuntimeService.engine(engine_id, device)` 在第一次用到时创建一个 `LocalEngine`，并把它作为显存持有者 `engine:<引擎>:<设备>` 登记到 `ComputeService`。它的状态是 `stopped`（什么都没加载）、`ready`、`busy`，或者引擎实现导入失败时的 `crashed`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5379":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-117","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"**加载**（`LocalEngine.load`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5380":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-118","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"`start()` 用 `get_engine(id)` 找到实现（导入它的模块，不导入 torch）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5381":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-119","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"`make_room(model_id)`：运行时服务卸载超出 `compute.max_resident_models` 的、最久未用的空闲模型（固定的模型保留）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5382":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-120","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"构造 `LoadSpec(model_id, model_dir, variant, device, dtype, options)`；`options` 合并了引擎的加载选项和 `model_options(model_id)`，后者把模型所需共享资源的目录放进 `options[\"assets\"]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5383":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-121","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"在绑定了上下文、**不在** `torch.inference_mode()` 里的情况下运行 `Engine.load(spec, runtime, ctx)`；句柄登记到管理器，`describe()` 的结果保存为句柄的 `description`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5384":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-122","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"**调用**（`LocalHandle.prepare_voice`、`synthesize`、`convert`、`edit`、`call`）：每次都在调用线程（某个任务的线程）上、在 `torch.inference_mode()` 里运行，上下文已绑定，模型的句柄由 `manager.use(...)` 占住。种子取自任务的 `params[\"seed\"]`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5385":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-123","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#localengine在本进程中调用模型","content":"这是对照 E2-TTS 与上游时发现的一个 CPU 内核陷阱：`F.linear` 作用于跨步（非连续）的三维输入时，若权重需要梯度，或权重是*推理张量*（在 `torch.inference_mode()` 里创建的），就会走另一个内核，即使在 `no_grad` 下也是如此。上游的权重是普通的、需要梯度的参数，所以原生引擎保持 `nn.Module` 创建参数时的样子（不调用 `requires_grad_(False)`），模型也在推理模式之外加载。请求本身仍在推理模式里运行。两个陷阱的细节见引擎参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5386":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-124","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#流就是生成器","content":"`synthesize`、`convert` 和 `edit` 返回产出 `AudioChunk` 的生成器。`LocalEngine.stream` 惰性地驱动引擎自己的生成器：只有调用方索取下一块时引擎才运行，也只有这时它才绑定到线程、处在推理模式里。每一块都会被检查（必须是 `AudioChunk`），转成 float32 单声道 numpy 采样再交出去；第一块设定 `timings[\"first_chunk\"]`。调用方关闭流（`contextlib.closing`）就能提前停止，引擎的生成器也随之关闭。`TtsService` 逐块取出，客户端流式接收时再把每块转给 `StreamSink`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5387":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-125","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#取消与超时","content":"调用方传入一个 `EngineRequest`，带着它的 `cancel` 事件（任务的 `cancel_event`）、可选的 `timeout`、流式文本队列（`text_input`，由 `TextFeed` 填充）和 `progress` 回调。一个小的监视线程每 20 毫秒检查一次：把调用方的取消转到上下文的取消事件上；超时则把这次调用标为超时并取消它。引擎在下一次 `check_cancel()` 时停下；调用随之以 `CancelledError` 失败，超时则是 `OperationTimeoutError`。调用结束时，句柄把 `applied`、`warnings` 和 `timings[\"total\"]` 写回 `EngineRequest`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5388":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-126","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#错误","content":"引擎抛出的东西会变成核心的错误：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5389":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-127","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#错误","content":"`EngineError(message, detail, code)` 保留它的错误码（`error_from_code`），并在 detail 里加上引擎和设备；`Unsupported` 是 `capability_not_supported`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5390":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-128","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#错误","content":"内存不足（`is_oom`）时，把该设备上所有空闲组件移走（`release_idle`），并以 `compute_unavailable` 失败，`detail.reason = \"out_of_memory\"`；任务服务随后卸载所有 GPU 上未在使用的模型（`release_after_oom`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5391":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-129","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#错误","content":"其他任何异常都是 `engine_error`，detail 里（以及日志里）有异常名和回溯。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5392":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-130","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"内存在三个层次上管理：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5393":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-131","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"层次","locale":"zh-CN"},"5394":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-132","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"谁","locale":"zh-CN"},"5395":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-133","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"做什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"5396":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-134","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"组件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5397":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-135","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"`ModelManager`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5398":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-136","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"调用的每个阶段之前，同一设备上的空闲组件逐个单元让出显存腾地方；放不下的部分从内存流式加载（显存与内存）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5399":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-137","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5400":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-138","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"`RuntimeService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5401":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-139","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"所有引擎合计最多保留 `compute.max_resident_models`（默认 3）个已加载模型；加载前卸载最久未用的空闲模型。服务器的回收线程（每 10 秒）还会卸载空闲超过 `compute.unload_after_minutes`（默认 20；0 表示从不）或 `engines.<id>.idle_minutes` 的模型。`engines.<id>.pinned_models` 既不会为腾地方而卸载，也不会因空闲而卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"5402":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-140","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"5403":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-141","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"`ComputeService`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5404":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-142","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"每个 `LocalEngine` 都是一个显存持有者：**释放显存**（`POST /api/v1/compute/release`）卸载所有空闲持有者的全部模型并移走剩下的东西；有持有者忙时拒绝","locale":"zh-CN"},"5405":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-143","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"不会因为对显存的估算而拒绝加载模型：模型总是尝试加载，只有显存分配真正失败才算错误。任务因显存不足失败时（精确重试之后），`ComputeService.release_after_oom` 卸载所有 GPU 上未在使用的模型（即 ComfyUI 的 `unload_all_models`）；CPU 上的模型保留。在这一层之下组件怎样共用一个设备，见显存与内存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5406":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-144","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#内存","content":"任何 `engines.<id>.*` 设置的改动都会卸载该引擎的模型（`unload_engine`），下一个请求用新的设备、精度或加载选项重新加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5407":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-145","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"当一个引擎的设备是 `<主机>/<设备>`（例如 `engines.qwen3tts.device = \"gpu-box/cuda:0\"`）时，`RuntimeService.engine` 向 `RemoteService` 要一个 `RemoteEngine`：与那台主机上的 `mizuoto agent` 之间、针对一个设备上一个引擎的会话。agent 是一个完整的 Mizuoto，有自己的数据目录、模型和运行时；它在自己的进程里运行引擎，和主机完全一样。`RemoteEngineHandle` 与 `LocalHandle` 回应同样的调用。面向用户的配置见远程引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5408":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-146","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"**协议 2**（`mizuoto/core/remote/wire.py` 的 `AGENT_PROTOCOL`）在“已加载引擎”这一层工作。帧格式来自 `mizuoto/core/remote/frames.py`（4 字节长度、一个类型字节、JSON 正文，或 JSON 头加原始字节），走 TCP 或 TLS：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5409":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-147","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"主机连上后发送 `hello`，带令牌（用 `hmac.compare_digest` 比较）和协议版本。协议不同的 agent 会拒绝主机，提示在两台机器上安装相同版本的 Mizuoto；主机也同样拒绝这样的 agent。否则 agent 回复它的 `AgentInfo`：版本、设备、那里哪些引擎可用，以及已安装的模型。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5410":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-148","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"`open {engine, device}`，然后依次执行 `load`、`prepare_voice`、`synthesize`、`convert`、`edit`、`call`、`unload` 和 `status`；`cancel` 和 `text`（流式文本）随时可以发。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5411":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-149","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"agent 对每个操作先回 `progress`、`chunk`（二进制帧：float32 小端单声道）和 `file` 帧，最后是 `result` 或 `error`，并每 5 秒发一次心跳。超过 `remote.heartbeat_timeout`（60 秒）收不到任何帧，主机就以 `worker_failed`（`during = \"heartbeat\"`）关闭会话；下一个请求重新连接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5412":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-150","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"**按内容传文件。** 路径在另一台机器上没有意义。请求里提到的每个文件都变成 `mizuoto-file:<sha256>/<文件名>`：`have` 询问 agent 缺哪些，`put` 以 8 MiB 的帧发送缺的那些，并核对 SHA-256。agent 把它们存在 `<cache>/remote/files/`，一个月没有主机要过的文件会被删除。`prepare_voice` 写入的目录变成 `mizuoto-out:…`，其中的文件作为 `file` 帧传回主机自己的目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5413":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-151","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#远程引擎","content":"主机依据自己的模型目录和 agent 的模型列表做规划；agent 自己处理它的显存，训练始终在本机进行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5414":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-152","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#查看mizuoto-runtime-与-mizuoto-doctor","content":"`mizuoto runtime` 询问正在运行的服务器（通过数据目录里的 `server.json` 找到它），因为模型在服务器进程里；没有服务器时报告命令自身进程的情况。对应 `GET /api/v1/runtime` 和 `POST /api/v1/runtime/unload`，以及 Web UI 的**内存中的模型**面板（`LoadedModelsSheet`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5415":{"id":"/docs/development-runtime-153","page_id":"/docs/development-runtime","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-runtime#查看mizuoto-runtime-与-mizuoto-doctor","content":"`mizuoto doctor [ENGINE]` 就是 `RuntimeService.doctor`：已安装的 torch 构建与本机硬件（CUDA、ROCm、XPU、MPS、CPU）是否匹配，并给出安装正确构建的命令（`mizuoto/core/compute/torch_index.py`）；每个引擎可用还是缺失（以及缺什么）；导入不了的可选附加依赖（`Engine.EXTRAS`）；以及训练器缺的依赖。对应 `GET /api/v1/runtime/doctor` 和 `GET /api/v1/engines/{id}/doctor`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5416":{"id":"/docs/development-setup","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"page","content":"开发环境","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup","locale":"zh-CN"},"5417":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-0","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup","content":"从克隆仓库到跑起开发服务器、全部检查和一个真实引擎所需的环境与任务。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5418":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-1","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#python-环境","content":"Python 环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"5419":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-2","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#建立-venv","content":"建立 `.venv`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5420":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-3","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#先装-torch","content":"先装 torch","locale":"zh-CN"},"5421":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-4","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#以可编辑方式安装-mizuoto-和开发工具","content":"以可编辑方式安装 Mizuoto 和开发工具","locale":"zh-CN"},"5422":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-5","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#之后一律用这个解释器","content":"之后一律用这个解释器","locale":"zh-CN"},"5423":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-6","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"可选附加依赖","locale":"zh-CN"},"5424":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-7","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#web-uibun","content":"Web UI：bun","locale":"zh-CN"},"5425":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-8","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`scripts/dev.py` 的任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"5426":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-9","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#dev一边改一边看","content":"`dev`：一边改一边看","locale":"zh-CN"},"5427":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-10","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"在本机跑一个真实引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"5428":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-11","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup","content":"Mizuoto 的开发环境只有两部分：一个 Python 环境（`.venv`），里面装着 torch、以可编辑方式安装的 Mizuoto 和开发工具；以及给 Web UI 和文档站用的 bun。所有引擎都在这一个环境里运行，不需要另外构建什么。日常任务都通过 `scripts/dev.py` 运行，它只用标准库，在 Linux、macOS 和 Windows 上行为一致，跑的正是 CI 跑的那些工具。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5429":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-12","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#建立-venv","content":"用 Python 3.11 建一个隔离的虚拟环境（Mizuoto 支持 3.10–3.13，CI 四个版本都测；开发用 3.11）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5430":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-13","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#先装-torch","content":"torch 是 Mizuoto 的依赖，但它的构建（CUDA、ROCm、XPU、CPU）由你来选，所以先从与本机匹配的索引装它。开发和 CI 跑的所有测试用 CPU 版就够了：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5431":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-14","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#先装-torch","content":"要用 GPU，就改装 `mizuoto doctor` 给出的那个构建（例如 `…/whl/cu128`），各平台的命令见安装。之后再装 Mizuoto 不会替换这个构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5432":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-15","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#以可编辑方式安装-mizuoto-和开发工具","content":"开发工具同样列在 `pyproject.toml` 的 `[dependency-groups] dev` 里。不装那两个包，它们的测试会跳过，对应的引擎显示为缺失。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5433":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-16","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#之后一律用这个解释器","content":"`dev.py` 用运行它的那个解释器（`sys.executable`）调用 ruff、ty 和 pytest，而不是 `PATH` 上随便哪一个。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5434":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-17","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"有些文本前端需要默认安装之外的包。缺了它们，相应语言会以 `capability_not_supported` 失败，提示里附带安装命令；`mizuoto doctor` 也会把它们列为警告：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5435":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-18","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"附加依赖","locale":"zh-CN"},"5436":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-19","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"包","locale":"zh-CN"},"5437":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-20","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"5438":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-21","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ja]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5439":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-22","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"`pyopenjtalk==0.4.1`（只有源码包，需要 CMake 和 C++ 编译器）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5440":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-23","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"GPT-SoVITS 的日语","locale":"zh-CN"},"5441":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-24","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"`mizuoto[gptsovits-ko]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5442":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-25","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"`python-mecab-ko`、`jamo`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5443":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-26","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"GPT-SoVITS 的韩语","locale":"zh-CN"},"5444":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-27","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"`mizuoto-indextts[ja]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5445":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-28","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"`fugashi`、`unidic-lite`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5446":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-29","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"IndexTTS-2.5 的日语","locale":"zh-CN"},"5447":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-30","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"从源码检出安装：`uv pip install --python .venv/bin/python -e \".[gptsovits-ja,gptsovits-ko]\"`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5448":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-31","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#可选附加依赖","content":"ty 不跟随可编辑安装的路径钩子，所以 `pyproject.toml` 把 `tool.ty.environment.extra-paths` 设为 `packages/native/fishspeech` 和 `packages/native/indextts`，从源码解析 `mizuoto_fishspeech` 和 `mizuoto_indextts`。torch 和各可选附加依赖的包列在 `tool.ty.analysis.allowed-unresolved-imports` 里。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5449":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-32","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#web-uibun","content":"Web UI（`mizuoto/webui/`）和文档站（`site/`）用 bun 安装依赖、构建和测试。`dev.py` 先在 `PATH` 上找 `bun`，再找安装器默认的 `~/.bun/bin`，两处都没有时给出明确的提示而不是一串回溯。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5450":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-33","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#web-uibun","content":"构建出的 `dist/` 作为包数据随 wheel 发布；在没有 `dist/` 的源码检出里运行 `mizuoto webui`，只有 API，没有界面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5451":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-34","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`python scripts/dev.py` 不带参数会列出全部任务。任务名后面的选项原样传给底层脚本；不接受选项的任务收到选项会报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5452":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-35","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"5453":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-36","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5454":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-37","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`check`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5455":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-38","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"CI 跑的全部：`lint`、`typecheck-py`、`test-py`、`test-web`、`typegen-check`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5456":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-39","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`lint`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5457":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-40","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`ruff check .` 和 `ruff format --check .`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5458":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-41","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`format`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5459":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-42","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`ruff check --fix .` 和 `ruff format .`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5460":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-43","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`typecheck-py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5461":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-44","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"用 ty 检查 `mizuoto`、需要接受许可的引擎、`tests` 和 `scripts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5462":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-45","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`test-py [pytest 选项…]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5463":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-46","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"pytest；`live`、`engine`、`weights`、`e2e` 标记默认排除","locale":"zh-CN"},"5464":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-47","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`test-engines [引擎…] [-- pytest 选项]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5465":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-48","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"针对已安装模型的契约套件（`MIZUOTO_TEST_DEVICE=cpu\\|cuda:N`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5466":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-49","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`model-manifests [引擎…]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5467":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-50","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"固定目录中模型的文件（大小、SHA-256）（`scripts/model_manifests.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5468":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-51","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`wheels [all\\|host\\|native] [引擎…]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5469":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-52","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"把 `mizuoto`（含界面）和需要接受许可的引擎的 wheel 构建到 `dist/`（`scripts/build_wheels.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5470":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-53","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`smoke`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5471":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-54","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"在新环境里先装 CPU 版 torch，再装构建好的 wheel 并试用（`scripts/smoke_wheels.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5472":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-55","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`dev [--api-port] [--web-port] [--data-dir]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5473":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-56","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"同时启动 API 服务器（7869）和 Vite 开发服务器（5173）；Ctrl+C 一起停止","locale":"zh-CN"},"5474":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-57","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`web-install` / `web` / `web-dev`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5475":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-58","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"安装界面依赖 / 构建界面 / 只启动 Vite（需要已在运行的 API）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5476":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-59","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`test-web`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5477":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-60","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`bun run test`（vitest）和 `bun run typecheck`（vue-tsc）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5478":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-61","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`openapi`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5479":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-62","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"把 OpenAPI 模式打印到标准输出（`scripts/generate_openapi.py`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5480":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-63","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`typegen`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5481":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-64","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"由模式重新生成 `mizuoto/webui/src/api/schema.d.ts`（结果要提交）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5482":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-65","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"`typegen-check`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5483":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-66","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"重新生成后 `git diff --exit-code`：类型过期就失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"5484":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-67","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#scriptsdevpy-的任务","content":"文档站有自己的任务：`site-install`、`site-dev`、`site` 和 `test-site`（见发布）。对照工具不是 `dev.py` 的任务，它在 `scripts/parity/` 里（见测试）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5485":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-68","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#dev一边改一边看","content":"它以 `python -m mizuoto webui --no-open --port 7869 --strict-port` 启动 API（把仓库根目录放进 `PYTHONPATH`），以 `bun run dev` 启动 Vite，并把 `MIZUOTO_BACKEND=http://127.0.0.1:7869` 传给 Vite。Vite 把 `/api` 和 `/ws` 代理到 API，所以浏览器只用打开 `http://localhost:5173`。界面改动热更新；Python 改动（包括引擎代码）需要重启这个任务，因为模型加载在服务器进程里。API 没起来时，Vite 的代理只会每隔几秒打印一行提示，而不是刷屏的连接错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5486":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-69","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#dev一边改一边看","content":"`--data-dir` 让开发用的设置、数据库、模型和输出与日常数据目录分开（也可以设置 `MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5487":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-70","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"所有引擎都随 Mizuoto 一起装好了，真实引擎只差模型：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5488":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-71","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"模型加载进运行这条命令的进程（经 API 的请求则加载进服务器进程）。`mizuoto runtime` 列出正在运行的服务器加载了什么，`mizuoto runtime --unload` 释放它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5489":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-72","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"改了引擎代码，要在新进程里才生效：重启服务器，或重新运行命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5490":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-73","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"需要接受许可的引擎（Fish Speech、IndexTTS）要先装好它们的包，并执行 `mizuoto engine accept-licence <id>`，模型才能下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5491":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-74","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"开发机的 GPU 可能被其他进程占满。此时把引擎设到 CPU：`mizuoto config set engines.qwen3tts.device cpu`，或在契约测试里设 `MIZUOTO_TEST_DEVICE=cpu`。模型总是会尝试加载；显存不足时任务以 `compute_unavailable`（退出码 9）失败，所有 GPU 上未在使用的模型都会被卸载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5492":{"id":"/docs/development-setup-75","page_id":"/docs/development-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-setup#在本机跑一个真实引擎","content":"验证一个引擎的完整做法（小型随机模型、契约套件、与 0.1 的对照）见测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5493":{"id":"/docs/development-testing","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"page","content":"测试","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing","locale":"zh-CN"},"5494":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-0","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"Mizuoto 的测试怎样组织：核心依靠 dummy 引擎在几秒内跑通整条链路，每个引擎和训练器都在 CI 里用小型随机模型运行（也在模拟设备上流式加载运行），真实模型有契约套件，对照工具把原生引擎与参照实现逐采样比较，行为一致性分层判断，Web UI 用 vitest，CI 覆盖三个平台和四个 Python 版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5495":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-1","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"布局","locale":"zh-CN"},"5496":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-2","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#dummy-引擎","content":"dummy 引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"5497":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-3","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"夹具","locale":"zh-CN"},"5498":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-4","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#小型随机模型","content":"小型随机模型","locale":"zh-CN"},"5499":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-5","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#模拟设备上的流式加载","content":"模拟设备上的流式加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"5500":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-6","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"真实引擎的契约套件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5501":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-7","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"与参照实现对照","locale":"zh-CN"},"5502":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-8","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"行为一致性的层级与容差","locale":"zh-CN"},"5503":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-9","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"T4 结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5504":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-10","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"Web UI 测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"5505":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-11","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"CI","locale":"zh-CN"},"5506":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-12","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"Mizuoto 的测试分三层：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5507":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-13","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"**核心的测试**不需要 GPU，也不需要模型：dummy 引擎在测试自己的进程里，端到端地支撑起规划、任务、运行时服务、流式、取消和错误。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5508":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-14","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"**引擎的测试**在 CPU 上用权重随机的小模型运行每个引擎和训练器，包括在模拟设备上部分加载、流式加载的运行，同样在 CI 里跑。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5509":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-15","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"**真实模型**：契约套件让已安装的模型走完整条链路，对照工具把原生引擎与参照实现逐采样比较。开发者改动引擎时手动运行它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5510":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-16","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing","content":"`python scripts/dev.py check` 运行 CI 跑的全部：`lint`、`typecheck-py`、`test-py`、`test-web`、`typegen-check`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5511":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-17","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"`pyproject.toml` 定义了四个标记，默认全部排除（`addopts = \"-m 'not live and not engine and not weights and not e2e'\"`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5512":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-18","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"标记","locale":"zh-CN"},"5513":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-19","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"5514":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-20","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"`live`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5515":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-21","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"需要本仓库之外的东西","locale":"zh-CN"},"5516":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-22","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"`engine`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5517":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-23","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"针对已安装模型的引擎契约套件（`dev.py test-engines`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5518":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-24","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"`weights`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5519":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-25","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"需要已下载的模型权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"5520":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-26","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"`e2e`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5521":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-27","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"浏览器端到端测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"5522":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-28","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#布局","content":"所以 `python -m pytest`（或 `python scripts/dev.py test-py`）运行的是核心的测试和小模型测试。需要 torch 或某个可选包的测试，在没有它时会跳过（`pytest.importorskip`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5523":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-29","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#dummy-引擎","content":"`mizuoto/engines/dummy/` 是一个没有模型的完整引擎：引擎（`engine.py`）和训练器（`train.py`），清单是 `mizuoto/core/engines/manifests/dummy.toml`。它只导入 numpy，不需要 torch，并像所有引擎一样在测试的进程里运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5524":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-30","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#dummy-引擎","content":"它把每个字符变成一小段音调，音高取决于音色（预设、描述、参考音频的 SHA-256 或权重的哈希），所以不同音色听起来不同；随机数从 `ctx.rng` 抽取，所以同一个种子得到同样的音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5525":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-31","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#dummy-引擎","content":"它声明了**全部**能力：预设说话人、克隆、设计、风格与情感、流式输出与流式文本输入、音色转换、语音编辑、批处理、权重、`transcribe` 操作（所以 ASR 路径也能测）、训练。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5526":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-32","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#dummy-引擎","content":"引擎选项可以让它故意出错：`delay_ms`、`chunk_ms` 和 `load_delay_ms` 让它变慢；`fail = error | oom | crash | exception` 和 `fail_at_segment` 让它在指定位置失败、内存不足、报告崩溃（`worker_failed`）或抛出未处理的异常。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5527":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-33","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#dummy-引擎","content":"正是靠它，在下一次检查时停下的取消、内存不足变成 `compute_unavailable`、超时、卸载、空闲回收和流式音频块，都能在没有 GPU 的 CI 机器上几秒内测完。dummy 引擎也是用户试用 Mizuoto 的方式，`smoke_wheels.py` 也用它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5528":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-34","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"`tests/conftest.py`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5529":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-35","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"每个测试一个临时数据目录、一个空的环境（`environ={}`：开发者自己的 `MIZUOTO_*` 变量不会混进来）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5530":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-36","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"`services` 是 `make_services()` 的简写；`wav_file` 是一段 2 秒、22.05 kHz 的立体声 WAV。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5531":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-37","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"需要调度器和空闲回收的测试传 `start_background=True`。API 测试就是这样：`create_app(make_services(start_background=True), bound_host=\"127.0.0.1\", serve_ui=False)`，然后用 `TestClient`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5532":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-38","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"下载测试把 `services.models.http_transport` 换成 `httpx.MockTransport`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5533":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-39","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#夹具","content":"远程测试（`tests/core/test_remote.py`）在本机启动一个 `AgentServer`，由主机通过 TCP 驱动它的 dummy 引擎。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5534":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-40","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#小型随机模型","content":"`tests/engines_native/` 为每个引擎搭一个与引擎结构相同、只有几个小层、权重随机的模型，按引擎期望的样子写进临时目录（配置、字节级词表、safetensors），然后驱动真实的代码：用 `Runtime(DeviceService(), ModelManager(...))` 调 `Engine.load`，配一个 `RequestContext`，测音色提示、解码、批处理、可重复的种子和取消。`test_<id>_train_tiny.py` 用几段音频跑完引擎训练器的每个阶段。它们不需要下载，所以 CI 每次推送都用 CPU 版 torch 运行。需要接受许可的引擎的测试放在各自的包里，即 `packages/native/<pkg>/tests/`；`pyproject.toml` 的 `testpaths` 列出了这些目录，所以 `python -m pytest` 会连同其余测试一起运行它们，没装对应的包时跳过。它们用到 `tests/engines_native` 的辅助模块（`streaming.py`、`accel_checks.py`），所以要在仓库根目录运行；在包目录里运行也可以，根目录 `pyproject.toml` 的 `pythonpath` 会把根目录加进 `sys.path`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5535":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-41","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#小型随机模型","content":"这里还守着几条跨引擎的规则：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5536":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-42","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#小型随机模型","content":"**注意力。** 每个调用点传入的 `mask_info` 都与它的稠密掩码对照检查。`MIZUOTO_TEST_ACCEL=count python -m pytest tests/engines_native packages/native` 让每次注意力调用都经过一个策略：它统计调用点，并按调用点自己的参照方式计算；如果某个调用点从没以这种方式被调用到（例如有代码绕过 `compute.attention` 直接调用 SDPA），测试结束时就会失败。每个 conftest 列出本目录的调用点（`SITES_TESTED`）；检查本身在 `tests/engines_native/accel_checks.py`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5537":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-43","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#小型随机模型","content":"**训练显存工具。** `training_memory.py` 的 `check_checkpointing` 把训练器的阶段在全新的工作目录里跑两遍，一遍原样，一遍每个块都做梯度检查点，比较每个指标和每个写出的权重文件：必须完全相同。保持结果的其他工具（如把优化器状态放在内存里）用同样的方式检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5538":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-44","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#模拟设备上的流式加载","content":"显存管理改变的是权重放在哪里，不是计算什么，所以部分加载和流式加载的结果必须与整体加载完全相同。`tests/engines_native/streaming.py` 让 CPU 扮演一个给定大小的设备（`DeviceService(simulate=…, strict=True)`）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5539":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-45","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#模拟设备上的流式加载","content":"`check_streamed` 在三种设备大小下（每个单元都流式加载、一半、全部常驻）运行小型引擎，与普通 CPU 上的结果逐采样比较。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5540":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-46","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#模拟设备上的流式加载","content":"严格模式下，不在设备上的组件以 meta 张量存放，被流式加载的单元的权重只在该单元运行时存在。所以一个引擎在某个阶段用了没有为这个阶段放置（`ctx.use`）的组件，或者在单元的 `forward` 之外读了它的权重，就会在这里失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5541":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-47","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#模拟设备上的流式加载","content":"`check_oom_retry` 让阶段里的某一层第一次调用时内存不足：阶段以更多权重流式加载的方式重新运行，结果必须与未受干扰时完全相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5542":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-48","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#模拟设备上的流式加载","content":"显存管理本身见显存管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5543":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-49","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`tests/engines/test_contract.py` 对每个可用引擎的每个已安装目录模型，走完整的链路（规划 → 任务 → 运行时 → 引擎）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5544":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-50","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test-engines` 设置 `MIZUOTO_CONTRACT=1` 和 `MIZUOTO_TEST_ENGINES`（指定的引擎），以 `-m engine -v` 运行 `tests/engines`。套件使用 `MIZUOTO_TEST_DATA_DIR`（默认是平常的数据目录）里的模型，但在临时数据目录里运行，不往真实目录写任何东西，设备是 `MIZUOTO_TEST_DEVICE`（默认 `auto`）。`MIZUOTO_TEST_SETTINGS` 以 JSON 追加设置：`{\"compute\": {\"vram_limit_mb\": 4096}}` 让每个模型部分加载，在大卡上模拟一块 4 GB 的 GPU。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5545":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-51","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"5546":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-52","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"检查什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"5547":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-53","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_load_and_describe`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5548":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-54","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"加载后的 `describe` 与清单一致：采样率、预设说话人","locale":"zh-CN"},"5549":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-55","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_every_voice_mode_speaks_the_text`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5550":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-56","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"声明的每种音色模式，中英文都能发声（RMS > 0.01）、采样率正确、时长与文本相称；装了 ASR 时词错误率 \\< 0.35","locale":"zh-CN"},"5551":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-57","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_seed_repeats_and_segments`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5552":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-58","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"同一个种子逐采样复现；放不进一段的两句话切成两段（或由引擎自己处理长文本）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5553":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-59","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_streaming_sends_the_audio_as_it_is_made`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5554":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-60","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"能流式输出的模型：接收端得到其变体的粒度；按 token 流式输出时，一段会分成多块到达；存储的输出就是这些块拼起来的结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5555":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-61","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_streamed_audio_starts_early`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5556":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-62","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"逐 token 流式输出的模型在一个三句话请求的前四分之三时间内送出首段音频（GPT-SoVITS v2 使用固定长度的分块：默认在停顿处切分）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5557":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-63","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_unloading_frees_the_device`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5558":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-64","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"在 CUDA 上，请求之后卸载模型，已分配的显存比加载前最多多 64 MB（实际为 8 MB 的 cuBLAS 工作区）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5559":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-65","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_another_engine_in_between_changes_nothing`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5560":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-66","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"同一个带种子的请求，在进程中运行了另一个引擎的模型前后，音频相同","locale":"zh-CN"},"5561":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-67","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_cancel_stops_the_engine`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5562":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-68","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"在生成途中取消，作业在 GPU 上 2 秒内（CPU 上 30 秒内）变为 `cancelled`，模型仍然加载，下一个请求正常朗读","locale":"zh-CN"},"5563":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-69","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"`test_no_residue`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5564":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-70","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"进程级状态（工作目录、环境变量、`sys.path`、随机数生成器、torch 标志、日志处理器、警告过滤器）的摘要在多次请求前后相同，通过 `mizuoto.snapshot` 操作获取","locale":"zh-CN"},"5565":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-71","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"要克隆的参考音频来自 `MIZUOTO_TEST_REFERENCE`（加上 `MIZUOTO_TEST_REFERENCE_TEXT`），没有时由已安装的预设或设计模型说一段。需要接受许可的引擎只有在设了 `MIZUOTO_TEST_ACCEPT_LICENCES=1`（并装了它们的包）时才参加，许可只在临时目录里接受。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5566":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-72","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#真实引擎的契约套件","content":"在 CPU 上，每个引擎的全部目录模型都通过契约套件。在 RTX 3090 上（2026-10-19），每个已安装的模型（含需要接受许可的引擎）都通过了上面四项新测试：0.9–6 秒的请求在 0.1–2.3 秒后送出首段音频，取消在 0.05–0.6 秒内完成，卸载后设备上最多留下 8 MB。整套跑完需要几个小时（模型越大越慢），所以改动某个引擎时只跑它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5567":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-73","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`scripts/parity/` 把原生引擎与它们的参照实现逐采样比较（它的 README 有完整说明）。参照是 Mizuoto 0.1 的引擎 worker（git 标签 `v1-engine-workers`，各引擎在自己原来的环境里运行上游代码）；0.1 没有的 VoxCPM，参照是上游自己的包，经 `stack.py --impl upstream` 套进同一条链路。代码在仓库里；数据放在仓库之外的工作区 `MIZUOTO_PARITY_DIR`（默认 `~/code_workspace/experiment/kodama-refactor`），其中有：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5568":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-74","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`reference/`：位于标签 `v1-engine-workers` 的 git 工作树，即原生引擎与之比对的 0.1 代码；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5569":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-75","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`reference-host/` 和 `native-env/`：分别驱动参照实现和原生实现的 Python 环境（原生一侧用参照环境相同的 torch 2.8.0，差异因此只来自代码而不是内核）；CosyVoice 另有一套 torch 2.8 上的参照环境和数据目录；","locale":"zh-CN"},"5570":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-76","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`corpus/`（参考音频及其转写）、`fixtures/`（每次运行写出的音频和行为）、`reports/`（比较报告）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5571":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-77","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"脚本","locale":"zh-CN"},"5572":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-78","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"5573":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-79","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`stack.py run <cases.jsonl> --impl reference\\|native\\|upstream`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5574":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-80","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"让每个用例（一个 `SpeakRequest`，或一个 `convert` / `edit` 请求）走某一实现的完整链路，把音频和行为存进 `fixtures/<engine>/<case>/<name>`。`--name` 设置本次运行的文件名（如 `reference-repeat`、`reference-t28`），`--only` 选用例，`--setting k=v` 对整次运行应用一项设置，`--repeat` 在同一条链路里把每个用例再跑几遍，`--device`（默认 `cpu`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5575":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-81","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`compare.py <engine…> [--a reference] [--b native]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5576":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-82","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"逐采样比较两次运行（`--tolerance`；`--report` 写出 Markdown 报告）；不运行模型，直接从夹具打印当前的对照表","locale":"zh-CN"},"5577":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-83","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`train.py run <engine> --impl reference\\|native --model <id> --method <m> --hp k=v --name <n>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5578":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-84","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"用某一实现在工作区的数据集上训练，保留实验、指标、预览和导出结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"5579":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-85","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`train.py compare <engine> <name>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5580":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-86","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"比较两种实现的训练结果；导出的音色或模型可以交给另一种实现加载","locale":"zh-CN"},"5581":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-87","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`perf.py`、`train_perf.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5582":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-88","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"按阶段计时同样的用例和微调，并与上一轮的音频、指标和权重对照（见性能工作）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5583":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-89","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`memory.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5584":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-90","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"每个用例的显存与内存峰值、加载和卸载时间（见显存管理）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5585":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-91","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`voxcpm_modules.py`、`voxcpm_upstream.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5586":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-92","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"VoxCPM 的组件级对照，以及把上游包作为引擎套进链路的适配器","locale":"zh-CN"},"5587":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-93","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`check_rng.py --device cuda:0`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5588":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-94","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"用种子 *s* 初始化的全新 `torch.Generator`，对比 `torch.manual_seed(s)` 之后的默认随机流","locale":"zh-CN"},"5589":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-95","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`check_tokenizer.py <model>`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5590":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-96","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"在语料上比较 `mizuoto.text` 的 BPE 与 transformers 的分词器（在装有 transformers 的环境里运行）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5591":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-97","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"`dsp_fixtures.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5592":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-98","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"用真正的 torchaudio、librosa、Whisper 和 soxr 写出 `tests/fixtures/dsp/*.npz`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5593":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-99","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"**先自洽，再对照。** 参照实现先与自己的重复运行比较（`--name reference-repeat`）：自己都不能复现的用例无法用来评判原生实现。`cases/<engine>.jsonl` 每行一个用例，字段见 README。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5594":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-100","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#与参照实现对照","content":"结果：在 CPU 上以 fp32 运行时，每个引擎都与参照完全相同（VoxCPM 在 bf16 下也是），只有 CosyVoice 在两边各自生成音色提示时例外：CAM++ 的说话人嵌入与 onnxruntime 相差约 1e-6，HiFT 的正弦源把这个差异沿句子积累放大；给定同一个音色提示时，CosyVoice 也逐采样相同。每个训练器在 CPU 上与上游带同样种子的运行给出逐字节相同的损失、学习率和权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5595":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-101","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"“相同”分层判断。低层级逐比特检查，高层级判断整条链路：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5596":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-102","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"层级","locale":"zh-CN"},"5597":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-103","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"比较什么","locale":"zh-CN"},"5598":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-104","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"在哪里","locale":"zh-CN"},"5599":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-105","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"通过条件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5600":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-106","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T0 运算**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5601":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-107","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"DSP、采样器、分词器、规范化器、字音转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"5602":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-108","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"5603":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-109","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"完全相同（`torch.equal`、相同的 id、相同的字符串）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5604":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-110","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T1 模块**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5605":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-111","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"每个模块用真实权重处理截取的输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"5606":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-112","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"CPU fp32","locale":"zh-CN"},"5607":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-113","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"最大绝对误差 ≤ 1e-5 × max(1, ‖参照‖∞)，余弦相似度 ≥ 0.99999","locale":"zh-CN"},"5608":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-114","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"GPU bf16/fp16","locale":"zh-CN"},"5609":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-115","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"余弦相似度 ≥ 0.999","locale":"zh-CN"},"5610":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-116","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T2 阶段**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5611":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-117","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"教师强制的 logits；给定截取的输入时的离散输出（语音分词器的码、VQ 码、注入噪声后的 ODE 轨迹）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5612":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-118","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"CPU fp32","locale":"zh-CN"},"5613":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-119","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"argmax 100% 一致；离散输出一致率 ≥ 99.9%，每个翻转都要检查并解释（如 FSQ 取整边界上的平局）；轨迹在 T1 之内","locale":"zh-CN"},"5614":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-120","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T3 端到端（带种子）**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5615":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-121","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"完整请求走完 Mizuoto 的链路：原生与参照，同一种子、同一 torch 版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"5616":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-122","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"CPU fp32","locale":"zh-CN"},"5617":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-123","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**token 完全相同；音频完全相同或最大绝对误差 ≤ 1e-4**；例外逐个引擎列出并说明原因","locale":"zh-CN"},"5618":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-124","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T4 统计**","locale":"zh-CN"},"5619":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-125","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"每个引擎在其生产精度和设备上的语料运行，原生与参照；种子不对齐（GPU 内核不同）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5620":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-126","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"GPU（bf16/fp16）、CPU","locale":"zh-CN"},"5621":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-127","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"每种音色模式和模型至少 20 段文本 × 3 个音色 × 每个音色 3 个种子：平均 CER/WER（Whisper large-v3-turbo）≤ 参照 + 0.5 个百分点，且没有用例比参照最差的再差 5 个百分点以上；说话人相似度（CAM++ 与参考片段的余弦）均值 ≥ 参照 − 0.01；时长比在 ±5% 之内；UTMOS 均值 ≥ 参照 − 0.05；响度和 F0 中位数（按音色）在参照的四分位距之内。失败的片段（错误率高于 50 %）单独比较（Fisher 精确检验），不计入其他指标；超出阈值只有在配对差异显著时（Wilcoxon，p \\< 0.05）才算不通过","locale":"zh-CN"},"5622":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-128","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**为什么 T3 只在 CPU 上以 fp32 判断。** 任何一点 logits 差异都会翻转一次多项式抽样（或一个束），之后的一切随之分叉。在 GPU 上降精度运行时，连上游自己都不能与自己逐比特一致（例如批量和单条的贪心解码），所以 GPU 上的一致性由 T1 的模块级误差加 T4 的统计指标判断。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5623":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-129","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**音频之外的行为**也是对照的一部分，在两种实现上都经过契约套件检查：实际生效的参数和警告、音色模式的判定（`fit`）、流式的粒度与块数、取消的行为、对无效输入的错误码（参考音频太长、不支持的语言、缺少转写）、输出采样率、分段的拼接。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5624":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-130","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"加速与提速遵守同样的层级：会改变比特的加速（例如编译）至少保持在该引擎的 T1/T3 容差之内，并记录实测误差；默认路径上的提速必须逐比特不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5625":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-131","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#行为一致性的层级与容差","content":"**T0 的 DSP 夹具只在生成它们的那类机器上完全相同**：带 AVX2、不带 AVX-512 的 x86-64 Linux，且 torch 版本相同。在别处，内核的舍入不同（numpy 的 AVX-512 `exp` 和 `log`、Windows CRT 的 libm、Arm 上 torch 的 FFT 和 soxr 的 SIMD、另一个 torch 版本），所以 `tests/runtime/test_dsp.py` 在那里检查输出在这种舍入之内一致：float32 最大绝对误差 ≤ 1e-4 × max(1, ‖ref‖∞)，float64 ≤ 1e-12 × max(1, ‖ref‖∞)。CI 的 macOS、Windows 和 AVX-512 机器上实测最大为 4e-5。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5626":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-132","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"`scripts/parity/quality.py` 运行这一层（命令见 `scripts/parity/README.md`）。语料（`scripts/parity/corpus/t4.json`）共 17 组，每组是一个模型和一种音色模式：三个音色（克隆用语料中的两段英文片段和一段中文片段；三个预置说话人；三个设计音色）朗读 20 段文本（10 段英文、10 段中文，不含数字），种子为 1–3，每组每侧 180 个片段。原生实现用本仓库运行；参照实现对 0.1 已有的引擎用 0.1，对 VoxCPM 用上游的包，各自在自己的一块 RTX 3090 上以生产精度运行。评判工具：通过 Mizuoto 的 ASR 运行的 Whisper large-v3-turbo（英文按词、中文按字计算，繁体字用 OpenCC 的表转为简体）、CAM++（CosyVoice 的）、UTMOS22 strong（SpeechMOS）、BS.1770 响度和 YIN F0。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5627":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-133","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"第一次完整运行后做了三处改进，上面的层级规则已经包含它们：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5628":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-134","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"**失败计数，而不是平均。** 失控的片段（采样模型停不下来，或一直生成静音）错误率没有上限：Qwen3-TTS 的一个 965 % 的片段把均值从 1.3 % 拉到 6.7 %。错误率高于 50 % 的片段在每侧单独计数，用 Fisher 精确检验比较；其他指标只用没有失败的片段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5629":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-135","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"**超出阈值还需要差异显著。** 在 180 个采样片段上，最差片段和 0.05 的 UTMOS 余量都会随机波动：只有配对检验（按音色和文本，种子取平均）给出 p \\< 0.05 时，该组才不通过。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5630":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-136","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"**用定向重跑判断个别离群值。** 语料中发现的两个失控片段（Qwen3-TTS 的英文说话人读中文，以及 IndexTTS 1.5 读到一半变成静音）都在两侧用该音色和语言、10 个种子重跑：参照实现失败得一样多（各 100 个中 3 和 3；2 和 3）。两者都是上游自身的行为。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5631":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-137","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"测量于 2026-10-18（参照 → 原生；失败片段数为参照 / 原生）：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5632":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-138","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"组","locale":"zh-CN"},"5633":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-139","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"错误率 %","locale":"zh-CN"},"5634":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-140","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"失败","locale":"zh-CN"},"5635":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-141","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"说话人相似度","locale":"zh-CN"},"5636":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-142","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"时长比","locale":"zh-CN"},"5637":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-143","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"UTMOS","locale":"zh-CN"},"5638":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-144","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"结论","locale":"zh-CN"},"5639":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-145","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"Qwen3-TTS 1.7B Base，克隆","locale":"zh-CN"},"5640":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-146","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"0.80 → 0.90","locale":"zh-CN"},"5641":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-147","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs