gs":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"相差不超过 0.03","locale":"zh-CN"},"5809":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-315","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"通过（GPT-SoVITS 的最差片段在噪声范围内）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5810":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-316","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"未安装 flash-attn 时，`compute.attention=fast` 处处都是 SDPA，所以音频相同。安装后，F5-TTS 没有可交给 FlashAttention 的带填充的半精度调用。GPT-SoVITS v4 的 DiT 对引导时大小为 2 的批量只给出一行键长度，flash-attn 因此拒绝（`seqlens_k must have shape (batch_size)`），直到后端把长度扩展到查询的批大小；现在这 704 次调用都由它计算。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5811":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-317","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#t4-结果","content":"第一次可选项运行暴露了评测工具的一个错误：请求和对照用例把引擎选项写在 `options` 下，而请求模型没有这个字段，pydantic 会直接忽略它，所以 `packed_guidance` 和六个 T3 用例（GPT-SoVITS 的 cut5、批量和串行用例，VoxCPM 的续写和重试用例）实际上都用默认值运行。现在它们改用 `engine_options`；在 CPU 上重跑后，这六个用例在应用了各自选项的情况下与 0.1 和上游逐采样相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5812":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-318","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"`mizuoto/webui/src/**/*.test.ts` 用 vitest 运行；`python scripts/dev.py test-web` 先运行 `bun run test`，再运行 `bun run typecheck`（vue-tsc）。除了组件和 store 的单元测试，还有几个守护整个界面的规则测试：`imports.test.ts`、`tokens.test.ts`、`layout.test.ts`、`ui/layers.test.ts` 和 `i18n/i18n.test.ts`（两种语言的键相同）；见 Web UI。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5813":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-319","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"`python scripts/dev.py typegen-check` 重新生成 `schema.d.ts` 并与提交的版本比较；API 改了而类型没有重新生成时失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5814":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-320","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#web-ui-测试","content":"文档站（`site/`）有自己的 vitest 测试；`src/lib/i18n-content.test.ts` 要求每个中文 `<slug>.mdx` 都有对应的 `<slug>.en.mdx`，且两个侧栏的页面顺序相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5815":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-321","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`.github/workflows/ci.yml` 在每次推送到分支和每个拉取请求时运行，使用 torch 的 CPU 构建（`https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu`）。Mizuoto 和两个需要接受许可的包各自发布，所以各自检查，一次改动只运行它所改内容的检查。依赖用 uv 安装（`astral-sh/setup-uv`，`UV_SYSTEM_PYTHON=1`：装进 `setup-python` 提供的 Python，不建虚拟环境；缓存关闭，因为解包后的 torch wheel 会挤占 10 GB 的缓存上限）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5816":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-322","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"第一个作业 `scope` 读取改动的文件（推送的来自 compare API，拉取请求的来自它的文件列表），由 `python scripts/ci.py scope` 映射为检查：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5817":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-323","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"改动","locale":"zh-CN"},"5818":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-324","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"检查","locale":"zh-CN"},"5819":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-325","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`packages/native/<id>/**`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5820":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-326","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"该包的 `gated` 和 `oldest-mizuoto` 作业，以及针对它的 `torch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5821":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-327","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`mizuoto/webui/**`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5822":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-328","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`web`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5823":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-329","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`site/**`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5824":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-330","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`site`（文档站的测试和构建）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5825":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-331","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`mizuoto/`、`tests/`、`scripts/` 下的其他内容、`pyproject.toml`，或新路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"5826":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-332","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`host`、`web`（它的 API 类型来自代码）、`torch`，以及两个包的作业：它们跑在本次提交的 Mizuoto 运行时上","locale":"zh-CN"},"5827":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-333","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`.github/workflows/**`、`scripts/ci.py`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5828":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-334","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"全部","locale":"zh-CN"},"5829":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-335","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`README*.md`、`AGENTS.md`、`CLAUDE.md`、`LICENSE`、`Dockerfile`、`.gitignore`……","locale":"zh-CN"},"5830":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-336","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"5831":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-337","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"新分支、手动触发、被 compare API 截断的列表（300 个文件）或读取失败时检查全部；`tests/test_ci.py` 覆盖这套映射。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5832":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-338","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"作业","locale":"zh-CN"},"5833":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-339","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"环境","locale":"zh-CN"},"5834":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-340","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"步骤","locale":"zh-CN"},"5835":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-341","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`host`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5836":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-342","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu、Windows、macOS × Python 3.10、3.11、3.12、3.13","locale":"zh-CN"},"5837":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-343","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"从 CPU 索引 `uv pip install torch`，再装 `-e . pytest pytest-cov ruff ty httpx tomli`（只有 Mizuoto）；每个组合都运行 `dev.py lint`（整个仓库）、`dev.py typecheck-py --python-version <该组合> --python-platform <该组合> mizuoto tests scripts`（标准库的类型存根随 Python 版本和平台而不同）和 `python -m pytest -q tests`；三者中一个失败，其余照常运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"5838":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-344","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`gated`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5839":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-345","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"范围内的每个包 × Ubuntu、Windows、macOS × Python 3.10、3.13","locale":"zh-CN"},"5840":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-346","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`-e . -e packages/native/<id>`；对 `packages/native/<id>`（源码和测试）运行 `ruff check`、`ruff format --check` 和 `typecheck-py`，对它的 `tests/` 运行 `pytest`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5841":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-347","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`oldest-mizuoto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5842":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-348","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"范围内的每个包，Ubuntu、Python 3.12","locale":"zh-CN"},"5843":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-349","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"用该包 `pyproject.toml` 允许的最旧 Mizuoto（`python scripts/ci.py lower-bound <id>`，来自 PyPI）测试它：测试在源码目录之外运行，`PYTHONPATH` 上只有 `tests/`，所以 `import mizuoto` 找到的是已发布的那个（不含范围检查，它比较的是范围与本次提交的 Mizuoto）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5844":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-350","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`torch`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5845":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-351","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu、Python 3.12，torch 2.8.0 和最新版","locale":"zh-CN"},"5846":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-352","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"用 Mizuoto 支持的最旧和最新的 torch 跑范围内的测试，发现 torch 的接口变化","locale":"zh-CN"},"5847":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-353","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`web`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5848":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-354","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu、Python 3.11、bun","locale":"zh-CN"},"5849":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-355","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`dev.py web-install`、`dev.py test-web`、`dev.py typegen-check`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5850":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-356","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`site`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5851":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-357","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu、bun","locale":"zh-CN"},"5852":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-358","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"在 `site/` 里 `bun install --frozen-lockfile`、`bun run check`、`bun run test`、`bun run build`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5853":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-359","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`passed`（\"CI passed\"）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5854":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-360","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"Ubuntu","locale":"zh-CN"},"5855":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-361","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"上面有作业失败或被取消时失败，都通过或因改动无关而跳过时通过：分支保护只需要求这一项","locale":"zh-CN"},"5856":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-362","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"同一分支较新的运行会取消较旧的运行。推送到 `main` 且改动了某个版本文件时会启动发布工作流，它把 `ci.yml` 作为自己的检查，检查这次推送改动的内容；CI 自己对这次推送的运行会跳过所有作业（`scope` 看到了版本文件），所以检查只跑一次。标签只启动发布工作流，它的检查是全部。把文档站推送到 GitHub Pages 由 `site.yml` 负责，不在 CI 里（见发布）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5857":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-363","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"`python scripts/dev.py check` 在本地运行全部内容（只在你的平台和 Python 上，装上需要接受许可的包，基于你检出的 Mizuoto）。契约套件和对照工具需要模型（对照还需要参照实现的环境），权重有几十 GB，所以不进 CI；发布工作流有自己的 wheel 冒烟测试（见发布）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5858":{"id":"/docs/development-testing-364","page_id":"/docs/development-testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-testing#ci","content":"CI 只有 CPU 版 torch。GPU 上的路径（CUDA 图、可选的注意力后端、显存流式加载的异步预取）在 CPU 上测的是逻辑；它们在 GPU 上的表现要在有 GPU 的机器上用契约套件和对照工具检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5859":{"id":"/docs/development-training","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"page","content":"训练器","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training","locale":"zh-CN"},"5860":{"id":"/docs/development-training-0","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training","content":"训练方法怎样在清单里声明，数据集怎样添加、准备和检查，各阶段怎样作为 Mizuoto 自身解释器的子进程依次运行，指纹怎样决定哪些阶段过期，训练器怎样编写，以及导出会登记什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5861":{"id":"/docs/development-training-1","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"清单里的训练方法","locale":"zh-CN"},"5862":{"id":"/docs/development-training-2","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#数据集","content":"数据集","locale":"zh-CN"},"5863":{"id":"/docs/development-training-3","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"实验、指纹与过期阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"5864":{"id":"/docs/development-training-4","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#训练任务","content":"训练任务","locale":"zh-CN"},"5865":{"id":"/docs/development-training-5","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"为什么用子进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"5866":{"id":"/docs/development-training-6","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"Trainer 与 StageContext","locale":"zh-CN"},"5867":{"id":"/docs/development-training-7","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#显存","content":"显存","locale":"zh-CN"},"5868":{"id":"/docs/development-training-8","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#导出","content":"导出","locale":"zh-CN"},"5869":{"id":"/docs/development-training-9","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#以-omnivoice-的训练器为例","content":"以 OmniVoice 的训练器为例","locale":"zh-CN"},"5870":{"id":"/docs/development-training-10","page_id":"/docs/development-training","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-training#添加一个训练器","content":"添加一个训练器","locale":"zh-CN"},"5871":{"id":"/docs/development-training-11","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training","content":"每个可训练的引擎都以原生方式训练，在 Mizuoto 自己的环境里，用的就是它推理时的那些模块。每个训练器都复现了上游的训练方案：在 CPU 上用同一个种子，它的损失、学习率和保存的权重与上游脚本（Mizuoto 0.1 运行它们的方式；VoxCPM 则是上游自己的脚本）逐字节相同。不需要单独的训练环境或训练用的附加依赖：训练器只用推理也用的模块和依赖，不依赖 transformers、accelerate、peft、Lightning、Hydra、datasets 或 webdataset。主机一侧是 `mizuoto/core/training/service.py`（`TrainingService`）；引擎一侧是 `mizuoto/training/`（`Trainer`、`StageContext`、`stage.py`）加上各引擎的训练器模块。训练界面的用法见训练。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5872":{"id":"/docs/development-training-12","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"训练方法是引擎清单里的 `[training.<id>]`（`TrainingMethod`）。OmniVoice 的 LoRA：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5873":{"id":"/docs/development-training-13","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"5874":{"id":"/docs/development-training-14","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"5875":{"id":"/docs/development-training-15","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`stages`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5876":{"id":"/docs/development-training-16","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"静态声明，每个阶段有 `id`、`title`、`help` 和 `uses`（它读取的超参数；省略表示全部）。界面和指纹不必运行任何东西就知道有哪些阶段","locale":"zh-CN"},"5877":{"id":"/docs/development-training-17","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`hyperparams`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5878":{"id":"/docs/development-training-18","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"若干 `OptionSpec`；`group = \"basic\"` 的排在前面，`variants` 把某个超参数限定到部分变体","locale":"zh-CN"},"5879":{"id":"/docs/development-training-19","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`export`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5880":{"id":"/docs/development-training-20","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`voice_weights`（音色自有的权重，GPT-SoVITS）或 `model`（一个新的用户模型）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5881":{"id":"/docs/development-training-21","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`variants`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5882":{"id":"/docs/development-training-22","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"只能从这些变体的模型开始","locale":"zh-CN"},"5883":{"id":"/docs/development-training-23","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`min_seconds`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5884":{"id":"/docs/development-training-24","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"数据集至少要有多少音频","locale":"zh-CN"},"5885":{"id":"/docs/development-training-25","page_id":"/docs/devel