CN"},"5915":{"id":"/docs/development-training-55","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`prepare`、`train`、`export`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5916":{"id":"/docs/development-training-56","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5917":{"id":"/docs/development-training-57","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"CosyVoice","locale":"zh-CN"},"5918":{"id":"/docs/development-training-58","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`llm`、`llm_flow`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5919":{"id":"/docs/development-training-59","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`features`、`llm`、（`flow`）、`export`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5920":{"id":"/docs/development-training-60","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5921":{"id":"/docs/development-training-61","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"Fish Speech","locale":"zh-CN"},"5922":{"id":"/docs/development-training-62","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`lora`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5923":{"id":"/docs/development-training-63","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`tokens`、`train`、`export`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5924":{"id":"/docs/development-training-64","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5925":{"id":"/docs/development-training-65","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"dummy","locale":"zh-CN"},"5926":{"id":"/docs/development-training-66","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`speaker`、`full`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5927":{"id":"/docs/development-training-67","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`prepare`、`train`、`export`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5928":{"id":"/docs/development-training-68","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#清单里的训练方法","content":"`voice_weights`、`model`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5929":{"id":"/docs/development-training-69","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#数据集","content":"训练从数据集开始。数据集是 `datasets/<slug>/`：`dataset.json`、`manifest.jsonl`（每段音频一行：`id`、`audio`、`text`、`speaker`、`language`、`duration`、采样率、`excluded`、来源和 `licence_tags`）和 `audio/<id>.flac`（不超过 48 kHz）。数据集的指纹是 `manifest.jsonl` 的 SHA-256。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5930":{"id":"/docs/development-training-70","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#数据集","content":"**添加。** 音频可以来自文件（旁边同名的 `.lab` 或 `.txt` 是它的文本）、上传、某个音色的参考音频、已有的输出（保留它们的许可标签），或已知布局的文件夹（GPT-SoVITS 的 `.list`、LJSpeech、CSV、普通文件夹）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5931":{"id":"/docs/development-training-71","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#数据集","content":"**准备。** `prepare`（`dataset_prepare` 任务，资源 `cpu`）按 GPT-SoVITS 的默认参数用 slicer2 在静音处切分，经 ASR 转写，并做峰值归一化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5932":{"id":"/docs/development-training-72","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#数据集","content":"**检查。** `check` 给出 `DatasetReport`：时长直方图、过短或过长的片段、空文本、削波、采样率和许可标签；可以按报告里的问题筛选行，逐条排除或删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5933":{"id":"/docs/development-training-73","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#数据集","content":"**许可。** 交给训练器的行是 `training_rows(数据集, 目标引擎)`：排除被标记的和没有文本的行；如果某些行的许可标签不允许用来训练目标引擎（引擎清单的 `trains_others = false`），整个请求被拒绝。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5934":{"id":"/docs/development-training-74","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"一个实验是 `experiments/<引擎>/<名字>/`：`experiment.json`（基础模型、数据集、方法、超参数、各阶段状态）、训练器的工作目录 `work/` 和 `metrics.jsonl`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5935":{"id":"/docs/development-training-75","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"每个完成的阶段都记录一个指纹，由 `fingerprints()` 按阶段顺序链式计算：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5936":{"id":"/docs/development-training-76","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"数据集的指纹是它 `manifest.jsonl` 的 SHA-256；`hp` 是方法的默认值与实验设定值的合并。读取状态时（`_with_status`），指纹与当前不同的已完成阶段是 `stale`，它之后的每个已完成阶段也是。所以改学习率只会让读取它的训练阶段及其后续过期，之前的特征提取仍然算完成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5937":{"id":"/docs/development-training-77","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"还有一条规则：某个阶段**重新运行**后，它之后那些不在同一次运行里的已完成阶段会丢掉指纹。它们读的是旧阶段的文件，所以即使输入（和指纹）相同，也已经过期。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5938":{"id":"/docs/development-training-78","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#实验指纹与过期阶段","content":"`run()` 选择要运行的阶段：带 `restart` 时全部；给了 `stages` 时就是这些（前提是它们之前的阶段都已完成）；否则从第一个未完成的阶段一直到最后。全部完成时它会拒绝，并提示 `mizuoto train run <exp> --restart`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5939":{"id":"/docs/development-training-79","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#训练任务","content":"一次运行是一个 `train` 任务，它的步骤就是选中的阶段：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5940":{"id":"/docs/development-training-80","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#训练任务","content":"**资源**：`engine:<引擎>:<设备>` 和 `gpu:<设备>`（CPU 上是 `cpu`），所以它会等引擎自己的推理和 GPU 上的其他任务。设备取 `training.devices[0]`，没有就用引擎的设备。GPU 上的运行整个占用 `gpu:<设备>`（`JobSpec.exclusive`，不受 `compute.gpu_jobs` 限制）；开始前卸载该引擎已加载的模型（`runtime.unload_engine`），并把该设备上其他空闲模型的权重移到内存（`runtime.release_device`），运行期间没有模型回到这个设备。随后估算这次运行的显存峰值，超出空闲显存时在日志里警告，并给出能放下的预设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5941":{"id":"/docs/development-training-81","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#训练任务","content":"**每个阶段一个进程**：`host_target(\"mizuoto.training.stage\", cwd=work)` 通过 `JobContext.run_worker`，用服务器自己的解释器运行 `python -m mizuoto.training.stage <request.json>`。阶段进程看得到所有设备，名字不变。心跳超时是 30 分钟（`STAGE_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT`）；任何一行输出都会重置它，而阶段本身每 10 秒也会发一次心跳。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5942":{"id":"/docs/development-training-82","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#训练任务","content":"**请求内容**：`trainer`、`stage`、`engine`、`method`、`experiment`、`workdir`、`dataset_dir`、`rows`（绝对音频路径、文本、说话人、语言、时长、采样率；已经在 `training_rows` 里按许可过滤过）、`base_model`（`id`、`dir`、`variant`）、`assets`、`device`、`precision`（`training.precision`）、`hyperparams`、`language`、`results`（已完成阶段的返回值），以及设置 `training.previews` 和 `training.keep_checkpoints`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5943":{"id":"/docs/development-training-83","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#训练任务","content":"**事件**：`MetricEvent` 每秒批量写进 `metrics.jsonl`，并以 `train_metrics` 发布（界面的损失曲线实时跟随）；`ProgressEvent` 变成步骤的进度和消息；`OutputEvent(kind=\"sample\")` 复制为一个 `sample` 类型的输出。重新运行的阶段会先从 `metrics.jsonl` 里删掉它以前的点。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5944":{"id":"/docs/development-training-84","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"阶段在自己的进程里运行，而不在服务器进程里：一次运行结束时把内存全部还回去，阶段崩溃也拖不垮服务器，而且阶段可以给进程级随机数生成器播种（上游方案里的 dropout 掩码和数据打乱都从它们抽取），不会影响任何别人的随机数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5945":{"id":"/docs/development-training-85","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"`mizuoto/training/stage.py` 就是这个进程：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5946":{"id":"/docs/development-training-86","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"它把真正的 stdout 留给事件，把文件描述符 1 指向 stderr，于是各种库打印的东西进入日志，而不会混进事件流。事件是带 `@mizuoto ` 前缀的 JSON 行（`mizuoto/core/jobs/jsonl.py`），`mizuoto` 日志记录器的记录会变成 `LogEvent`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5947":{"id":"/docs/development-training-87","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"一个线程每 10 秒发一次 `HeartbeatEvent`（`HEARTBEAT_SECONDS`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5948":{"id":"/docs/development-training-88","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"`stage_main` 给 Python、NumPy 和 torch 的生成器播种（`seed_everything`，用请求里的 `seed`，没有则为 1234；训练服务目前不传种子，所以每次运行都以 1234 播种，结果可以复现），在 `training.deterministic` 开启时启用确定性内核（`features.deterministic`，`CUBLAS_WORKSPACE_CONFIG` 由主机设置；torch 对未初始化内存的填充保持关闭，因为原生代码会写入它分配的全部内存，而填充会让从未使用的分配常驻内存：Fish Speech 的 LoRA 阶段因此多占 17 GB），并在 GPU 上、`training.attention = auto` 时改用 math 注意力内核，构建 `StageContext`，用 `load_trainer(request[\"trainer\"])` 加载训练器并调用 `run_stage(stage, ctx)`；结果必须能序列化为 JSON，以 `ResultEvent` 送回。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5949":{"id":"/docs/development-training-89","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"失败映射为事件和退出码（`mizuoto.core.codes`）：`Cancelled` 或 SIGTERM → `EXIT_CANCELLED`（130）；`EngineError` → 带其错误码的 `ErrorEvent`；内存不足 → `compute_unavailable`；其他 → 把回溯作为日志行，并报 `engine_error`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5950":{"id":"/docs/development-training-90","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"`python -m mizuoto.training.stage --entry 模块:函数 <request.json>` 以同样的方式运行别的任务函数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5951":{"id":"/docs/development-training-91","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#为什么用子进程","content":"任务 worker 的 stdout（事件）和 stderr（库的输出）经同一条管道到达主机，所以一个事件可能紧贴在进度条某个未换行的 `\\r` 行后面。主机在事件前缀处切分行（`mizuoto/core/jobs/jsonl.py` 的 `parse_lines`）；在这之前，进度条重绘之后的每个指标都会丢失。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5952":{"id":"/docs/development-training-92","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"训练器是 `mizuoto.training.Trainer` 的子类，它的各方法声明的每个阶段 id 都对应一个 `stage_<id>(ctx)` 方法；`ctx.request[\"method\"]` 说明正在运行哪个方法。训练器模块顶层不导入 torch：主机会导入它来读取 `REQUIRES` 和 `DEVICES`（`InferenceService.trainer_needs`），并询问 `refuses(method, model_dir)`：它不加载 torch 就说明某个方法为什么不能从某个模型开始（Qwen3-TTS：`speaker` 不能从 0.6B Base 开始；该方法随之显示为不可用，运行也无法开始），所以数学部分放在阶段方法内部才导入的模块里。例如 CosyVoice 的训练器设置了 `DEVICES = (\"cuda\", \"cpu\")`：上游用 torchrun 只在 CUDA 上训练，而原生移植没有任何地方需要 CUDA。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5953":{"id":"/docs/development-training-93","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"阶段方法返回一个可序列化为 JSON 的字典，存为该阶段的 `result`；后面的阶段从 `ctx.results` 读取。`StageContext`（`mizuoto/training/context.py`）提供：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5954":{"id":"/docs/development-training-94","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"成员","locale":"zh-CN"},"5955":{"id":"/docs/development-training-95","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"5956":{"id":"/docs/development-training-96","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`workdir`、`rows`、`base_model`、`assets`、`device`、`precision`、`results`、`hyperparams`、`name`、`engine`、`request`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5957":{"id":"/docs/development-training-97","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"解析后的请求；`rows` 是 `Row`（`id`、`audio`、`text`、`speaker`、`language`、`duration`、`sample_rate`）；数据集里的音频是 FLAC（用 `mizuoto.nn.dsp.flac.read_audio` 读取）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5958":{"id":"/docs/development-training-98","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`hp(name, default)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5959":{"id":"/docs/development-training-99","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"生效的超参数值，为 `None` 时取 `default`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5960":{"id":"/docs/development-training-100","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`progress(value, message)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5961":{"id":"/docs/development-training-101","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"0–1，或 `None`（不确定）","locale":"zh-CN"},"5962":{"id":"/docs/development-training-102","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`metric(epoch, step, values, lr)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5963":{"id":"/docs/development-training-103","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"一个损失点","locale":"zh-CN"},"5964":{"id":"/docs/development-training-104","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`output(path, label, kind)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5965":{"id":"/docs/development-training-105","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"阶段产出的文件：`sample` 是预览，`checkpoint` 是权重","locale":"zh-CN"},"5966":{"id":"/docs/development-training-106","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`log(message, level)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5967":{"id":"/docs/development-training-107","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"一行日志","locale":"zh-CN"},"5968":{"id":"/docs/development-training-108","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"`preview(text, reference, label, weights=…, model_dir=…, variant=…, preset=…)`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5969":{"id":"/docs/development-training-109","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"在阶段进程里加载引擎自己的实现（一个私有的 `Runtime`），用新权重（`weights`，套在基础模型上）或新模型（`model_dir`）以种子 1234 说出 `text`，存为样例。失败只是一条警告，绝不会让阶段失败；`training.previews` 关闭时跳过","locale":"zh-CN"},"5970":{"id":"/docs/development-training-110","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#trainer-与-stagecontext","content":"阶段必须可以重跑：每个阶段先清空自己的输出目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5971":{"id":"/docs/development-training-111","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#显存","content":"训练的显存预设（`training.memory`：`standard`、`low`、`lowest`）和工具都在 `mizuoto/training/memory.py`：梯度检查点在反向重算时还原全局生成器和训练器自己的生成器，所以损失和权重不变；`low` 只加不改变结果的工具，`lowest` 再加轻微改变结果的工具；方法自己的超参数优先。GPU 上的阶段在指标里附带 `memory/peak_mb`，`MethodInfo.memory_mb` 按预设估算一次运行的峰值。详见显存管理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5972":{"id":"/docs/development-training-112","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#导出","content":"`export` 阶段返回 `{\"artifacts\": [...]}`，由主机的 `_register` 接收：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5973":{"id":"/docs/development-training-113","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#导出","content":"`{\"kind\": \"voice_weights\", \"files\": {\"gpt\": …, \"sovits\": …}}`：移进实验所属音色的 `Voice.weights[engine]`；实验没有音色时，用数据集中最多三段 3–10 秒、带文本、最接近 6 秒的音频新建一个音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5974":{"id":"/docs/development-training-114","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#导出","content":"`{\"kind\": \"model\", \"folder\": …, \"variant\": …, \"title\": …, \"speakers\": …}`：通过 `register_user_model` 成为一个用户模型，其 `model.json` 记录 `trained_from` 和实验（以及 Qwen3 的 `speakers`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5975":{"id":"/docs/development-training-115","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#导出","content":"同一个音色或模型再次导出只列一次，以最新的那次为准。`mizuoto train export <exp>` 单独运行 `export` 阶段。导出沿用上游方案的格式和权重的键名，所以上游的实现（以及 Mizuoto 0.1）也能加载它们，反之亦然。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5976":{"id":"/docs/development-training-116","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#以-omnivoice-的训练器为例","content":"`mizuoto/engines/omnivoice/train.py`，方法 `full` 和 `lora`，导出 `model`，依照上游的 `examples/run_finetune.sh` 和 `run_finetune_lora.sh`，不依赖 transformers、peft、accelerate 或 webdataset：","locale":"zh-CN"},"5977":{"id":"/docs/development-training-117","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#以-omnivoice-的训练器为例","content":"`tokens`：以种子 42 打乱各段音频，逐段读取、转单声道、重采样到 24 kHz、峰值归一化，再用模型自己的 HiggsAudio 分词器编码（用推理引擎的 `load_audio_tokenizer` 加载），写成 WebDataset 风格的分片，由 `data.lst` 列出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5978":{"id":"/docs/development-training-118","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#以-omnivoice-的训练器为例","content":"`train`：上游的微调循环及其 SDPA 配置：分片由数据加载 worker 读取，worker 的播种方式与上游相同；按长度分组成批，使用四维掩码；带掩码的交叉熵、带余弦调度的 AdamW、梯度裁剪和梯度累积。LoRA 就是 peft 的那种，但不依赖 peft 实现。每次更新的损失记为一次 `ctx.metric`。最后以上游的目录结构写出 `out/checkpoint-<步数>`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5979":{"id":"/docs/development-training-119","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#以-omnivoice-的训练器为例","content":"`export`：即 `merge_lora`：把适配器合并进基础权重（全量微调的权重则原样使用），存为 `model.safetensors`，旁边放基础模型的配置、分词器和聊天模板，然后用 `ctx.preview` 克隆数据集里的一段音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5980":{"id":"/docs/development-training-120","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#以-omnivoice-的训练器为例","content":"上游在构建模型之后会用配置里的种子把一切重新播种；原生训练器把之后的那些抽样放在以同样方式播种的私有生成器上进行（数据加载 worker 的种子、LoRA 的 dropout 掩码），只有 LoRA 的初始化从阶段进程的全局生成器按模块顺序抽取，与上游相同，所以带种子的运行能得到与上游相同的损失和权重。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5981":{"id":"/docs/development-training-121","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#添加一个训练器","content":"在清单里写 `[training.<id>]`：各阶段及其 `uses`、超参数、`export`，需要时加 `assets` 和 `devices`。在引擎类上设置 `TRAINER = \"mizuoto.engines.<id>.train:<类>\"`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5982":{"id":"/docs/development-training-122","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#添加一个训练器","content":"写一个 `Trainer` 子类，每个阶段一个 `stage_<id>(ctx)`，重依赖在方法内导入。按上游的顺序从进程级生成器抽随机数，上游重新播种过的地方改用私有生成器；用 `ctx.progress`、`ctx.metric` 和 `ctx.log` 汇报。训练在推理之外需要的包写进 `REQUIRES`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5983":{"id":"/docs/development-training-123","page_id":"/docs/development-training","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-training#添加一个训练器","content":"`export` 返回 `artifacts` 并调用 `ctx.preview`。加上 `tests/engines_native/test_<id>_train_tiny.py`（小型随机模型、几段音频、每个阶段），然后用一个小数据集完整地训练一遍（界面的训练页面，或 `mizuoto train new` / `mizuoto train run`），并与上游对照（`scripts/parity/train.py`，见测试）。为得到相同结果复现了哪些上游行为，记进设计记录 `AGENTS.md` 和该引擎的说明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5984":{"id":"/docs/development-webui","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"page","content":"Web UI","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui","locale":"zh-CN"},"5985":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-0","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui","content":"Vue 3 + Material 3 界面的结构：Material Design 3 的令牌层与组件层、ui/ 包装层与规则测试、API 客户端与查询、socket 事件、引擎可用性检查、store、保活视图和 i18n，以及以项目页为例新增一个界面。","locale":"zh-CN"},"5986":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-1","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#material-design-3-的分层","content":"Material Design 3 的分层","locale":"zh-CN"},"5987":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-2","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"令牌层：`src/theme/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5988":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-3","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"组件层：`src/ui/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"5989":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-4","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"`ui/` 包装层","locale":"zh-CN"},"5990":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-5","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"规则测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"5991":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-6","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"API 客户端与查询","locale":"zh-CN"},"5992":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-7","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"Socket 事件","locale":"zh-CN"},"5993":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-8","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#引擎可用性","content":"引擎可用性","locale":"zh-CN"},"5994":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-9","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#随模型变化的表单","content":"随模型变化的表单","locale":"zh-CN"},"5995":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-10","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"Store","locale":"zh-CN"},"5996":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-11","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#保活视图","content":"保活视图","locale":"zh-CN"},"5997":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-12","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#i18n","content":"i18n","locale":"zh-CN"},"5998":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-13","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"新增一个界面：以\"项目\"为例","locale":"zh-CN"},"5999":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-14","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui","content":"Web UI 是 `mizuoto/webui/` 下的一个 Vue 3 项目，组件基于 Material Web（`@material/web`），图标是 Lucide（`@lucide/vue`），数据层是 TanStack Query（`@tanstack/vue-query`）+ `openapi-fetch`，状态用 Pinia。构建产物 `mizuoto/webui/dist/` 作为包数据随 wheel 发布，由 API 的 `SPAStaticFiles` 提供（见 HTTP API 与命令行）。基础部分（`theme/`、`ui/`、动效、层、外壳、store、i18n、规则测试）沿用 rvc-next，来源见设计参考与决策。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6000":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-15","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui","content":"开发时用 `python scripts/dev.py dev` 同时启动 API 服务器和 Vite（`http://localhost:5173`），Vite 把 `/api` 和 `/ws` 代理到 `MIZUOTO_BACKEND`（默认 `http://127.0.0.1:7869`）。API 服务器重启时代理的连接错误只打印一行（`vite.config.ts`，`devProxy.test.ts` 测试）。环境准备见开发环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6001":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-16","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#material-design-3-的分层","content":"界面按 Material Design 3（M3）构建，分两层：所有东西都读取的**令牌层**，以及建立在它上面的**组件层**。令牌层与任何组件库无关；组件层可以逐个替换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6002":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-17","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"6003":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-18","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6004":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-19","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"`scheme.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6005":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-20","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"用 `@material/material-color-utilities` 的 Tonal Spot 方案，从一个种子色生成全部颜色角色（`primary`、`on-primary`、`surface-container`、`outline`……），亮色与暗色各一套，对比度 0（标准）、0.5（中）、1（高）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6006":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-21","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"`applyTheme.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6007":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-22","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"把角色写成 `:root` 上的 `--md-sys-color-*`，并设置 `data-theme`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6008":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-23","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"`tokens.css`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6009":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-24","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"静态令牌：15 种字号（`--md-sys-typescale-*`，Roboto Flex 可变字体）、圆角（`--md-sys-shape-corner-*`）、动效的缓动和时长（`--md-sys-motion-*`）、状态层不透明度（悬停 8%、聚焦 10%、按下 10%、拖动 16%，取自 `@material/web` 2.5.0 的令牌文件；禁用的内容 38%、容器 12%，取自其组件令牌）、阴影、间距（4px 为单位）、层内 z 序和随窗口变化的宽度；还有首帧用的回退颜色","locale":"zh-CN"},"6010":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-25","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"`breakpoints.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6011":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-26","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"M3 的窗口尺寸分级：compact（\\< 600px）、medium（\\< 840px）、expanded（\\< 1200px）、large（\\< 1600px）、extra-large","locale":"zh-CN"},"6012":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-27","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"**颜色只来自种子色。** 默认种子色是 `#4f6b3a`；用户可以在“设置 › 外观”里换任意颜色、对比度、亮暗（跟随系统、亮、暗）和动效。偏好存在 localStorage，并经 `/api/v1/client-state/{key}` 同步到服务器。`index.html` 里的一小段脚本在打包代码运行前读取偏好、设置 `data-theme`，避免首屏闪烁。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6013":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-28","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"**令牌用的是 Google 官方的名字**（`--md-sys-*`），所以 `@material/web` 的组件不经任何映射就能读取它们；项目自己的令牌以 `--app-` 开头。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6014":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-29","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"**层级首先用表面色调表达**（`surface`、`surface-container-low` … `surface-container-highest`），阴影其次。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6015":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-30","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"**颜色角色成对使用**：`primary` 容器上的内容用 `on-primary`，`surface-container` 上的用 `on-surface`；生成的成对角色保证对比度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6016":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-31","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"**动效**：命名的过渡（`fade-through`、`shared-axis-x`、`container`、`sheet`、`scrim`、`list` 等，`ui/motion/`），在支持的浏览器里用 View Transitions 做列表到详情的容器变换。系统或应用内选择“减少动效”时，所有过渡变成 100 ms 的淡入淡出，没有涟漪。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6017":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-32","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"**布局**：compact 窗口用底部导航栏，更宽时用导航轨（`AppShell`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6018":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-33","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#令牌层srctheme","content":"字体（`@fontsource-variable/roboto-flex`）和图标都打包进 `dist/`，界面不从任何外部来源加载东西，离线也能用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6019":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-34","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"`@material/web` 有的组件包一层项目自己的 Vue 组件：按钮（`AppButton`：填充、色调、描边、文本）、图标按钮、FAB、复选框、筛选 chip、分隔线、文本框与多行文本框、滑块、线性与环形进度条、开关、标签页。包装组件拥有属性、事件名和类型；`vite.config.ts` 把 `md-*` 标签声明为自定义元素。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6020":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-35","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"`@material/web` 没有的组件用令牌自己实现，放在同一个目录：外壳、导航栏与导航轨、顶部应用栏、卡片、对话框、侧栏、菜单与选择菜单、提示条（snackbar）、工具提示、分段按钮、选择框、展开面板、步骤条、数据列表、折线图、波形、频谱图、电平表等。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6021":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-36","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"两种组件读取同一套令牌，看起来一致。`@material/web` 处于维护模式，不再增加组件；万一某个组件在未来的浏览器或 Vue 版本中出问题，就在 `src/ui/` 里替换它，业务代码不变。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6022":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-37","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"图标用 Lucide（`@lucide/vue`），不用 Material Symbols：只在 `ui/icons.ts` 导入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6023":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-38","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"按钮的强调层级：一个区域里最多一个填充按钮（视图的主要操作，如“合成”、“训练”），次要操作用色调按钮，其余用描边或文本按钮。可交互元素有可见的焦点指示，点击目标一般不小于 48×48px（紧凑的行和卡片里的复选框等以 `dense` 例外）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6024":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-39","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#组件层srcui","content":"不使用 MUI（它实现的是 Material Design 2），也没有采用 M3 Expressive；令牌层把形状和动效的值集中在一处，需要时可以只改令牌。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6025":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-40","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"`src/ui/index.ts` 是共享组件的唯一出口：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6026":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-41","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"只有 `ui/` 下的组件（以及 `theme/tokens.css` 和测试的 `test/setup.ts`）导入 `@material/web`。视图和功能组件从 `@/ui` 导入 `AppButton`、`TextField`、`AppDialog`、`SegmentedButton`、`Stepper`、`LineChart` 等。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6027":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-42","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"图标也经过 `ui/icons.ts` 再导出，`ui/` 是唯一导入 `@lucide/vue` 的地方。新图标先加到这里，再以 `icons.X` 使用。`AppIcon` 设置了 `fill: none`：Material 按钮会填充插槽里的图标，Lucide 的描边因此会变成色块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6028":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-43","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"样式只用令牌：颜色角色 `--md-sys-color-*`（由 `applyTheme.ts` 从种子色生成），间距 `--app-space-*`，层内 z 序 `--app-z-*`，字号类 `type-title-large` 等。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6029":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-44","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"`ui/layers.ts` 是所有浮层（对话框、侧栏、菜单、选择器）的唯一记录，按打开顺序决定绘制层级、Escape 和外部点击只关闭最上层、模态层下面的内容设为 `inert`、焦点打开时进入并在关闭时归还。新的浮层组件要通过它注册，而不是自己设 z-index。提示（`Tooltip`）不入栈：它渲染在文档末尾、按内容的位置固定定位并限制在窗口内，层级取 `tooltipZ`（高于所有已打开的浮层和提示条），因此底栏或导航栏旁的面板不会裁切或遮住它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6030":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-45","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#ui-包装层","content":"`/dev` 路由（`DevComponentsView.vue`）列出全部 `ui/` 组件，用来目视检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6031":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-46","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"几条约定由 vitest 检查，违反时 `dev.py test-web` 失败：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6032":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-47","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"测试","locale":"zh-CN"},"6033":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-48","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"6034":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-49","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/imports.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6035":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-50","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/` 内的模块互相导入一律用 `@/` 别名，不用相对路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"6036":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-51","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/tokens.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6037":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-52","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/theme/` 之外的 `.vue` 和 `.css` 中（`<script>` 除外）没有十六进制颜色","locale":"zh-CN"},"6038":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-53","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/layout.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6039":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-54","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"放文件名的行，其文本元素要有 `min-width: 0`（长名字不把按钮挤出视野）；Speak 与音色页是一列分节，操作按钮在 `PageFooter` 里；字段旁的按钮居中对齐；分节从不并排","locale":"zh-CN"},"6040":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-55","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/ui/layers.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6041":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-56","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"浮层的键盘、绘制、外部点击、模态和焦点规则","locale":"zh-CN"},"6042":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-57","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/i18n/i18n.test.ts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6043":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-58","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`zh-CN` 与 `en` 的键完全一致，占位符一致；固定术语（\"音色\"、\"合成\"、\"克隆\"）不变；每个服务器错误 code 都有标题","locale":"zh-CN"},"6044":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-59","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"`src/ui/ui.test.ts` 等","locale":"zh-CN"},"6045":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-60","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"单个组件、动效辅助函数、主题生成、窗口尺寸分级、导航","locale":"zh-CN"},"6046":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-61","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#规则测试","content":"\"视图只从 `@/ui` 导入组件\"是约定，目前没有测试强制。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6047":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-62","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"`api/client.ts` 用生成的 `paths` 类型创建一个 `openapi-fetch` 客户端：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6048":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-63","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"`BASE_URL`（`api/baseUrl.ts`）由运行中脚本的 URL 推出：最后一个 `/assets/` 之前的部分就是部署根。不编译进任何 API 地址，所以挂在 `api_prefix` 下也无需改动。路由用 hash 历史，任何子路径都不需要服务端改写。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6049":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-64","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"`unwrap(call)` 返回数据，失败时抛 `ApiError(status, code, message, detail)`；FastAPI 自己的 422 校验错误被转成 `invalid_input`。`components/errors.ts` 把它变成界面上的标题（`errors.<code>`）、提示（`detail.hint`）和详情。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6050":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-65","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"媒体 URL（`urls.output()`、`urls.audioFile()`）由 `<audio>` 直接请求，靠 `mizuoto_token` cookie 认证；上传用 `uploadRaw()`（XMLHttpRequest，可报告进度，请求体是原始字节）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6051":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-66","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"类型来自 `api/types.ts`：`S = components['schemas']`，以及常用模型的别名。既作请求又作响应的模型分成两份，例如发送 `S['SpeakRequest-Input']`、读取 `S['SpeakRequest-Output']`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6052":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-67","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"`api/queries/<资源>.ts` 把端点包装成组合式函数：读取用 `useQuery`，写入用 `useMutation`。查询键集中在 `api/queries/keys.ts`，查询模块和 socket 处理器共用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6053":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-68","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#api-客户端与查询","content":"层级化的键让作废 `keys.projects` 同时作废列表和每个项目。`main.ts` 中的 `QueryClient` 关闭了窗口聚焦时重新获取，4xx 错误不重试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6054":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-69","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"`api/socket.ts` 的 `connectSocket(qc)` 只连接一次（`App.vue` 挂载时），路径是 `${BASE_PATH}/ws/socket.io`，令牌放在握手的 `auth` 中。监听器的类型来自模式里的 `ServerEvents`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6055":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-70","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"REST 是事实来源，事件只修补或作废查询：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6056":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-71","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"`job_updated` 进入 jobs store（`upsert` 丢弃比已有状态更旧的快照），写入 `keys.job(id)`；任务结束时按 `AFFECTS` 表作废它影响的列表，例如 `project_render` → `keys.projects`，`train` → 实验、音色、模型和输出。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6057":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-72","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"`runtime_changed`（已加载的模型，供**内存中的模型**侧栏 `LoadedModelsSheet` 使用）和 `compute_changed` 直接写入查询数据（`keys.runtime`、`keys.computeUsage`）；`train_metrics` 把新点追加到实验的指标上。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6058":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-73","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"其余 `*_changed` 事件经 `createInvalidator()` 作废对应的键，300 ms 内的一串事件只引起一次重新获取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6059":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-74","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"连接和重连时重新拉取活动任务（`resync()`），重连时还作废屏幕上常见的全部列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6060":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-75","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#socket-事件","content":"`job_log` 分发给打开的日志查看器（`onJobLog(jobId, listener)`）；每个事件最多 50 行，其余通过 REST 获取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6061":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-76","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#引擎可用性","content":"所有引擎都随 Mizuoto 一起安装，但某个引擎仍可能*缺*东西：torch，或某个需要接受许可的引擎自己的发行包。引擎列表（`EngineStatus.available`、`missing`）和 doctor 的报告（`api/queries/engines.ts` 的 `useDoctor(engine)`：`GET /api/v1/engines/{id}/doctor`，不指定引擎时为 `GET /api/v1/runtime/doctor`）决定界面提供什么：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6062":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-77","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#引擎可用性","content":"**`ModelGate`**（`components/ModelGate.vue`）把合成页的主按钮换成模型还差的那一个操作，按以下顺序检查：启用引擎、接受许可、安装缺少的包、下载模型。缺包时显示命令：torch 用 doctor 给出的 `install_command`（适合本机的构建），其他包用 `pip install <包名>`；引擎在远程主机上时，提示那台主机缺这个包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6063":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-78","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#引擎可用性","content":"**`EngineCard`** 显示**可用**或**不可用**以及缺少的包，并有一个 doctor 面板，列出该引擎的检查结果（torch、附加依赖、训练）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6064":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-79","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#引擎可用性","content":"**`ModelsView`** 标出引擎不可用的分组，并写明它需要什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6065":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-80","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#引擎可用性","content":"**`SettingsView`** 在 **计算** 中显示 torch 的检查结果（doctor 的 `torch` 一项）：已安装的版本和构建，以及两者不符时安装推荐构建的命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6066":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-81","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#随模型变化的表单","content":"合成页和项目的角色卡片只显示所选模型支持的内容，并保留为其他模型设置的值，换回那个模型时恢复。服务端会拒绝模型不支持的内容（明确给出的请求从不被裁剪），所以一个被隐藏却仍然发出的值会让合成失败。因此只有一条规则：**表单没有显示的值，绝不发送。**","locale":"zh-CN"},"6067":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-82","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#随模型变化的表单","content":"**合成页** 只在 `components/speakForm.ts` 中构建请求（`speakRequest(spec, form)`），依据模型的 spec（`ModelParamSpecs`），并使用模板判断显示与否的同一组函数：`emotionWays`/`shownWay`、`instructFit`（指令以及 `instruct_requires`，即指令需要的音色方式）、`designFor`、`speaks`、`fieldsFor`、`takesSeed`。表单新增字段时，在这里写它的规则，并在 `speakForm.test.ts` 中加一个用例；服务端用来检查请求的规则应放进 spec，界面才能遵循。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6068":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-83","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#随模型变化的表单","content":"表单状态放在视图里，而不是子组件中：`EmotionPanel` 不持有自己的值。换模型时无法可靠地重置子组件的状态，因为子组件可能在同一次更新中被卸载（它所在的区域被隐藏，或新模型的 spec 还在加载），它的 watcher 也随之停止。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6069":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-84","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#随模型变化的表单","content":"参数和引擎选项属于各个模型：换模型后从新模型的默认值或默认预设开始。“再次生成”在负责重置的同一个 watcher 中为新模型设置它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6070":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-85","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#随模型变化的表单","content":"**项目** 会把角色的设置保存在磁盘上，模型可能在任何界面或命令行中被修改，因此由服务端执行这条规则：`ProjectService._request` 只把句子的模型支持的指令、参数和选项发给它（`TtsService.settings_fit`），`Project.instruct_unused`（读取时计算，从不保存）列出指令被保留但不使用的角色。音色和语言照原样发送，不合适时明确报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6071":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-86","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"Store","locale":"zh-CN"},"6072":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-87","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6073":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-88","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"`auth`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6074":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-89","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"令牌（localStorage 与 `mizuoto_token` cookie）、是否需要令牌","locale":"zh-CN"},"6075":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-90","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"`jobs`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6076":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-91","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"本次会话知道的任务：所有活动任务，以及打开页面期间结束的任务；每个任务从哪个界面启动（`upsert(job, from)`、`fromScreen()`），`onFinished()` 用于\"在其他界面启动的任务已完成\"提示。进度更新很频繁，所以放在这里而不是查询缓存里","locale":"zh-CN"},"6077":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-92","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"`preferences`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6078":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-93","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"主题、种子色、对比度、语言、动效、上次界面、Speak 的上次选择；存 localStorage，并经 `/api/v1/client-state/{key}` 同步到服务器，跟随用户换浏览器","locale":"zh-CN"},"6079":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-94","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"`player`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6080":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-95","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"页面上唯一的播放器（`audio/player.ts`）","locale":"zh-CN"},"6081":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-96","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"`handoff`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6082":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-97","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#store","content":"界面之间的交接：\"用这些设置重新运行\"、\"使用这个音色\"、\"用作参考\"；Speak 打开时取走","locale":"zh-CN"},"6083":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-98","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#保活视图","content":"`App.vue` 用 `KeepAlive :max=\"12\"` 包住 `RouterView`，切换界面时每个页面保留自己的状态。缓存键是：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6084":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-99","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#保活视图","content":"列表页每个路由一个实例；音色、数据集、实验和项目的详情页每个路径一个实例。外壳的滚动容器是共享的，所以每个页面的滚动位置另存在 `offsets` 里，在视图过渡的更新中放回。被保活的页面不会卸载，需要在离开时保存的东西要同时挂 `onDeactivated` 和 `onBeforeUnmount`（`ProjectView.vue` 的草稿保存就是这样）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6085":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-100","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#保活视图","content":"`router.ts` 中每个路由的 `meta.screen` 指明它属于哪个导航目的地；`addressOf(screen)` 记住每个目的地上次的地址，导航回去时回到离开时的那个音色或项目，而不是列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6086":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-101","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#i18n","content":"`i18n/en.ts` 是消息树，`zh-CN.ts` 必须有完全相同的键（测试检查）。`useI18n()` 返回 `t(key, params)`，占位符写成 `{n}`；当前语言来自偏好，`auto` 跟随系统语言。由服务器值拼出的键（错误 code、阶段 id）用 `tOr(key, fallback)`，没有消息时显示可读的回退文字。新增文字时两个文件同时加。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6087":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-102","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"项目界面（长篇脚本，由一组音色逐行朗读）是最近加入的完整界面，可以作为模板。API 侧见 `mizuoto/api/routers/projects.py`，事件是 `projects_changed`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6088":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-103","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**生成类型。** 后端路由就绪后运行 `python scripts/dev.py typegen`，`schema.d.ts` 中出现 `/api/v1/projects` 等路径和 `Project`、`ProjectInput` 等模型。在 `api/types.ts` 加别名：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6089":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-104","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**查询键与查询。** 在 `api/queries/keys.ts` 加 `projects` 和 `project(id)`，新建 `api/queries/projects.ts`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6090":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-105","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**Socket。** 在 `api/socket.ts` 处理新事件，并在 `AFFECTS` 中登记新任务种类影响的键：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6091":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-106","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"并把 `keys.projects` 加入重连时作废的列表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6092":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-107","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**视图。** `views/ProjectsView.vue` 是列表：`useProjects()`、`EmptyState`、一组 `AppCard`，以及 `NewProjectDialog`。`views/ProjectView.vue` 是详情页，接收路由参数 `id` 作为 prop：编辑保存在本地草稿里，停止输入 800 ms 后 `PUT` 保存，`onDeactivated` 与 `onBeforeUnmount` 时也保存；进行中的渲染从 jobs store 中按 `kind` 和 `request.project` 找到，用 `JobCard` 显示；主要操作放在 `PageFooter`。\"在 Speak 中试听\"一行通过 `handoff.sendRequest()` 交给 Speak。只从 `@/ui` 取组件，只用令牌写样式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6093":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-108","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**路由。** 在 `router.ts` 加路由，`meta.screen` 指向目的地；若它是可记住的上次界面，加入 `SCREENS`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6094":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-109","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**导航与保活。** 在 `App.vue` 的 `nav` 中加一项（图标先加到 `ui/icons.ts`），详情页要每个项目一个实例时把前缀加进 `viewKey`，需要记住为上次界面时加进 `lastScreen` 的监听：","locale":"zh-CN"},"6095":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-110","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"**文字与测试。** 在 `en.ts` 和 `zh-CN.ts` 加 `nav.projects` 和 `projects.*`；名字可能很长的行加 `min-width: 0`（必要时登记到 `layout.test.ts`）。运行 `python scripts/dev.py test-web`（vitest + `vue-tsc`）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6096":{"id":"/docs/development-webui-111","page_id":"/docs/development-webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development-webui#新增一个界面以项目为例","content":"测试的写法和 CI 见测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6097":{"id":"/docs/development","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"page","content":"开发文档","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/development","locale":"zh-CN"},"6098":{"id":"/docs/development-0","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development","content":"面向贡献者的入口：Mizuoto 由哪几部分组成、以什么为准，以及各开发页面分别讲什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6099":{"id":"/docs/development-1","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#以什么为准","content":"以什么为准","locale":"zh-CN"},"6100":{"id":"/docs/development-2","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"一个环境，一个进程","locale":"zh-CN"},"6101":{"id":"/docs/development-3","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"页面","locale":"zh-CN"},"6102":{"id":"/docs/development-4","page_id":"/docs/development","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/development#几条贯穿全局的约定","content":"几条贯穿全局的约定","locale":"zh-CN"},"6103":{"id":"/docs/development-5","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development","content":"这一部分写给想修改 Mizuoto 的人：修 bug、接入新引擎、加一个训练方法、加一个页面或一条 API。它描述代码现在**是什么样**、遵守哪些规则以及为什么，而不是使用方法（使用方法见使用教程和命令行）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6104":{"id":"/docs/development-6","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#以什么为准","content":"**代码**及其测试：其他任何内容与它们冲突时，以它们为准。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6105":{"id":"/docs/development-7","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#以什么为准","content":"**本站的开发文档**：实现后的设计、规则及其原因，每个领域一页；引擎参考每个引擎一页（复现了上游的哪些行为、\n有哪些偏差、训练器以及对照结果）。改动某个领域前先读对应页面；设计有变化时同步修改它，中英文都要改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6106":{"id":"/docs/development-8","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#以什么为准","content":"**`AGENTS.md`**（仓库根目录，`CLAUDE.md` 指向它）：给贡献者和编码代理的简短工作记录：代码地图、不能破坏的规则、工作流程，\n以及哪一页讲什么。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6107":{"id":"/docs/development-9","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"Mizuoto 0.2 是装进同一个 Python 环境的一个发行包。每个引擎（Qwen3-TTS、F5-TTS、OmniVoice、CosyVoice、GPT-SoVITS、VoxCPM、Fish Speech、IndexTTS，以及内部使用的 Whisper 语音识别）都在 Mizuoto 里基于它自己的运行时实现，**在服务器自己的进程里**运行。没有上游代码，没有 transformers，没有引擎专用环境，也没有 worker 进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6108":{"id":"/docs/development-10","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"发行包","locale":"zh-CN"},"6109":{"id":"/docs/development-11","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"6110":{"id":"/docs/development-12","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"6111":{"id":"/docs/development-13","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"`mizuoto`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6112":{"id":"/docs/development-14","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"`mizuoto/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6113":{"id":"/docs/development-15","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"核心、API、命令行、Web UI（构建产物 `dist/` 随 wheel 发布）、运行时、通用构件，以及所有采用宽松许可证的引擎","locale":"zh-CN"},"6114":{"id":"/docs/development-16","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"`mizuoto-fishspeech`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6115":{"id":"/docs/development-17","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"`packages/native/fishspeech/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6116":{"id":"/docs/development-18","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"Fish Speech，采用 Fish Audio Research License","locale":"zh-CN"},"6117":{"id":"/docs/development-19","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"`mizuoto-indextts`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6118":{"id":"/docs/development-20","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"`packages/native/indextts/`","locale":"zh-CN"},"6119":{"id":"/docs/development-21","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"IndexTTS，采用 bilibili Model Use License","locale":"zh-CN"},"6120":{"id":"/docs/development-22","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"两个需要接受许可的引擎单独发布，只是因为它们的许可证。它们装进同一个环境，通过 Python 入口点组 `mizuoto.engines` 自行注册。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6121":{"id":"/docs/development-23","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#一个环境一个进程","content":"决定代码放在哪里的边界如今在包内部：**`mizuoto/core` 从不在模块顶层导入 torch**，`mizuoto/core/inference` 是它通往模型代码（`mizuoto.runtime`、`mizuoto.nn`、`mizuoto.engines`、`mizuoto.training`）的唯一入口，并且总在函数内部导入。所以 `mizuoto version`、`mizuoto --help` 和核心自己的测试都不加载 torch，一条从不加载模型的命令也从不导入运行时。整体架构就从这条规则讲起。","locale":"zh-CN"},"6122":{"id":"/docs/development-24","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"开发环境\" href=\"/docs/development-setup\" description=\"装好 CPU 版 torch 的 .venv、需要接受许可的引擎、bun，以及 scripts/dev.py 的全部任务。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6123":{"id":"/docs/development-25","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"开发约定\" href=\"/docs/development-conventions\" description=\"代码风格、分层规则、原生代码的规则、一致性要求、测试、文档与提交。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6124":{"id":"/docs/development-26","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"整体架构\" href=\"/docs/development-architecture\" description=\"目录布局与分层规则、Services 的组装、一个合成请求的全过程、设置、事件、任务、错误。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6125":{"id":"/docs/development-27","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"设计参考与决策\" href=\"/docs/development-design\" description=\"设计的来源（ComfyUI、InvokeAI、SD Model Hub、Material Design 3）以及做出的决定和理由。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6126":{"id":"/docs/development-28","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"运行时\" href=\"/docs/development-runtime\" description=\"设备、模型管理器与模型句柄、请求上下文、全局状态规则、LocalEngine、取消、流式和远程引擎。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6127":{"id":"/docs/development-29","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"显存与内存\" href=\"/docs/development-memory\" description=\"阶段、预算、部分加载与权重流式加载、结果不变的显存不足重试、估算与校准。\" />","locale":"zh-CN"},"6128":{"id":"/docs/development-30","page_id":"/docs/development","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/development#页面","content":"<Card title=\"加速\" href=\"/docs/development-acceleration\" description=\"注意力后端、CUDA 图、无同步采样、torc