h-CN"},"7396":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-29","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#模型还没准备好时","content":"都完成后 **合成** 按钮回来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7397":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-30","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"模型取得音色的方式不同，**音色** 部分会列出它支持的几种：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7398":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-31","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"方式","locale":"zh-CN"},"7399":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-32","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"用法","locale":"zh-CN"},"7400":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-33","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"**音色库**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7401":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-34","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"从音色库中选一个音色","locale":"zh-CN"},"7402":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-35","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"**一段音频**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7403":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-36","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"上传或录一段参考音频，克隆它的声音","locale":"zh-CN"},"7404":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-37","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"**预置说话人**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7405":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-38","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"选择模型自带的说话人（如 Qwen3-TTS CustomVoice、CosyVoice 300M SFT）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7406":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-39","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"**描述音色**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7407":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-40","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"用文字描述（Qwen3-TTS VoiceDesign、VoxCPM2），或从固定的属性中选择（OmniVoice）","locale":"zh-CN"},"7408":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-41","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"**自带音色**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7409":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-42","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"不指定音色，模型用自己的声音说话","locale":"zh-CN"},"7410":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-43","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色","content":"换模型后，界面会自动选一个合适的方式：如果之前选的音色库音色适合新模型就保留它，否则依次尝试预置说话人、描述、一段音频。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7411":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-44","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#音色库","content":"选择器中每个音色都带有标记，说明**这个模型**能否、以何种方式使用它：**克隆**、**克隆（无文本）**、**预置说话人**、**设计** 等；需要额外处理时另有 **先识别文本**（参考音频缺少文本，合成前先转写）或 **裁剪以适配**（音频太长，会被截短）。不能使用的音色显示为灰色并附带原因。音色库为空时可以点 **新建音色**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7412":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-45","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#一段音频","content":"把音频拖到 **将音频文件拖放到这里**，或点击选择文件（WAV、FLAC、MP3、M4A、OGG 等）。也可以：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7413":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-46","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#一段音频","content":"点 **录音** 用麦克风录一段，录音时显示 **输入电平**，提示 **参考音频以 3 到 30 秒的清晰语音为佳**；点 **停止并添加** 或 **放弃**。浏览器只在 HTTPS 或本机（localhost）上允许使用麦克风。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7414":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-47","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#一段音频","content":"点 **服务器文件** 选择服务器上的文件（只在服务器本机的浏览器中可用）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7415":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-48","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#一段音频","content":"点 **之前的结果** 选择一个合成结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7416":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-49","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#一段音频","content":"在 **音频中说的内容** 中填写音频的文本。可以点 **识别文本** 让语音识别现在就填好，再自己修改。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7417":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-50","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参考文本与语音识别","content":"多数模型克隆时需要参考音频的文本。文本留空时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7418":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-51","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参考文本与语音识别","content":"**设置 › 语音 › 自动识别没有文本的参考音频** 打开、且已安装语音识别：Mizuoto 先查转写缓存，没有就在合成任务中先转写（计划中显示 **先识别文本**）。音色库音色的转写结果会保存回音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7419":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-52","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参考文本与语音识别","content":"没有语音识别：模型支持无文本克隆时按 **克隆（无文本）** 处理；否则报错，并提示如何安装语音识别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7420":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-53","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参考文本与语音识别","content":"参考音频超出模型允许的时长时，按 **设置 › 语音 › 参考音频对模型来说过长时** 处理：默认 **裁剪以适配**（在限制之前最安静的位置截断，原文本随之作废），也可以改为 **拒绝**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7421":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-54","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#文本","content":"**文本** 框最多 20000 个字符。在框中按 Ctrl+Enter 直接合成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7422":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-55","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#文本","content":"**语言**：**自动识别**，或模型支持的某种语言。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7423":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-56","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#文本","content":"**每行一个结果**：支持批量的模型（Qwen3-TTS、GPT-SoVITS、OmniVoice）才有这个开关；打开后每行文本各生成一个结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7424":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-57","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#文本","content":"停止输入片刻后，文本框下方会显示 Mizuoto 将如何切分长文本（**N 段**，每段一个标签）；如果模型自己处理长文本，则显示 **引擎会自行切分长文本**。段与段之间的停顿由参数 **段间停顿（毫秒）** 决定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7425":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-58","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#风格","content":"模型支持指令或情感时才显示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7426":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-59","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#风格","content":"**怎么说**：一句风格指令，例如“开心地，稍快一些”（Qwen3-TTS 1.7B CustomVoice、CosyVoice 2 和 3、CosyVoice 300M Instruct）。有些模型只在某类音色下遵循指令（CosyVoice 2 和 3 需要参考音频，CosyVoice 300M Instruct 需要预置说话人）；用其他音色时这一栏变灰，并说明需要哪类音色。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7427":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-60","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#风格","content":"情感（IndexTTS-2 和 2.5）有三种给法，按模型支持的显示：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7428":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-61","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#风格","content":"**情感权重**：每种情感一个 0–1 的滑块（**高兴**、**愤怒**、**悲伤**、**恐惧**、**厌恶**、**忧郁**、**惊讶**、**平静**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7429":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-62","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#风格","content":"**来自音频**：一段 **情感参考音频**，只借用它的情感，不借用它的音色；**强度** 0–2。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7430":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-63","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#风格","content":"**文字描述**：在 **描述情感** 中用文字写出来。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7431":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-64","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参数","content":"**参数** 部分只列出这个模型接受的参数；不动的参数不会发送，由引擎使用自己的默认值。引擎特有的选项收在 **引擎选项** 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7432":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-65","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参数","content":"**种子**：留空表示 **每次使用新的种子**；填一个数则 **保持这个种子**，同样的输入会得到同样的结果。骰子按钮 **随机一个种子**，解锁按钮回到每次新种子。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7433":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-66","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#参数","content":"**输出**：**格式**（WAV、FLAC、MP3、OGG、M4A）、**采样率**（**模型原生**，或 16–48 kHz）和 **音量均衡**（**峰值**、**响度**、**不处理**）。默认值来自 **设置 › 语音**。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7434":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-67","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#预设","content":"点 **预设** 打开菜单：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7435":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-68","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#预设","content":"列表中的预设点一下即应用（标有 **默认** 或 **所有模型**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7436":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-69","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#预设","content":"**另存为预设…**：填 **预设名称**；勾选 **仅用于 模型名** 则保存全部参数，否则只保存通用参数，适用于所有模型（含有引擎选项的预设只能用于当前模型）。勾选 **选中此模型时自动应用** 则设为该模型的默认预设。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7437":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-70","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#预设","content":"**管理预设…**：**设为默认**、**取消默认**、删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7438":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-71","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#预设","content":"选中一个模型时，界面自动应用它的默认预设；所选音色有自己的默认预设时优先用音色的。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7439":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-72","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#计划合成与流式播放","content":"**计划**：不真正合成，只显示 **将要执行的操作**：模型、音色方式、语言、设备、分段数、发送的参数、每段参考音频（以及是否 **先识别文本**）和 **提示**。参数不合适时在这里就会报错。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7440":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-73","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#计划合成与流式播放","content":"**合成**：提交一个合成任务。任务卡片显示在页面底部，完成后结果出现在 **结果** 中。有多个任务时，它们收成一行 **… 个任务**，显示运行中和排队的数量（**… 个运行中 · … 个排队**）、总体进度和一个全部取消的按钮；展开后在可滚动的列表中显示每个任务的卡片。默认跨所有引擎和设备一次只运行一个合成任务，其余任务按顺序排队，显示 **等待其他合成任务**（**设置 › 计算 › 同时运行的合成任务**）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7441":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-74","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#计划合成与流式播放","content":"**流式**：打开这个开关（位于 **计划** 和 **合成** 旁）后，**合成** 会边生成边播放。悬停可以看到当前模型的方式：CosyVoice 在首批词语生成后即开始播放；其他引擎每句生成好就播放；或由 Mizuoto 拆分文本，每段生成好就播放。播放条显示 **已播放 … · 已就绪 …**，可以 **停止**。模型跟不上时播放会暂停等待，不会丢掉语音；完整的结果照样保存在 **结果** 中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7442":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-75","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**结果** 列出本次在合成页生成的语音。每条显示文本、时长、波形（点击跳转）、模型、耗时、实时率（RTF）和种子，以及警告和许可声明。右侧菜单：","locale":"zh-CN"},"7443":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-76","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"操作","locale":"zh-CN"},"7444":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-77","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"作用","locale":"zh-CN"},"7445":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-78","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**收藏** / **取消收藏**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7446":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-79","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"在历史中可以只看收藏","locale":"zh-CN"},"7447":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-80","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**下载**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7448":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-81","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"下载文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"7449":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-82","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**在文件夹中显示**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7450":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-83","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"只在服务器本机的浏览器中出现","locale":"zh-CN"},"7451":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-84","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**用作参考音频**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7452":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-85","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"把这条结果作为 **一段音频** 的参考，文本一并填入","locale":"zh-CN"},"7453":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-86","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**保存为音色**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7454":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-87","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"输入 **新音色的名称**，把它存进音色库","locale":"zh-CN"},"7455":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-88","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**用这些设置重新运行**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7456":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-89","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"把生成它的模型、音色、文本和参数载回合成页","locale":"zh-CN"},"7457":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-90","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"**删除**","locale":"zh-CN"},"7458":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-91","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"删除这条结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"7459":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-92","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#结果","content":"结果多于一条时，**全部下载** 打包下载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7460":{"id":"/docs/guide-speak-93","page_id":"/docs/guide-speak","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-speak#命令行","content":"`mizuoto speak --help` 列出所有选项（`--describe`、`--attr`、`--emotion-audio`、`--batch`、`--use-preset` 等），完整参考见命令参考。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7461":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","type":"page","content":"工具","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto 文档","使用教程"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-tools","locale":"zh-CN"},"7462":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-0","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools","content":"工具页：用 CosyVoice 把录音换成另一个音色，用 F5-TTS 替换录音中的部分词句。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7463":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-1","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-tools#音色转换","content":"音色转换","locale":"zh-CN"},"7464":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-2","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide-tools#语音编辑","content":"语音编辑","locale":"zh-CN"},"7465":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-3","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools","content":"**工具** 页有两个标签页：**音色转换** 和 **语音编辑**。两者都以一段已有的录音为输入，结果和合成结果一样出现在页面下方的 **结果** 中（也出现在历史中），菜单操作相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"7466":{"id":"/docs/guide-tools-4","page_id":"/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide-tools#音色转换","content":"**用另一个音色说出录音里的话，保留原话和节奏。** 需要支持音色转换的模型：