设置","content":"界面打开后直接进入 **合成** 页，试用之前不需要做任何设置。下载真正的模型之前，值得看一眼两项设置：","locale":"zh-CN"},"8000":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-13","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼设置","content":"**设置 › 下载 › 下载来源**：模型从哪里下载（**Hugging Face**、**hf-mirror.com**、**ModelScope**；在中国大陆，后两者通常更快）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8001":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-14","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼设置","content":"**设置 › 计算**：本机的显卡和正在使用的 torch 构建，不合适时给出安装正确构建的命令（与 `mizuoto doctor` 的检查相同）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8002":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-15","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#看一眼设置","content":"要立即下载，见下面第 5 步或首次运行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8003":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-16","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"演示引擎随 Mizuoto 自带，不需要下载，也不需要 torch，它用音调代替语音，但走的是和真实引擎完全相同的流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8004":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-17","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"在左侧导航栏打开 **合成**（界面默认就在这里）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8005":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-18","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"在 **模型** 中选择 **Dummy voice**（带 **演示** 标记）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8006":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-19","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"在 **音色** 中选择 **预置说话人**，**说话人** 选 `alto`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8007":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-20","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"在 **文本** 中输入任意内容。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8008":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-21","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示引擎合成","content":"点页面底部的 **合成**（或在文本框中按 Ctrl+Enter）。","locale":"zh-CN"},"8009":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-22","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#用演示