s":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Fish Speech (`fish-audio-research@2026-03-07`), IndexTTS (`bilibili-model-use@2025-09-09`)","locale":"en"},"8857":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-116","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"The engine is a distribution of its own (`mizuoto-fishspeech`, `mizuoto-indextts`); downloading models and shared files, and synthesis, need the licence accepted first: **Accept the licence** in **Models** › **Engines**, or `mizuoto engine accept-licence <id>`. `mizuoto engine licence <id>` prints the full text","locale":"en"},"8858":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-117","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Non-commercial weights","locale":"en"},"8859":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-118","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"F5-TTS","locale":"en"},"8860":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-119","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"The pretrained weights are CC-BY-NC-4.0; nothing to accept, but results are tagged and carry a notice","locale":"en"},"8861":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-120","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Not for training other engines","locale":"en"},"8862":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-121","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Fish Speech, IndexTTS (`trains_others = false`)","locale":"en"},"8863":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines-122","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-engines","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-engines#licences","content":"Their results cannot be added to another engine's training datasets","lo