},"9428":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-49","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#the-agent-the-machine-with-the-engines","content":"`--ssl-keyfile`","locale":"en"},"9429":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-50","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#the-agent-the-machine-with-the-engines","content":"`remote.agent.ssl_keyfile`","locale":"en"},"9430":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-51","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#the-agent-the-machine-with-the-engines","content":"none","locale":"en"},"9431":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-52","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#the-agent-the-machine-with-the-engines","content":"The certificate's private key","locale":"en"},"9432":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-53","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#the-agent-the-machine-with-the-engines","content":"The agent uses that machine's own data folder (settings, models, cache), as `mizuoto webui` there would; set `MIZUOTO_DATA_DIR` to give it another one. It runs the engines in its own process.","locale":"en"},"9433":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-54","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#the-agent-the-machine-with-the-engines","content":"On its first start without a token the agent makes a random one, saves it as `remote.agent.token` and prints it:","locale":"en"},"9434":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-55","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#the-agent-the-machine-with-the-engines","content":"The second line lists the engines available there. Later starts reuse the saved token; to see it again, open that machine's `settings.toml` (`mizuoto config path`).","locale":"en"},"9435":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-56","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#the-agent-the-machine-with-the-engines","content":"Listening beyond this machine without TLS, the agent warns:","locale":"en"},"9436":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-57","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#the-agent-the-machine-with-the-engines","content":"The agent runs in the foreground until Ctrl+C. Its idle unloading and GPU memory handling follow that machine's settings (`compute.*`, `engines.<id>.*`). A port in use stops it with a hint to choose another `--port`.","locale":"en"},"9437":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-58","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#the-agent-the-machine-with-the-engines","content":"Licence-gated engines (Fish Speech, IndexTTS): install their package (`mizuoto-fishspeech`, `mizuoto-indextts`) on the agent and accept the licence there before downloading models (`mizuoto engine accept-licence <id>`), and accept it on the host before synthesizing.","locale":"en"},"9438":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-59","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"Argument or option","locale":"en"},"9439":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-60","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"9440":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-61","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"`NAME`","locale":"en"},"9441":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-62","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"A short name, used in engine devices (`gpu-box/cuda:0`); not empty, without `/` or `.`","locale":"en"},"9442":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-63","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"`ADDRESS`","locale":"en"},"9443":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-64","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"The agent's `host` or `host:port` (port 7870 by default); IPv6 as `[::1]:7870`","locale":"en"},"9444":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-65","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"`--token`","locale":"en"},"9445":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-66","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"The agent's token. Left out when changing a host, the saved one is kept","locale":"en"},"9446":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-67","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"`--tls`","locale":"en"},"9447":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-68","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"The agent serves TLS","locale":"en"},"9448":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-69","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"`--ca-file`","locale":"en"},"9449":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-70","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"A CA bundle, or the agent's own certificate when it is self-signed","locale":"en"},"9450":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-71","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"`--json`","locale":"en"},"9451":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-72","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"Print JSON","locale":"en"},"9452":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-73","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"The host is contacted at once: online, the command prints the agent's machine name, Mizuoto version, devices and installed engines; unreachable, the host is saved anyway and its state (`offline` or `refused`) is shown.","locale":"en"},"9453":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-74","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"**Settings** › **Remote hosts** › **Add a host**: fill in **Name**, **Address** and **Token**, turn on **TLS** and give the **CA file on this machine** when needed, then **Add**. When changing a host, leave **Token** empty to keep the saved one.","locale":"en"},"9454":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-75","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"Each host shows its state (**Online**, **Offline**, **Refused**), **Devices**, **Installed engines** and **Used by**; **Check again** reconnects at once.","locale":"en"},"9455":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-76","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"State","locale":"en"},"9456":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-77","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"Meaning","locale":"en"},"9457":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-78","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"`online`","locale":"en"},"9458":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-79","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"The handshake succeeded","locale":"en"},"9459":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-80","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"`offline`","locale":"en"},"9460":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-81","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"Unreachable (address, port, firewall, or no agent running), or TLS on one side only","locale":"en"},"9461":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-82","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"`refused`","locale":"en"},"9462":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-83","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#adding-a-host","content":"Reachable, but the token is wrong or the protocol versions differ","locale":"en"},"9463":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-84","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#moving-an-engine-to-a-host","content":"Setting it directly works too: `mizuoto config set engines.qwen3tts.device gpu-box/cuda:0`. `--device` is the device as the agent names it (`auto`, `cuda:0`, `cpu`) and cannot contain `/`. When the engine is not available on the agent, the command says so: `(not available there: on gpu-box, mizuoto doctor qwen3tts)`.","locale":"en"},"9464":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-85","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#moving-an-engine-to-a-host","content":"**Models** › **Engines**: in the engine card's **Device**, pick a device of the remote host (shown as `host · device`).","locale":"en"},"9465":{"id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote-86","page_id":"/en/docs/advanced-remote","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/advanced-remote#moving-an-engine-to-a-host","content":"An engine on a remote host is marked **On gpu-box** (the host's name) on its engine card and model rows, with the hints **Its packages are gpu-box’s: mizuoto doctor qwen3tts 