type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#speech","content":"**Cut it to fit** (at the quietest point before the limit; its transcript is dropped), or **Refuse it**","locale":"en"},"15327":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-74","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#speech","content":"**Refuse parameters a model does not take**","locale":"en"},"15328":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-75","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#speech","content":"off","locale":"en"},"15329":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-76","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#speech","content":"**Off: drop them with a warning.** On: refuse the request. A value out of range is always refused","locale":"en"},"15330":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-77","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#speech","content":"**Run waiting requests together**","locale":"en"},"15331":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-78","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#speech","content":"on","locale":"en"},"15332":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-79","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#speech","content":"See below","locale":"en"},"15333":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-80","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#speech","content":"**Run waiting requests together**: requests for the same model and voice that differ only in their text run as one batch, on engines that take one (Qwen3-TTS, GPT-SoVITS, OmniVoice). Only one-segment requests without a seed qualify: just before calling the engine, the running job takes the queued jobs with exactly the same settings along, makes them in one go and stores each one's result; if the batch fails, those jobs go back to the queue to run on their own. Requests with a seed are never joined, since a batch draws random numbers differently. Rendering a project relies on this to go faster.","locale":"en"},"15334":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-81","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"Setting","locale":"en"},"15335":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-82","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"15336":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-83","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"What it does","locale":"en"},"15337":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-84","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"**Training device**","locale":"en"},"15338":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-85","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"**The engine’s device**","locale":"en"},"15339":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-86","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"Or the CPU or one GPU. **A fine-tune takes the device for itself while it runs**","locale":"en"},"15340":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-87","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"**Training precision**","locale":"en"},"15341":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-88","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"**Automatic**","locale":"en"},"15342":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-89","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"**Automatic**, `fp32`, `fp16`, `bf16`","locale":"en"},"15343":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-90","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"**Checkpoints kept per run**","locale":"en"},"15344":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-91","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"3","locale":"en"},"15345":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-92","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"**Speak a preview after training**","locale":"en"},"15346":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-93","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"on","locale":"en"},"15347":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-94","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#training","content":"**The export stage tries what was trained on a dataset clip**","locale":"en"},"15348":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-95","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#downloads","content":"Setting","locale":"en"},"15349":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-96","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#downloads","content":"Default","locale":"en"},"15350":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-97","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#downloads","content":"What it does","locale":"en"},"15351":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-98","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#downloads","content":"**Download source**","locale":"en"},"15352":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-99","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#downloads","content":"**Hugging Face**","locale":"en"},"15353":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-settings-100","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-settings","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-settings#downloads","content":"**H