and reference.","locale":"en"},"15478":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","type":"page","content":"Tools","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto Documentation","Guides"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-tools","locale":"en"},"15479":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-0","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools","content":"The Tools screen: say a recording in another voice with CosyVoice, and replace words in a recording with F5-TTS.","locale":"en"},"15480":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-1","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"Convert voice","locale":"en"},"15481":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-2","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"Edit speech","locale":"en"},"15482":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-3","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools","content":"**Tools** has two tabs: **Convert voice** and **Edit speech**. Both start from an existing recording; their results appear under **Results** at the bottom of the page (and in History), with the same menu as in Speak.","locale":"en"},"15483":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-4","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"**Say what a recording says in another voice, keeping its words and timing.** It needs a model with voice conversion: CosyVoice (300M, 300M SFT, 2, 3).","locale":"en"},"15484":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-5","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#convert-voice","content":"Choose a CosyVoice model under **Model**. The picker lists only models that convert voices; when the model is not ready, the button at the bottom offers the step it still needs first, such as the download (see Speak).","locale":"en"},"15485":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-6","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-t