:{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-15","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"Under **Changes**, fill in **The whole text after the edit**: everything the recording should say once edited. The easy way: click **Transcribe** to transcribe the recording, then change the words you replace. The model reads this text.","locale":"en"},"15495":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-16","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"Mark each part to replace:","locale":"en"},"15496":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-17","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"**From (s)** and **To (s)**: where the replaced speech is in the recording;","locale":"en"},"15497":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-18","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"**New words**: what this part says now (for the record; the model goes by the whole text above);","locale":"en"},"15498":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-19","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"**Length (s)**: how long the new speech lasts; empty (**Automatic**) keeps the span's length.","locale":"en"},"15499":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-20","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"**Add a change** adds a row; the button at the end of a row removes it. Only rows with a start and an end, the end after the start, are sent.","locale":"en"},"15500":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-21","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"Click **Edit** at the bottom.","locale":"en"},"15501":{"id":"/en/docs/guide-tools-22","page_id":"/en/docs/guide-tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/guide-tools#edit-speech","content":"