on#uninstalling","content":"If you need none of the data, delete the data folder. **Careful**: it holds your voice library, results, projects and training data. With Docker: `docker volume rm mizuoto-data`.","locale":"en"},"16002":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","type":"page","content":"Quick start","breadcrumbs":["Mizuoto Documentation","Getting started"],"tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/quick-start","locale":"en"},"16003":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-0","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start","content":"From nothing to the first spoken sentence: install, start, check the settings, Speak with the dummy engine, then a real engine.","locale":"en"},"16004":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-1","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/quick-start#install-mizuoto","content":"Install Mizuoto","locale":"en"},"16005":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-2","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/quick-start#start-the-web-ui","content":"Start the web UI","locale":"en"},"16006":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-3","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/quick-start#check-the-settings","content":"Check the settings","locale":"en"},"16007":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-4","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/quick-start#speak-with-the-dummy-engine","content":"Speak with the dummy engine","locale":"en"},"16008":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-5","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/quick-start#switch-to-a-real-engine","content":"Switch to a real engine","locale":"en"},"16009":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-6","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/quick-start#the-same-from-the-command-line","content":"The same from the command line","locale":"en"},"16010":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-7","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/en/docs/quick-start#next","content":"Next","locale":"en"},"16011":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-8","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start","content":"This page takes the shortest path. Installation and First run have the details of each step.","locale":"en"},"16012":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-9","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#install-mizuoto","content":"You need Python 3.10–3.13. Install torch 2.8 or newer first, in the build for your hardware, then Mizuoto from PyPI:","locale":"en"},"16013":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-10","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#install-mizuoto","content":"The torch builds for AMD, Intel, Apple silicon and the CPU, installing from source and Docker are in Installation.","locale":"en"},"16014":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-11","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#start-the-web-ui","content":"When the server is ready the terminal prints `SERVER_READY url=http://127.0.0.1:7869`, and a browser opens that address a moment later. The default port is **7869**, and only this machine can connect by default. Press Ctrl+C to stop the server.","locale":"en"},"16015":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-12","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#check-the-settings","content":"The UI opens on **Speak**; nothing has to be set up before you try it. Two settings are worth a look before downloading a real model:","locale":"en"},"16016":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-13","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#check-the-settings","content":"**Settings › Downloads › Download source**: where models come from (**Hugging Face**, **hf-mirror.com**, **ModelScope**; the last two are often faster in mainland China).","locale":"en"},"16017":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-14","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#check-the-settings","content":"**Settings › Compute**: this computer's GPUs and the torch build in use, with the command to install the right build when it does not fit (the same check as `mizuoto doctor`).","locale":"en"},"16018":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-15","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#check-the-settings","content":"To download now, see step 5 below or First run.","locale":"en"},"16019":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-16","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#speak-with-the-dummy-engine","content":"The dummy engine ships with Mizuoto: nothing to download, and it needs no torch. It speaks in tones instead of words, but goes through exactly the same steps as a real engine.","locale":"en"},"16020":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-17","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#speak-with-the-dummy-engine","content":"Open **Speak** in the navigation (the UI starts there).","locale":"en"},"16021":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-18","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#speak-with-the-dummy-engine","content":"Under **Model**, choose **Dummy voice** (marked **demo**).","locale":"en"},"16022":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-19","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#speak-with-the-dummy-engine","content":"Under **Voice**, choose **Preset speaker**, and `alto` as the **Speaker**.","locale":"en"},"16023":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-20","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#speak-with-the-dummy-engine","content":"Type anything under **Text**.","locale":"en"},"16024":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-21","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#speak-with-the-dummy-engine","content":"Click **Speak** at the bottom of the page (or press Ctrl+Enter in the text box).","locale":"en"},"16025":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-22","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#speak-with-the-dummy-engine","content":"A job card appears at the bottom of the page; when it is done the result is listed under **Results**. Click its play button.","locale":"en"},"16026":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-23","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#switch-to-a-real-engine","content":"Open the **Model** picker and choose a real model, for example **Qwen3-TTS 1.7B CustomVoice**. Models that are not ready carry badges such as **Not downloaded** or **Not available**, but can still be chosen.","locale":"en"},"16027":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-24","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#switch-to-a-real-engine","content":"The **Speak** button at the bottom is replaced by the one step the model still needs, here **Download Qwen3-TTS 1.7B CustomVoice (size)**. Click it and wait for the progress bar. (When torch is missing, it shows the command that installs it instead.)","locale":"en"},"16028":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-25","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#switch-to-a-real-engine","content":"When the download is done the **Speak** button is back. Pick a **Preset speaker**, optionally write an instruction under **Style** › **How to say it** (such as \"Cheerfully, a little faster\"), and click **Speak**.","locale":"en"},"16029":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-26","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#switch-to-a-real-engine","content":"Downloads are jobs: you can leave the page and follow them under **Jobs** at the top right. The first synthesis loads the model; the next ones are much faster.","locale":"en"},"16030":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-27","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#next","content":"Clone your own voice: Voices.","locale":"en"},"16031":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-28","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#next","content":"What each option of Speak does: Speak.","locale":"en"},"16032":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-29","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#next","content":"Read a whole book or a dialogue with several voices: Projects.","locale":"en"},"16033":{"id":"/en/docs/quick-start-30","page_id":"/en/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/quick-start#next","content":"An NVIDIA GPU that is not used, or slow downloads: First run and the FAQ.","locale":"en"}},"count":16033},"sorting":{"language":"multilingual","sortableProperties":["content","page_id","type","url"],"sortablePropertiesWithTypes":{"content":"string","page_id":"string","type":"string","url":"string"},"sorts":{"content":{"docs":{"1":9168,"2":9783,"3":13560,"4":15536,"5":12639,"6":13750,"7":15754,"8":15394,"9":13259,"10":12795,"11":15035,"12":13295,"13":12551,"14":12723,"15":14760,"16":12199,"17":9172,"18":12975,"19":12563,"20":3776,"21":12981,"22":13558,"23":10715,"24":3428,"25":12732,"26":3430,"27":10202,"28":3432,"29":12727,"30":3437,"31":14761,"32":5394,"33":12976,"34":3435,"35":15070,"36":10203,"37":13934,"38":13033,"39":12698,"40":14922,"41":7630,"42":3337,"43":14835,"44":10889,"45":3357,"46":15518,"47":7986,"48":3343,"49":15329,"50":8437,"51":3345,"52":13866,"53":10791,"54":3355,"55":13747,"56":9838,"57":3349,"58":14600,"59":7680,"60":3339,"61":12931,"62":12051,"63":3372,"64":15884,"65":7697,"66":4384,"67":12555,"68":11846,"69":4299,"70":13292,"71":10267,"72":3351,"73":13296,"74":10399,"75":3368,"76":13160,"77":8182,"78":3366,"79":15299,"80":11790,"81":3359,"82":13652,"83":10433,"84":3370,"85":15957,"86":10667,"87":3353,"88":15629,"89":9420,"90":3347,"91":12796,"92":14656,"93":14671,