ost every weight streams from RAM (least memory, slowest). On Apple silicon models always load whole (its memory is shared with the system). UI: **Settings** › **Compute** › **Memory**"],[1252,"`auto`/`normal`：放得下时整体加载，否则部分加载；`high`：只整体加载；`low`：权重最多占用 GPU 显存的一半，给其他模型留空间；`none`：几乎所有权重都从内存流式加载（最省显存，最慢）。Apple 芯片上模型总是整体加载（其内存与系统共用）。界面：**设置** › **计算** › **内存**"],[10746,"`Backend`, `Constraints`, `Call`, the registry and its per-device probes"],[2729,"`Backend`、`Constraints`、`Call`、注册表及其按设备的探测"],[14065,"`BASE_URL` (`api/baseUrl.ts`) is derived from the running script's URL: everything before the last `/assets/` is the deployment root. No API address is compiled in, so the UI works under `api_prefix` unchanged. Routing uses hash history, so any sub-path works without server-side rewrites."],[6048,"`BASE_URL`（`api/baseUrl.ts`）由运行中脚本的 URL 推出：最后一个 `/assets/` 之前的部分就是部署根。不编译进任何 API 地址，所以挂在 `api_prefix` 下也无需改动。路由用 hash 历史，任何子路径都不需要服务端改写。"],[6305,"`base`"],[6637,"`base`"],[14322,"`base`"],[14654,"`base`"],[14822,"`base`, `custom_voice`, `custom_voice_lite`, `voice_design`"],[6805,"`base`、`custom_voice`、`custom_voice_lite`、`voice_design`"],[5351,"`bind()`"],[13368,"`bind()`"],[6010,"`breakpoints.ts`"],[14027,"`breakpoints.ts`"],[11166,"`build_services()` in `mizuoto/core/context.py` builds every service in dependency order and returns the `Services` dataclass:"],[11228,"`build_services(start_background=True)`, kept on `app.state.services`; routes get it through `ServicesDep`"],[3211,"`build_services(start_background=True)`，存在 `app.state.services`；路由通过 `ServicesDep` 取得"],[13237,"`build` (Ubuntu, Python 3.11, uv; bun for Mizuoto's web UI): `build_wheels.py host` and/or `build_wheels.py native <id>…`, only what is released; `twine check dist/*`; `dist/` is uploaded as the `dist` artifact."],[13268,"`build` lays the installed catalogue models and shared assets out under `OUT` (hard links where possible), checks each file against its pinned size and SHA-256 (`--no-verify`: sizes only),