meterError`, `ReferenceInvalidError`, `LanguageError`"],[2996,"`CapabilityError`、`ParameterError`、`ReferenceInvalidError`、`LanguageError`"],[10909,"`capture(fn, state, pool)` runs `fn` once first (lazy initialisation), puts back the tensors it changes (`state`) and the generator, then captures it. It calls `capture_begin`/`capture_end` itself: `torch.cuda.graph`'s `gc.collect()` and `empty_cache()` cost tens of milliseconds per capture, and a 24-layer step is 25 captures."],[2892,"`capture(fn, state, pool)` 先运行一次 `fn`（惰性初始化），恢复它改动的张量（`state`）和生成器，然后捕获。它自己调用 `capture_begin`/`capture_end`：`torch.cuda.graph` 的 `gc.collect()` 和 `empty_cache()` 每次捕获要花几十毫秒，而一个 24 层的步骤要捕获 25 次。"],[10739,"`causal` is SDPA's `is_causal`: aligned top-left. Sites pass it as upstream passed `is_causal` (CosyVoice's streamed-text steps feed several tokens over a cache with it). Bottom-right causality, a KV cache's, comes through `mask_info`."],[2722,"`causal` 即 SDPA 的 `is_causal`：左上对齐。调用点按上游传 `is_causal` 的方式传它（CosyVoice 的流式文本步骤会借助它在缓存上一次送入多个 token）。右下对齐的因果关系（KV 缓存的情形）通过 `mask_info` 表达。"],[10868,"`causal`: aligned bottom-right (query *i* sees key *j* when `j ≤ i + n_k − n_q`); `window`: `j > i' − window`."],[2851,"`causal`：右下对齐（查询 *i* 能看到键 *j* 当 `j ≤ i + n_k − n_q`）；`window`：`j > i' − window`。"],[14248,"`CausalMaskedDiffWithDiT`: a 22-layer DiT"],[6231,"`CausalMaskedDiffWithDiT`：22 层 DiT"],[14242,"`CausalMaskedDiffWithXvec`: causal U-Net"],[6225,"`CausalMaskedDiffWithXvec`：因果 U-Net"],[13366,"`check_cancel()`, `cancelled()`"],[5349,"`check_cancel()`、`cancelled()`"],[11152,"`check_native_package`, which each gated package's `test_<id>_package.py` calls for itself: `packages/native/*/mizuoto_*` follow the engines' rule (and may import their own package), leave the process state alone and compute attention only through `mizuoto.runtime.accel`."],[3135,"`check_native_package`，由每个需要接受许可的包的 `test_<id>_package.py` 对自己调用：`packages/native/*/mizuoto_*` 遵守引擎的规则（另可导入自己的包），不改变进程状态，注意力只经 `mizuoto.runtime.accel` 计算。"],[13558,"`check_oom_retry` makes one layer inside a phase run out of memory the first time it is called: the phase runs again with more weights streamed, and the result must be exactly the undisturbed one."],[5541,"`check_oom_retry` 让阶段里的某一层第一次调用时内存不足：阶段以更多权重流式加载的方式重新运行，结果必须与未受干扰时完全相同。"],[5587,"`check_rng.py --device cuda:0`"],[13604,"`check_rng.py --device cuda:0`"],[13556,"`check_streamed` runs a tiny engine at three device sizes (every unit streamed, half, everything resident) and compares with the plain CPU sample for sample."],[5539,"`check_streamed` 在三种设备大小下（每个单元都流式加载、一半、全部常驻）运行小型引擎，与普通 CPU 上的结果逐采样比较。"],[5589,"`check_tokenizer.py <model>`"],[13606,"`check_tokenizer.py <model>`"],[5454,"`check`"],[13471,"`check`"],[13270,"`check` lists, with HEAD requests, which catalogue files the published mirror lacks."],[5253,"`check` 用 HEAD 请求列出已发布的镜像缺少哪些目录文件。"],[8425,"`check`: find missing files"],[408,"`check`：检查缺少的文件"],[6443,"`checkpoints.py`"],[14460,"`checkpoints.py`"],[13236,"`checks`: `ci.yml` itself, called as a reusable workflow, for what the push changed (a version file checks its distribution; a tag or a manual run, everything). CI's own run of the same push to `main` skips its jobs, so nothing runs twice."],[5219,"`checks`：把 `ci.yml` 本身作为可复用工作流调用，检查这次推送改动的内容（版本文件检查它所属的发行包；标签或手动触发检查全部）。CI 自己对同一次推送到 `main` 的运行会跳过它的作业，所以不会重复运行。"],[3809,"`close()`"],[11826,"`close()`"],[105,"`code`"],[2981,"`code`"],[3314,"`code`"],[8122,"`code`"],[10998,"`code`"],[11331,"`code`"],[6366,"`codec.py`"],[6531,"`codec.py`"],[6664,"`codec.py`"],[14383,"`codec.py`"],[14548,"`codec.py`"],[14681,"`codec.py`"],[3961,"`cold`"],[11978,"`cold`"],[3069,"`commands/*.py`"],[11086,"`commands/*.py`"],[5575,"`compare.py <engine…> [--a reference] [--b native]`"],[13592,"`compare.py <engine…> [--a reference] [--b native]`"],[10900,"`Compiled` is a plain attribute, not a submodule: state dicts and handles are unchanged."],[2883,"`Compiled` 是普通属性而不是子模块：状态字典和句柄都不变。"],[14915,"`Compiled`: one hot module under `torch.compile` when `compute.compile` is on"],[6898,"`Compiled`：开启 `compute.compile` 时，用 `torch.compile` 编译一个热点模块"],[272,"`compute_changed`"],[8289,"`compute_changed`"],[145,"`compute_unavailable`"],[2628,"`compute_unavailable`"],[3009,"`compute_unavailable`"],[3378,"`compute_unavailable`"],[8162,"`compute_unavailable`"],[10645,"`compute_unavailable`"],[11026,"`compute_unavailable`"],[11395,"`compute_unavailable`"],[3409,"`compute_unavailable` 的 `detail[\"reason\"]` 区分 `out_of_memory` 与 `no_device`。任务 worker 的进程退出码另有约定（`codes.EXIT_*`）：`EXIT_RETRY = 75` 表示请求重跑，`EXIT_CANCELLED = 130` 表示已取消。"],[1271,"`compute.async_offload`"],[2308,"`compute.async_offload`"],[9288,"`compute.async_offload`"],[10325,"`compute.async_offload`"],[2693,"`compute.attention = auto`"],[10710,"`compute.attention = auto`"],[2696,"`compute.attention = sdpa` / `math`"],[10713,"`compute.attention = sdpa` / `math`"],[2360,"`compute.attention_strict`"],[2764,"`compute.attention_strict`"],[10377,"`compute.attention_strict`"],[10781,"`compute.attention_strict`"],[2356,"`compute.attention`"],[2755,"`compute.attention`"],[10373,"`compute.attention`"],[10772,"`compute.attention`"],[10716,"`compute.attention`, `engines.<id>.attention`, `training.attention`"],[2699,"`compute.attention`、`engines.<id>.attention`、`training.attention`"],[13827,"`compute.attention=fast` without flash-attn installed is SDPA everywhere, so its audio is identical. With it, F5-TTS has no padded half-precision call for FlashAttention. GPT-SoVITS v4's DiT gives one row of key lengths for its guided batch of two, which flash-attn refused (`seqlens_k must have shape (batch_size)`) until the backend expanded the lengths to the query's batch; it now takes those 704 calls."],[13776,"`compute.attention=fast`, flash-attn 2.8.3"],[5759,"`compute.attention=fast`，flash-attn 2.8.3"],[2352,"`compute.compile`"],[5796,"`compute.compile`"],[10369,"`compute.compile`"],[13813,"`compute.compile`"],[9320,"`compute.compile` (off by default; **Settings** › **Compute** › **Compile models (torch.compile)**) runs the heaviest module of some engines through `torch.compile`:"],[10722,"`compute.compile` (off)"],[14573,"`compute.compile` on a CPU in fp32: the s2mel DiT's warm time drops 7 %, BigVGAN's 20 %; the audio stays within 6.1e-5 of eager (87.7 dB)."],[14351,"`compute.compile` wraps the DiT or UNetT in `torch.compile(dynamic=True)`. On a CPU in fp32 with 8 threads the transformer's warm time drops 23 % (a request from 60 to 45 s); the first request pays about 30 s of compilation; the audio stays within 9.2e-5 of eager (89 dB). The CPU allocator and thread placement of `compute.cpu_allocator` and `compute.cpu_threads` make F5-TTS 10–20 % faster on Linux without changing a result."],[14286,"`compute.compile` wraps the flow estimator. On the CPU it gains nothing (the U-Net's convolutions and products are already library kernels); the mel stays within 5.7e-6 of eager, which HiFT's F0-driven source amplifies to about 1e-2 in the audio (47 dB), as eager with another thread count also does."],[14492,"`compute.compile` wraps v4/v5's CFM estimator (each SoVITS loaded, a voice's own too): 7 % faster warm on the CPU, within 3.1e-5 of eager (87 dB)."],[6269,"`compute.compile` 包装 flow 估计器。在 CPU 上没有收益（U-Net 的卷积和矩阵乘法已经是库内核）；mel 与 eager 相差不超过 5.7e-6，HiFT 由 F0 驱动的源把它放大到音频中约 1e-2（47 dB），换一个线程数的 eager 运行也会如此。"],[6475,"`compute.compile` 包装 v4/v5 的 CFM 估计器（每个加载的 SoVITS，包括音色自己的）：在 CPU 上预热后快 7 %，与即时执行相差不超过 3.1e-5（87 dB）。"],[6334,"`compute.compile` 用 `torch.compile(dynamic=True)` 包装 DiT 或 UNetT。在 CPU 上以 fp32、8 线程运行时，transformer 预热后的耗时下降 23 %（一个请求从 60 秒降到 45 秒）；第一个请求要付出约 30 秒的编译时间；音频与 eager 的差异在 9.2e-5 以内（89 dB）。`compute.cpu_allocator` 和 `compute.cpu_threads` 的 CPU 分配器与线程绑定，能让 F5-TTS 在 Linux 上快 10–20 %，且不改变任何结果。"],[13091,"`compute.compile`, fp32, 8 threads; time of the compiled module, warm:"],[5074,"`compute.compile`，fp32，8 线程；被编译模块预热后的耗时："],[2705,"`compute.compile`（关）"],[1303,"`compute.compile`（默认关，界面为 **设置** › **计算** › **编译模型（torch.compile）**）用 `torch.compile` 编译部分引擎最耗时的模块："],[1355,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[2332,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[2931,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[9372,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[10349,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[10948,"`compute.cpu_allocator`"],[12170,"`compute.cpu_allocator` and `compute.cpu_threads` (Acceleration)"],[4153,"`compute.cpu_allocator` 和 `compute.cpu_threads`（加速）"],[10707,"`compute.cpu_allocator`, `compute.cpu_threads` (`auto`)"],[2690,"`compute.cpu_allocator`、`compute.cpu_threads`（`auto`）"],[1358,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[2336,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[2934,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[9375,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[10353,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[10951,"`compute.cpu_threads`"],[1292,"`compute.cuda_allocator`"],[2328,"`compute.cuda_allocator`"],[9309,"`compute.cuda_allocator`"],[10345,"`compute.cuda_allocator`"],[12033,"`compute.cuda_allocator` (`native`, `async`: cudaMallocAsync, `expandable`: expandable segments; `auto` is `native`) is set by the host in `PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF` before CUDA is first used, never by engine code, and handed to training stages in their environment (`allocator_env`), whether or not the host has loaded a model. A value the environment already sets wins; a change applies at the next start. Under `async` no CUDA graphs are captured (`graphs.usable`): the stream-ordered allocator frees a capture's warm-up temporaries in a way that made replays fault with an illegal memory access."],[4016,"`compute.cuda_allocator`（`native`；`async`：cudaMallocAsync；`expandable`：可扩展段；`auto` 即 `native`）由主机在第一次使用 CUDA 之前写入 `PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF`，从不由引擎代码设置，并通过环境传给训练阶段（`allocator_env`），无论主机是否已加载模型。环境中已设置的值优先；修改在下次启动时生效。在 `async` 下不捕获 CUDA Graph（`graphs.usable`）：这种按流排序的分配器释放捕获预热时的临时张量的方式，曾使重放因非法内存访问而出错。"],[1283,"`compute.cuda_graphs`"],[2324,"`compute.cuda_graphs`"],[9300,"`compute.cuda_graphs`"],[10341,"`compute.cuda_graphs`"],[10701,"`compute.cuda_graphs` (on)"],[2684,"`compute.cuda_graphs`（开）"],[1207,"`compute.default_device`"],[2272,"`compute.default_device`"],[9224,"`compute.default_device`"],[10289,"`compute.default_device`"],[1210,"`compute.devices`"],[2268,"`compute.devices`"],[9227,"`compute.devices`"],[10285,"`compute.devices`"],[2364,"`compute.fast`"],[2673,"`compute.fast`"],[2737,"`compute.fast`"],[10381,"`compute.fast`"],[10690,"`compute.fast`"],[10754,"`compute.fast`"],[9358,"`compute.fast` (**Settings** › **Compute** › **Acceleration**) turns on GPU speed switches for the whole process, after ComfyUI's `--fast`: `tf32`, `fp16_accumulation`, `cudnn_benchmark` and `sdpa_reduced_precision`. Each changes results slightly. They take effect when Mizuoto next starts, and outputs list them (`params.fast`). Measured on an RTX 3090, all four made VoxCPM, F5-TTS, IndexTTS 1.5, Fish Speech, CosyVoice 3 and GPT-SoVITS v4 1.1–1.3× faster, while `fp16_accumulation` made GPT-SoVITS v2 about 5 % slower (v4 6–9 % faster) and `tf32` left GPT-SoVITS's speed alone (measured again on a quiet GPU, alternating with the default: an earlier 1.3–1.6× slowdown was other work on the machine)."],[13820,"`compute.fast` (all four flags)"],[10719,"`compute.fast` (none)"],[1341,"`compute.fast`（**设置** › **计算** › **加速**）为整个进程开启 GPU 提速开关，参照 ComfyUI 的 `--fast`：`tf32`、`fp16_accumulation`、`cudnn_benchmark` 和 `sdpa_reduced_precision`。每一项都会使结果略有不同。它们在下次启动 Mizuoto 时生效，输出会记录它们（`params.fast`）。在 RTX 3090 上测量，四项全开使 VoxCPM、F5-TTS、IndexTTS 1.5、Fish Speech、CosyVoice 3 和 GPT-SoVITS v4 快 1.1–1.3 倍，而 `fp16_accumulation` 使 GPT-SoVITS v2 慢约 5 %（v4 快 6–9 %），`tf32` 不影响 GPT-SoVITS 的速度（在空闲 GPU 上与默认设置交替重测：之前测得的慢 1.3–1.6 倍来自机器上的其他工作）。"],[5803,"`compute.fast`（全部四个开关）"],[2702,"`compute.fast`（无）"],[1235,"`compute.gpu_jobs`"],[2344,"`compute.gpu_jobs`"],[3299,"`compute.gpu_jobs`"],[9252,"`compute.gpu_jobs`"],[10361,"`compute.gpu_jobs`"],[11316,"`compute.gpu_jobs`"],[1265,"`compute.host_copies`"],[2300,"`compute.host_copies`"],[9282,"`compute.host_copies`"],[10317,"`compute.host_copies`"],[1238,"`compute.inference_jobs`"],[2348,"`compute.inference_jobs`"],[3302,"`compute.inference_jobs`"],[9255,"`compute.inference_jobs`"],[10365,"`compute.inference_jobs`"],[11319,"`compute.inference_jobs`"],[2717,"`compute.kv_cache = static`"],[10734,"`compute.kv_cache = static`"],[12032,"`compute.kv_cache = static` gives the Qwen-family caches (Qwen3-TTS, CosyVoice 2/3) preallocated buffers that double when full (`BufferCache`): no per-step concatenation, no transient copy, less fragmentation. Attention reads views with the buffer's strides, which some kernels sum in another order. Identical on the CPU; opt-in until it is checked identical on a GPU."],[12632,"`compute.kv_cache = static` is identical on CUDA and no faster (Qwen3-TTS 1.28 → 1.30 s, CosyVoice 3 0.95 → 0.95 s), with the same peak: `dynamic` stays the default."],[4615,"`compute.kv_cache = static` 在 CUDA 上结果相同，但并不更快（Qwen3-TTS 1.28 → 1.30 秒，CosyVoice 3 0.95 → 0.95 秒），峰值也相同：默认仍为 `dynamic`。"],[4015,"`compute.kv_cache = static` 让 Qwen 系列的缓存（Qwen3-TTS、CosyVoice 2/3）写入预分配的缓冲区，满了就翻倍（`BufferCache`）：没有每步拼接，没有临时拷贝，碎片更少。注意力读取的是带缓冲区步长的视图，某些内核会以另一种顺序求和。在 CPU 上结果相同；在 GPU 上验证结果相同之前一直需要主动开启。"],[1280,"`compute.kv_cache`"],[2320,"`compute.kv_cache`"],[9297,"`compute.kv_cache`"],[10337,"`compute.kv_cache`"],[1268,"`compute.max_pinned_mb`"],[2304,"`compute.max_pinned_mb`"],[9285,"`compute.max_pinned_mb`"],[10321,"`compute.max_pinned_mb`"],[1223,"`compute.max_resident_models`"],[2280,"`compute.max_resident_models`"],[9240,"`compute.max_resident_models`"],[10297,"`compute.max_resident_models`"],[11672,"`compute.max_resident_models` caps resident models across engines (default 3), the least recently used idle model going first"],[3655,"`compute.max_resident_models` 全局限制常驻模型数（默认 3），最久未用的空闲模型先卸载"],[1277,"`compute.oom_fallback`"],[2316,"`compute.oom_fallback`"],[9294,"`compute.oom_fallback`"],[10333,"`compute.oom_fallback`"],[1274,"`compute.oom_retry`"],[2312,"`compute.oom_retry`"],[9291,"`compute.oom_retry`"],[10329,"`compute.oom_retry`"],[1262,"`compute.ram_reserve_mb`"],[2296,"`compute.ram_rese