r import) declare `dependencies=[LocalDep]` and fail with 403 `not_local`. Server paths must also lie within `paths.browse_roots`; that check is in the core."],[2972,"`is_local(request)` 的含义是\"服务器本机上的浏览器\"：客户端地址是回环地址，**并且**请求的主机名也是回环名。同一台机器上的隧道或反向代理也从回环地址连进来，但会转发公网的 `Host`，所以不算本地。需要本地的路由（列出服务器目录、按服务器路径登记音频、`/models/identify`、`/models/import`、`reveal`、`POST /voices/{id}/weights`、`/engines/{id}/ops/{op}`、数据集的文件夹导入）用 `dependencies=[LocalDep]` 声明，失败时是 403 `not_local`。服务器路径还要求位于 `paths.browse_roots` 之内，这一层检查在核心层。"],[13331,"`is_oom(error)`: whether an exception means a device ran out of memory, without importing torch."],[5314,"`is_oom(error)`：一个异常是否表示设备内存不足，不导入 torch。"],[2048,"`job cancel {job_id}`"],[10065,"`job cancel {job_id}`"],[2039,"`job list`"],[10056,"`job list`"],[2045,"`job log {job_id}`"],[10062,"`job log {job_id}`"],[2051,"`job retry {job_id}`"],[10068,"`job retry {job_id}`"],[2042,"`job show {job_id}`"],[10059,"`job show {job_id}`"],[8274,"`job_id`, `offset`, `lines` (at most 50; read the rest over REST)"],[257,"`job_id`、`offset`、`lines`（最多 50 行，其余用 REST 读取）"],[256,"`job_log`"],[8273,"`job_log`"],[14077,"`job_log` goes to the open log viewers (`onJobLog(jobId, listener)`); an event holds at most 50 lines, the rest come over REST."],[6060,"`job_log` 分发给打开的日志查看器（`onJobLog(jobId, listener)`）；每个事件最多 50 行，其余通过 REST 获取。"],[11093,"`job_progress(services)`: subscribes to the same EventBus and draws job progress as a Rich bar on stderr; `finish(job)`"],[3076,"`job_progress(services)`：订阅同一个 EventBus，把任务进度画成 stderr 上的 Rich 进度条；`finish(job)`"],[254,"`job_updated`"],[8271,"`job_updated`"],[14073,"`job_updated` goes into the jobs store (`upsert` drops a snapshot older than the state it holds) and into `keys.job(id)`; when a job finishes, the `AFFECTS` table invalidates the lists its kind changes, e.g. `project_render` → `keys.projects`, `train` → experiments, voices, models and outputs."],[6056,"`job_updated` 进入 jobs store（`upsert` 丢弃比已有状态更旧的快照），写入 `keys.job(id)`；任务结束时按 `