at32 ones) and peaks at 5 GB resident; the export holds the merged weights, 9 GB, beside the mapped checkpoint (page cache)."],[6481,"`training.memory`：speech 阶段在加载说话人模型之前释放 HuBERT；semantic 阶段只把 SoVITS 的 SSL 投影和量化器放到设备上。"],[6389,"`training.memory`：上游的逐层检查点保持原样；在 `bf16-true` 下，LoRA 层直接把检查点自己的 bfloat16 张量当作冻结的权重（从 safetensors 文件内存映射，不复制：数值相同），导出的键顺序从一个在 meta 设备上构建的模型中读取。在 S2 Pro 上实测（2026-10-19，RTX 3090）：训练阶段的进程加载时只占 0.4 GB 自有内存（用 bfloat16 副本时为 8.9 GB，用 float32 副本时为 17 GB），常驻峰值 5 GB；导出阶段持有合并后的权重 9 GB，另有映射的检查点（页缓存）。"],[6776,"`training.memory`：对 MiniCPM 各层、局部编码器和 DiT 做梯度检查点，结果完全相同（重放 LoRA dropout 和 CFM 的抽样）；VAE 的解码器不放到设备上；对 LoRA，`low` 以自动混合精度的类型存放冻结的线性层权重（CUDA），`lowest` 从内存流式载入它们（在 CPU 上结果相同）。"],[6694,"`training.memory`：对 talker 和 code predictor 的层做梯度检查点，结果相同；`lowest` 把 AdamW 的状态放在内存里（在那里是 float32）。"],[6340,"`training.memory`：对 transformer 的块做梯度检查点，结果相同；`low` 把 EMA 副本放在内存里；`lowest` 把 AdamW 的状态也放进去（CPU 上相同）。"],[6277,"`training.memory`：对语言模型或 flow 的各个块做梯度检查点，损失和权重都相同。"],[2495,"`training.precision`"],[10512,"`training.precision`"],[2511,"`training.previews`"],[10528,"`training.previews`"],[633,"`training`"],[8650,"`training`"],[10163,"`training`"],[2146,"`training`：训练"],[14223,"`TransformerLM`: Conformer text encoder + transformer, Whisper's vocabulary"],[6206,"`TransformerLM`：Conformer 文本编码器 + transformer，Whisper 的词表"],[7978,"`trash/`"],[15994,"`trash/`"],[2426,"`trim`"],[10443,"`trim`"],[1284,"`true`"],[2208,"`true`"],[2313,"`true`"],[2325,"`true`"],[2382,"`true`"],[2418,"`true`"],[2442,"`true`"],[2452,"`true`"],[2512,"`true`"],[9301,"`true`"],[10225,"`true`"],[10330,"`true`"],[10342,"`true`"],[10399,"`true`"],[10435,"`true`"],[10459,"`true`"],[10469,"`true`"],[10529,"`true`"],[8669,"`True` (as the server)"],[652,"`True`（与服务器相同）"],[2421,"`tts.asr_model`"],[10438,"`tts.asr_model`"],[2417,"`tts.auto_transcribe`"],[10434,"`tts.auto_transcribe`"],[2401,"`tts.default_model`"],[10418,"`tts.default_model`"],[2429,"`tts.max_text_chars`"],[10446,"`tts.max_text_chars`"],[2441,"`tts