le model off a GPU before a fine-tune there (`release_device`), and after a job fails for running out of memory unloads every model not in use from every GPU (`ComputeService.release_after_oom`, ComfyUI's `unload_all_models`). See Runtime."],[10681,"Acceleration"],[13641,"Acceleration and speed work keep to the same tiers: an acceleration that changes bits (compilation, for one) stays at least within the engine's T1/T3 tolerance, with the measured error recorded; speed work on the default path must not change a bit."],[11700,"Accepting a licence is also required to download the weights and assets; the full text ships with the package and the command line can show it"],[8025,"Access control"],[8190,"Access control has three refusals of its own: `bad_host` (400), `bad_origin` (403) and `auth_required` (401)."],[9127,"Access token"],[10230,"Access token: once set, every API and socket request must carry it"],[10244,"Access tokens, the origin check and the Host check are described in HTTP API."],[15001,"Action"],[15460,"Action"],[10606,"Add `--help` at any level; a group name alone (such as `mizuoto model`) shows that group's help too. Every level accepts `--debug`."],[14108,"Add `keys.projects` to the lists invalidated on reconnect."],[9986,"Add a folder of clips in a known layout"],[9853,"Add a model folder from elsewhere (an earlier download, a fine-tune). When its file sizes match a catalogue model, it is checked by SHA-256 and imported as that model; otherwise it becomes a user model `<engine>/<name>`."],[9767,"Add a model's preset speaker to the library"],[9785,"Add a reference clip"],[9823,"Add a voice from a zip written by `voice export`"],[9723,"Add a voice from reference clips; missing transcripts come from speech recognition."],[8215,"Add a voice's fine-tuned weights from server paths"],[9989,"Add audio files or folders (a `.lab` or `.txt` beside a clip is its text), a voice's references or outputs"],[9953,"Add chapters and lines from a script; new speaker na