n as before (with one warning). Applies to models loaded afterwards"],[10697,"Feature"],[10877,"Feature"],[15803,"Feature"],[14421,"Few-shot cloning and voice fine-tuning (RVC-Boss/GPT-SoVITS, MIT). Code: `mizuoto/engines/gptsovits`. On the CPU in fp32 with the same seed it is identical to Mizuoto 0.1 (upstream's `TTS_infer_pack.TTS` behind its adapter) in all 15 parity cases, and its trainer writes upstream's preparation files and weights identically. User-facing details: Engines in depth."],[8789,"few-shot cloning from 3–10 s, a voice's own weights"],[8980,"Few-shot cloning from a 3–10 s clip, and the classic fine-tuning path: a voice can have its own GPT and SoVITS weights, switched in per request. Best for: a voice of your own trained on a few minutes of recordings."],[15855,"few-shot cloning, a voice's own GPT and SoVITS weights"],[8241,"Field"],[8318,"Field"],[11167,"Field"],[11755,"Field"],[13890,"Field"],[11831,"Fields"],[11082,"File"],[13206,"File"],[14019,"File"],[11278,"Files a request names (references, voice caches, weights) cross once by SHA-256 (`have` / `put`, 8 MB parts); the agent keeps them in `cache/remote/files` and prunes those unused for 30 days. The folder a `prepare_voice` writes comes back file by file. The agent beats every 5 s."],[14971,"Files are downloaded into `.part` files and resume after an interruption; each finished file is checked against its size and SHA-256."],[8517,"Files are hard-linked where possible, else copied; each is checked against its manifest, and an incomplete or mismatching model is skipped with the reason."],[8536,"Files downloaded at once"],[10404,"Files downloaded at once (1–8)"],[8477,"Files several models of an engine share (GPT-SoVITS's encoders and text front-end data; IndexTTS-2/2.5's w2v-BERT, semantic codec, CAM++ and BigVGAN; CosyVoice's text normalisation grammars) are shared files, kept in `<models folder>/_assets/<engine>/<name>/` with an `asset.json`."],[14973,"Files several models of an engine share