se). The port is under the same licence, so it ships as a distribution of its own, `mizuoto-fishspeech` (`packages/native/fishspeech`, package `mizuoto_fishspeech`, with `LICENSE.md`), registered under the entry-point group `mizuoto.engines` (`fishspeech = mizuoto_fishspeech:FishSpeechEngine`). Downloading the model and speaking need the licence accepted. On the CPU in fp32 with the same seed its codes and audio are identical to upstream's seeded `generate_long` as Mizuoto 0.1 ran it, and its trainer gives 0.1's exported model bit for bit. User-facing details: Engines in depth."],[9059,"Fish Audio S2 Pro: a dual-autoregressive model trained on about ten million hours in some fifty languages. Best for: expressive cloning, free-form inline tags such as `[laughing]`, and dialogue between speakers."],[1042,"Fish Audio S2 Pro：双自回归模型，约一千万小时、五十种左右语言的训练数据。适合：富有表现力的克隆、自由形式的行内标签（如 `[laughing]`）和多说话人对话。"],[6354,"Fish Audio S2 Pro（fishaudio/fish-speech，Fish Audio Research License）。移植版同样受该许可约束，所以作为单独的发行包发布：`mizuoto-fishspeech`（`packages/native/fishspeech`，包名 `mizuoto_fishspeech`，附 `LICENSE.md`），注册在入口点组 `mizuoto.engines` 下（`fishspeech = mizuoto_fishspeech:FishSpeechEngine`）。下载模型和合成都需要先接受许可。在 CPU 上以 fp32、相同种子运行时，它的编码和音频与 Mizuoto 0.1 所运行的上游带种子 `generate_long` 完全相同，训练器导出的模型与 0.1 逐位相同。面向用户的说明见 引擎详解。"],[734,"Fish Speech"],[824,"Fish Speech"],[4052,"Fish Speech"],[4932,"Fish Speech"],[5921,"Fish Speech"],[6344,"Fish Speech"],[6824,"Fish Speech"],[7535,"Fish Speech"],[7852,"Fish Speech"],[8751,"Fish Speech"],[8841,"Fish Speech"],[12069,"Fish Speech"],[12949,"Fish Speech"],[13938,"Fish Speech"],[14361,"Fish Speech"],[14841,"Fish Speech"],[15552,"Fish Speech"],[15868,"Fish Speech"],[8856,"Fish Speech (`fish-audio-research@2026-03-07`), IndexTTS (`bilibili-model-use@2025-09-09`)"],[8806,"Fish Speech (`fishspeech`)"],[10922,"Fish Speech (`mizuoto_fishspeech/generate.py`)"],[13030,"Fish Speech (6 GB)"],[9175,"Fish Speech (Fish Audio Research License) and IndexTTS (bilibili Model Use License) need their licence accepted before their models and shared files are downloaded, or they synthesize (exit code 5, HTTP 403). Read it, then:"],[11608,"Fish Speech and IndexTTS are distributions of their own (`mizuoto-fishspeech`, `mizuoto-indextts`), installed into the same environment and registered under the entry-point group `mizuoto.engines`"],[8406,"Fish Speech and IndexTTS are in the image only when it was built with `--build-arg GATED=1`; otherwise their cards say **Not available** (`mizuoto-fishspeech` or `mizuoto-indextts` missing). Even then, their licence must be accepted before downloading their models or speaking:"],[14939,"Fish Speech and IndexTTS are ports of code whose licences (the Fish Audio Research License, the bilibili Model Use License) also cover the port. They are therefore separate distributions, `mizuoto-fishspeech` and `mizuoto-indextts`, each shipping its licence, installed into the same environment and registered under the entry-point group `mizuoto.engines`. Their manifests ship with `mizuoto`, so the catalogue and the licence text are there before the distribution is installed. They follow the same rules as the built-in engines and import nothing from another engine."],[4128,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[4191,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[4462,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[4623,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[12145,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[12208,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[12479,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[12640,"Fish Speech clone-en"],[12539,"Fish Speech clone-en, bf16"],[4522,"Fish Speech clone-en，bf16"],[14983,"Fish Speech results show \"Built with Fish Audio\" beneath them, and cannot be used as training data for other engines."],[4967,"Fish Speech S2 Pro"],[5047,"Fish Speech S2 Pro"],[12984,"Fish Speech S2 Pro"],[13064,"Fish Speech S2 Pro"],[4692,"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA"],[12709,"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA"],[12258,"Fish Speech S2 Pro LoRA (2 steps): 207.4 s before the CPU rounds, 172–173 s after round 1, 128.5–130.6 s after round 2 (training stage 146.8 → 83 