ult → opt-in):"],[15645,"Low"],[15646,"Lowest"],[6011,"M3 的窗口尺寸分级：compact（\\< 600px）、medium（\\< 840px）、expanded（\\< 1200px）、large（\\< 1600px）、extra-large"],[14028,"M3's window size classes: compact (\\< 600px), medium (\\< 840px), expanded (\\< 1200px), large (\\< 1600px), extra-large"],[1125,"macOS"],[2161,"macOS"],[7955,"macOS"],[9142,"macOS"],[10178,"macOS"],[15971,"macOS"],[5183,"macOS arm64"],[13200,"macOS arm64"],[8931,"Main capabilities"],[9097,"Main capabilities"],[9942,"Main options"],[9975,"Main options"],[10009,"Main options"],[8056,"Main routes"],[8420,"Maintaining a mirror"],[9937,"Make a preset its model's default"],[13369,"Makes the context the running thread's request; layers then call the module-level `check_cancel()` without being handed it"],[8479,"Manage them on their own in **Models** › **Shared files**, or:"],[9587,"Many commands also take `--json`, which prints JSON in the shape the HTTP API returns; the tables list it. Arguments written `{name}` are required, `[name]` optional. Repeatable options (`--ref`, `-p`…) may be given several times. `key=value` values are parsed as JSON (numbers, `true`/`false`), else taken as text."],[8796,"many languages, voices from attributes, its own voice"],[13146,"Many versions are **pinned** (`pypinyin==0.55.0`, `opencc==1.4.2`, `inflect==7.3.1`…): the engines' output depends on them, and another version changes phones and audio"],[11969,"Mark"],[15495,"Mark each part to replace:"],[15004,"Mark it, for the **Favourites** filter"],[13529,"Marker"],[12173,"masked positions add exact zeros, and the CPU's SDPA gives the same bits for any cut at a multiple of 64 (every length up to 3100, bf16 and fp32, batch 1 and 2)"],[10792,"Masks"],[11506,"Material Design 3 in layers"],[14003,"Material Design 3 layers"],[3489,"Material Design 3 的分层"],[5986,"Material Design 3 的分层"],[14880,"max abs error ≤ 1e-5 × max(1, ‖ref‖∞), cosine ≥ 0.99999"],[13624,"Max abs error ≤ 1e-5 × max(1, ‖ref‖∞); cosine ≥ 0.99999"],[4956,"MB"],[12973