,"Note"],[8430,"Notes"],[9469,"Notes"],[11773,"Notes"],[13134,"Notes"],[13847,"nothing"],[12746,"nothing compiled"],[13422,"Nothing refuses a model on an estimate of GPU memory: it always tries to load, and only a real allocation failure is an error. When a job fails for running out of memory (after the exact retries), `ComputeService.release_after_oom` unloads every model not in use from every GPU (ComfyUI's `unload_all_models`); models on the CPU stay. How components share a device below this level is in Memory."],[12043,"nothing: each recipe exactly"],[13187,"numpy ports with integer semantics"],[11148,"numpy, torch"],[11136,"numpy, torch, safetensors, and the optional attention packages flash_attn, flash_attn_interface, xformers, sageattention, sageattn3 (imported on demand inside `runtime/accel` only)"],[11145,"numpy, torch, safetensors, tokenizers, sentencepiece, tiktoken, soxr, yaml, inflect, regex, and the text front ends' packages (pypinyin, rjieba, jieba, opencc, wordsegment, budoux, fasttext, ToJyutping, fugashi, pyopenjtalk, jamo, mecab)"],[11139,"numpy, torch, soxr"],[3131,"numpy、torch"],[3119,"numpy、torch、safetensors，以及可选的注意力包 flash_attn、flash_attn_interface、xformers、sageattention、sageattn3（只在 `runtime/accel` 里按需导入）"],[3128,"numpy、torch、safetensors、tokenizers、sentencepiece、tiktoken、soxr、yaml、inflect、regex，以及各文本前端的包（pypinyin、rjieba、jieba、opencc、wordsegment、budoux、fasttext、ToJyutping、fugashi、pyopenjtalk、jamo、mecab）"],[3122,"numpy、torch、soxr"],[13193,"NVIDIA (CUDA)"],[10838,"NVIDIA (sm ≥ 8.0), head dims 64/96/128"],[10844,"NVIDIA Blackwell (sm ≥ 10.0), more than 1024 queries"],[2827,"NVIDIA Blackwell（sm ≥ 10.0），查询超过 1024 个"],[5176,"NVIDIA（CUDA）"],[2821,"NVIDIA（sm ≥ 8.0），头维度 64/96/128"],[8532,"off"],[8553,"off"],[8569,"off"],[8572,"off"],[8575,"off"],[9295,"off"],[10783,"off"],[15295,"off"],[15328,"off"],[732,"OmniVoice"],[776,"OmniVoice"],[1004,"OmniVoice"],[4920,"OmniVoice"],[4979,"OmniVoice"],[5062,"OmniVoice"],[5909,"OmniVoice"],[6563,"OmniVoice"],[681