cence-gated engines)"],[8849,"The licence-gated engines are distributions of their own because of their licences; they register themselves with Mizuoto when installed in the same environment. Their models still need the licence accepted (below)."],[13147,"The licence-gated packages bring a few of their own: `mizuoto-fishspeech` needs tokenizers and safetensors, `mizuoto-indextts` sentencepiece. Each also names the packages it imports directly that Mizuoto already brings (torch and numpy; `mizuoto-indextts` also pyyaml and tiktoken), with Mizuoto's bounds, so its dependencies do not rest on Mizuoto's."],[11701,"The licences cover the weights; a reader must have the text in front of them before accepting"],[14976,"The licences of Fish Speech (Fish Audio Research License) and IndexTTS (bilibili Model Use License) restrict their use. Each is a distribution of its own (`mizuoto-fishspeech`, `mizuoto-indextts`, see Installation), and downloading its models and shared files and speaking both need the licence accepted first."],[15164,"The line's takes, the one in use marked ✓; click one to use it"],[15084,"The list"],[15689,"The list"],[14999,"The list loads 50 at a time; at the bottom, **Load more** loads the next."],[15576,"The LJSpeech layout"],[8072,"The loaded models, unloading them, the checks of `mizuoto doctor`"],[8639,"The loaded models: `status()`, `unload(model_id)`, `doctor(engine_id)`"],[13349,"The loaded-models list, `meta.memory` and its `partial` report"],[9332,"the local DiT"],[10899,"the local DiT"],[10026,"The losses the stages reported (first, last and lowest of each)"],[15782,"The main button of **Speak**, **Tools** and other screens stays at the bottom of the page, with the jobs started there and any error. An error shows the **Reason** and **What to do**, with **Details** to expand and a **Copy** button."],[15622,"The main settings (epochs, learning rate…) can be changed here; **More settings, and the advanced ones, are on the experiment’s page.**"],[